rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A spell or ability that asks for a sacrifice will not trigger this card.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If an opponent destroys Karmic Justice, it will trigger on its own destruction.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Karmic Justice will not trigger if an opponent’s spell or ability causes your permanent to be destroyed indirectly. For example, if the spell caused an ability you control to trigger, and thereby destroy your permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Karmic Justice will not trigger off of its ability destroying a permanent since you destroy the permanent and you are not one of your opponents.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each other player sacrifices a creature for each creature you control that goes to a graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield at one time, this ability triggers once for each creature. This doesn’t matter much, but it can in some cases.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the land produces more than one color of mana at a single time, its controller chooses which of those types is produced by Mana Flare’s ability.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Mana Flare adds one of whatever color the land produces after applying any land type or color changing effects.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Only produces extra mana when land is tapped for mana, not when tapped by some other effect.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a triggered mana ability.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'When used with lands that can produce multiple colors, Mana Flare produces one additional mana of the same color that was produced. It can’t give a mana of a color that wasn’t produced.'}, {'date': '2007-09-16', 'text': 'Does not copy any restrictions on the mana, such as with Mishra’s Workshop or Pillar of the Paruns.'}, {'date': '2007-09-16', 'text': 'Produces only one additional mana, regardless of how much was produced by tapping the land.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have enough mana, the ability may be activated more than once in a turn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You will normally use this during your post-combat main phase so you can untap any creatures that attacked.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, it triggers if at least one opponent controls three or more creatures.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This triggered ability only triggers if your opponent controls 3 or more creatures at the beginning of upkeep. This condition is checked again on resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose how many cards to put onto the battlefield during the resolution after you look through your library. You do not choose as the ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If this card is not on the battlefield at the time it resolves, then you can’t sacrifice it. You still perform the search and put any creature cards you find onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The player gets the option to pay when this triggered ability resolves. This will be after the spell is announced, but before it resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You don’t have to decide whether or not you are drawing until after the player decides whether or not to pay.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The lands are tapped and untapped once each time combat damage is dealt (usually once each turn, but first strike, double strike, and multiple combat phases can change that), not once for each creature that deals combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose an Aura and there isn’t a legal permanent for it to enchant, you put Copy Enchantment into your graveyard. It never enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose an Aura, you also choose a legal permanent for the Copy Enchantment copy of it to enchant. Copy Enchantment doesn’t target that permanent, however, so it can enter the battlefield attached to an untargetable creature.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If you don’t choose an enchantment, Copy Enchantment enters the battlefield without copying anything, and it sits there with a useless ability.'}, {'date': '2006-04-01', 'text': 'If this is copying a Genju, such as Genju of the Fields, and the land this enchants goes to the graveyard, you will return the Copy Enchantment to your hand.'}, {'date': '2006-07-01', 'text': 'Copies all copiable values, to include mana cost, so if you copy Dream Leash, for example, the converted mana cost of Copy Enchantment will be 5.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a creature with bloodthirst while Leyline of Lightning is on the battlefield, you may use the Leyline\'s ability to deal damage to an opponent. If you do, that damage is dealt before the creature spell resolves, and the creature will enter the battlefield with counters from its bloodthirst ability."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A player\\\'s "opening hand" is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player\\\'s opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "While resolving Leyline of Lightning\'s second ability, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to deal damage multiple times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-10-15\', \'text\': \'You can fetch any of the “Snow-Covered” lands, since they all also have the supertype basic.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless any one of your opponents controls more lands than you, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control at least as many lands as each of your opponents by the time it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "You shuffle your library if you search, even if you don\'t put any basic land cards into your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Yes, the opponent draws seven cards. It’s not optional.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, only creatures you control trigger the ability and get the bonus, but your teammate\'s attacking creatures are included in the calculation of those bonuses."}, {\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': \'This ability counts creatures, not creature types. For example, if you attack with five creatures — an Elf Shaman, an Elf Warrior, a Goblin Shaman, an Elemental, and a creature with all creature types — the ability will trigger five times. Those creatures will get +3/+0, +2/+0, +2/+0, +1/+0, and +4/+0, respectively.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The effect is mandatory. You’ll lose 1 life even if you have only 1 life left.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The life loss isn’t a payment. You’ll get a token even if you had 0 life (and another effect is stopping you from losing the game).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Each land you control will have the land types Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. They’ll also have the mana ability of each basic land type (for example, Forests can tap to produce {G}). They’ll still have their other subtypes and abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Giving a land extra basic land types doesn’t change its name or whether it’s legendary or basic.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you have two on the battlefield, they’ll each grant the other one shroud.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sanguine Bond\'s ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Soul Warden or 8 life from Tendrils of Corruption."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Sanguine Bond\'s ability will trigger twice and you may choose a different opponent for each trigger. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers whenever an opponent loses life and causes you to gain life, such as the ability of Exquisite Blood, this will loop until either you win the game or a player takes an action to break the loop. If neither of these happen, the game ends in a draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Sanguine Bond\\\'s ability triggers only once.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The enchanted land loses its existing land types and any abilities printed on it. It now has the land type Island and has the ability to tap to add {U} to its controller’s mana pool. Spreading Seas doesn’t change the enchanted land’s name or whether it’s legendary, basic, or snow.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the mana cost of the revealed card includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the revealed card has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it’s a land card, for example), its converted mana cost is 0.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of the revealed card is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The converted mana cost is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has converted mana cost 5.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If you’re at 0 or less life and Phyrexian Unlife leaves the battlefield, you’ll lose the game (unless some other effect is keeping you from losing).'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If you’re at 0 or less life, you can’t pay any amount of life except 0.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Phyrexian Unlife won’t affect damage that reduces your life total from a positive number to 0 or less. For example, if you’re at 3 life and are dealt 5 damage, you’ll end up at -2 life. The next time you’re dealt damage, it will be dealt as though its source had infect.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'You can still lose the game for other reasons, including having ten or more poison counters or drawing a card from a library with no cards in it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'"You" refers to the controller of Curiosity, which may be different from the controller of the enchanted creature. "An opponent" refers to an opponent of Curiosity\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Any damage dealt by the enchanted creature to an opponent will cause Curiosity to trigger, not just combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Curiosity doesn\'t trigger if the enchanted creature deals damage to a planeswalker or to a battle."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you control Curiosity and it\'s enchanting an opponent\'s creature, you won\'t draw a card when that creature deals damage to you. The creature has to deal damage to one of your opponents for the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You draw one card each time the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, no matter how much damage it deals.\'}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'All of the tokens enter the battlefield simultaneously. They’ll have the same name, color, type and subtype, abilities, power, toughness, and so on.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the effect creating the tokens instructs you to do something with those tokens at a later time, like exiling them at the end of combat, you’ll do that for all the tokens.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the effect is putting more than one kind of token onto the battlefield, it’ll put twice as many of each kind onto the battlefield. For example, if you cast Bestial Menace while controlling Parallel Lives, you’ll put two Snake tokens, two Wolf tokens, and two Elephant tokens onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control two Parallel Lives, then the number of tokens created is four times the original number. If you control three, then the number of tokens created is eight times the original number, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Only spells and abilities that target cards in graveyards will be affected. Abilities that don’t target cards in graveyards (like the one Tormod’s Crypt has) can still affect those cards.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The last ability only works when Ground Seal is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain from extort is based on the total amount of life lost, not necessarily the number of opponents you have. For example, if your opponent’s life total can’t change (perhaps because that player controls Platinum Emperion), you won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The extort ability doesn’t target any player.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You may pay {W/B} a maximum of one time for each extort triggered ability. You decide whether to pay when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'If there are two Primal Vigors on the battlefield, the number of tokens or +1/+1 counters is four times the original number. If there are three on the battlefield, the number of tokens or +1/+1 counters is eight times the original number, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter who controls the tokens or the creature that the +1/+1 counters are being placed on.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Primal Vigor affects permanents that “enter the battlefield with” a certain number of counters. For example, if a creature would normally enter the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it, it will enter with six +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield under your control at the same time, Impact Tremors will trigger that many times. Each of these separate abilities will deal 1 damage to each opponent.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Auras attached to exiled nonland permanents will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on exiled nonland permanents will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If Grasp of Fate leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, no nonland permanents will be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Grasp of Fate\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled cards will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the cards isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'The exiled cards return to the battlefield immediately after Grasp of Fate leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'A player’s “opening hand” is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player’s opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A card\'s mana value is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has mana value 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'All counters with the same name are indistinguishable from other counters with that name. Cards from the Time Spiral block that interact with time counters will interact with As Foretold.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If a spell has no mana cost, its mana value is 0. You can cast it with As Foretold\'s alternative cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If the card has X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it for another cost that doesn\'t include X. For example, if there are five time counters on As Foretold and you choose to use its effect to cast Pull from Tomorrow, X must be 0. X can\'t be 2, even though the spell\'s mana value would be 4."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If you control multiple As Foretolds, you may cast one spell for each of them paying {0}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you\'re casting a split card, only the mana value of the half you\'re casting is compared to the number of time counters on As Foretold. This is because only that half is on the stack at the time that you choose to apply the effect of As Foretold."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell for an alternative cost of {0}, you can\'t pay any other alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as bargain. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, you must pay those to cast the spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Fraying Sanity\'s triggered ability counts the number of cards that were put into the enchanted player\'s graveyard during the turn, even if Fraying Sanity wasn\'t on the battlefield at the time those cards were put there, and even if those cards have left that graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Fraying Sanity\'s triggered ability resolves. For example, if three Fraying Sanity Auras are attached to one player who had four cards put into their graveyard this turn, X will be four for the first ability to resolve, eight for the second, and sixteen for the third."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you somehow control a Kindred Discovery with no chosen creature type, its last ability can\'t trigger, even if a creature with no creature types enters the battlefield or attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Kindred Discovery enters the battlefield. Players can\'t take any actions between the time the choice is made and the time it enters the battlefield. Notably, this means that if it is entering the battlefield at the same time as any creatures of the chosen type, its last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact and supertypes such as legendary can\'t be chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Cat Warrior." A Cat Warrior is both a Cat and a Warrior. It\\\'s affected by anything that affects either type and unaffected by things that affect non-Cat or non-Warrior creatures.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a discarded card isn’t put into your graveyard (due to an effect such as that of Obstinate Baloth) or leaves your graveyard (perhaps because another effect returned it to your hand), it won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness and wish to cast it, Necropotence’s ability won’t exile that card. If you don’t wish to cast it, you choose whether it ends up exiled or in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Necropotence’s last ability creates a delayed triggered ability that will put the exiled card into your hand. That ability still triggers even if Necropotence is removed from the battlefield before your end step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If Rest in Peace is destroyed by a spell, Rest in Peace will be exiled and then the spell will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a card is discarded while Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that function when a card is discarded (such as madness) still work, even though that card never reaches a graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of a discarded card (such as Chandra Ablaze\'s first ability) can find that card in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "While Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that trigger whenever a creature dies won\'t trigger because cards and tokens are never put into a player\'s graveyard."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once you cast Omniscience, if it’s your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast another spell before any player can attempt to remove Omniscience with spells or abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of each spell you cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Knightly Valor tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You need a creature for Knightly Valor to target as you cast it. There’s no way to have it enter the battlefield attached to the Knight token it’ll create.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Dawn of Hope\'s first ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Vicious Rumors or 3 life from Creeping Chill."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Dawn of Hope\'s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Dawn of Hope\\\'s first ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay {2} multiple times to draw more than one card each time you resolve Dawn of Hope\'s triggered ability."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A creature with 0 power can attack, as long as it doesn’t also have defender.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, and that planeswalker leaves the battlefield, that attacking creature can still be blocked. If it’s unblocked, the attacking creature is still attacking. It simply deals no combat damage.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the attacking creature leaves the battlefield before Raid Bombardment’s triggered ability resolves, Raid Bombardment deals 1 damage to the player or planeswalker that creature was attacking before it left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures with power 2 or less, Raid Bombardment’s ability triggers for each of them separately.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The power of the attacking creature is checked only when the ability triggers. Once it triggers, Raid Bombardment will deal 1 damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker even if the creature’s power changes before the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If an opponent is instructed to draw multiple cards, that player draws all of them before deciding how many times to pay for Smothering Tithe’s triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you tap a creature for mana” triggers only if you activate a mana ability of a creature including {T} in its cost. Mana abilities that don’t include the {T} symbol and instead say “Tap an untapped creature you control” or similar won’t cause Leyline of Abundance’s second ability to trigger. Similarly, it won’t trigger if you tap a creature to activate a mana ability of another object (even if that mana ability also includes {T}).'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield under your control simultaneously, you’ll scry 1 for each of those creatures. You won’t look at more than one card from your library at once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Season of Growth’s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Season of Growth’s last ability triggers when you cast a spell that has multiple targets, as long as at least one of those targets is a creature you control. It doesn’t trigger multiple times if you cast a spell that targets a creature you control multiple times or that targets multiple creatures you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Griffin Aerie\'s ability looks at how much life you\'ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained 3 life by the time your end step begins, Griffin Aerie\'s ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You create just one Griffin token, no matter how much life you\'ve gained past 3 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature is entering the battlefield under your control, consider static abilities to determine whether its power is 4 or greater. Spells, activated abilities, and triggered abilities can\'t be used to raise the creature\'s power in time to have Garruk\'s Uprising\'s last ability trigger or to lower it in time to stop it from triggering."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater immediately after Garruk\'s Uprising enters the battlefield, its first ability won\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, you don\'t draw a card. They don\'t have to be the same creature both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once the last ability of Garruk\'s Uprising has triggered, lowering the power of the creature won\'t stop you from drawing a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The first ability of Garruk\'s Uprising has you draw just one card, no matter how many creatures you control with power 4 or greater."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If a creature with trample you control would deal combat damage to a blocking creature while you control Fiery Emancipation, you must assign its unmodified damage. For example, a 3/3 creature with trample blocked by a 2/2 creature can have 2 damage assigned to the blocking creature and 1 damage assigned to the defending player. It will then deal 6 damage to the blocking creature and 3 damage to the defending player.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If an effect asks you to divide damage among targets, you must divide the unmodified damage before tripling it.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If multiple replacement or prevention effects try to modify damage that would be dealt to a permanent or player, the player or the controller of the permanent chooses the order in which they apply.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You sacrifice the creature only if you still control it at end of turn. If that creature has left the battlefield, even if it came back, you don\'t sacrifice it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Doubling Season affects permanents that enter the battlefield with a certain number of counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If there are two Doubling Seasons on the battlefield, then the number of tokens or counters is four times the original number. If there are three on the battlefield, then the number of tokens or counters is eight times the original number, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Planeswalkers will enter the battlefield with double the normal number of loyalty counters. However, if you activate an ability whose cost has you put loyalty counters on a planeswalker, the number you put on isn\'t doubled. This is because those counters are put on as a cost, not as an effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a nonbasic land has an ability that causes it to enter the battlefield tapped, it will lose that ability before it can apply. The same is also true of any other abilities that modify how a land enters the battlefield or apply "as" a land enters the battlefield, such as the first ability of Cavern of Souls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a nonbasic land has an ability that triggers "when" it enters the battlefield, it will lose that ability before it can trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Nonbasic lands will lose any other land types and abilities they had. They will gain the land type Mountain and gain the ability "{T}: Add {R}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'This effect doesn\\\'t affect names or supertypes. It won\\\'t turn any land into a basic land or remove the legendary supertype from a legendary land, and the lands won\\\'t be named "Mountain."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Dragon Mantle tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A player\'s “opening hand” is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player\'s opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A player\\\'s "opening hand" is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player\\\'s opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If your opponent discards a card while you control Leyline of the Void, abilities that check whether a card is discarded (such as Hollow One, or a madness ability of the discarded card) still work, even though that card never reaches that player\'s graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of the discarded card can find that card in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Tokens can still die while Leyline of the Void is on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "While Leyline of the Void is on the battlefield, nontoken creatures your opponents control won\'t die. They\'ll be exiled instead. Abilities that would trigger when those creatures die won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a creature\'s power is less than 0 when it\'s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given Bear Cub, a 2/2 creature, -4/-0 so that it\'s a -2/2 creature, doubling its power and toughness gives it -2/+2, and it becomes a -4/4 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to "double" a creature\\\'s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. Similarly, a creature whose toughness is doubled gets +0/+X, where X is its toughness as the effect begins to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you control more than one Unnatural Growth, each one applies independently. For example, if you control two copies of Unnatural Growth, a 2/2 Bear Cub becomes a 4/4 creature when the first ability resolves and then becomes an 8/8 creature when the second one resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Oversold Cemetery’s ability will check your graveyard as your upkeep begins, before any player has the opportunity to take any actions. If you have fewer than four creature cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won’t trigger at all. If the ability does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you have fewer than four creature cards in your graveyard at that point, the ability won’t have any effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Each additional Hardened Scales you control will increase the number of +1/+1 counters placed on a creature you control by one.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with that many plus one instead.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more effects attempt to modify how many counters would be put on a creature you control, you choose the order to apply those effects, no matter who controls the sources of those effects.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Alarmwache\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen enttappen nicht während der Enttappsegmente ihrer Beherrscher.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, enttappe alle Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der dunkle Wald leuchtete mit tausend Augen, und zum ersten Mal dachte Jurald, dass die Hochfeen mehr als nur ein Mythos sein könnten."\\n—Jenseits des Großen Steinkreises\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a12673d-0b25-4ded-82c5-9b1bfb25b832\', \'multiverseId\': 632512}, \'multiverseid\': 632512}, {\'name\': \'Alarma contra intrusos\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no se enderezan durante los pasos de enderezar de sus controladores.\\nSiempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla, endereza todas las criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El oscuro bosque se iluminó con miles de ojos y, por primera vez, Jurald pensó que quizás las grandes hadas fueran más que un mito".\\n—Más allá del Gran Crómlech\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b52a66-00f4-4f9a-87f4-0a777e6ef4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 632575}, \'multiverseid\': 632575}, {\'name\': "Signal d\'alarme", \'text\': "Les créatures ne se dégagent pas pendant les étapes de dégagement de leurs contrôleurs.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, dégagez toutes les créatures.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La sombre forêt s\'illumina de milliers d\'yeux, et pour la première fois, Jurald envisagea que les Hauts Fæs puissent être plus qu\'un mythe. »\\n—Au-delà du Grand Cromlech", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632638&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9185529-027e-4aad-bade-8cd0df1e0071\', \'multiverseId\': 632638}, \'multiverseid\': 632638}, {\'name\': \'Allarme Anti-intruso\', \'text\': \'Le creature non STAPpano durante lo STAP dei rispettivi controllori.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, STAPpa tutte le creature.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nell\\\'oscurità della foresta si accesero migliaia di occhi e, per la prima volta, Jurald pensò che le Alte Fate potessero essere più di una leggenda."\\n—Oltre il Grande Monolito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecbe922f-0970-4480-8de2-e01223604237\', \'multiverseId\': 632701}, \'multiverseid\': 632701}, {\'name\': \'侵入警報\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\nクリーチャー１体が戦場に出るたび、すべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「闇の森は一千ものキラキラ光る瞳で照らされていた。そしてようやくジュラルドは、ハイフェイが神話以上の存在なのだと思うに至ったのだ。」\\n――「グレートヘンジを超えて」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c52a4888-e626-46b7-9727-dd6529cf455b\', \'multiverseId\': 632764}, \'multiverseid\': 632764}, {\'name\': \'Alarme de Intrusos\', \'text\': \'As criaturas não são desviradas durante as etapas de desvirar de seus controladores.\\nToda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha, desvire todas as criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'" Mil olhos iluminaram a floresta escura e, pela primeira vez, Jurald cogitou que as Altas Fadinas poderiam ser mais que um mito."\\n— Além do Grande Círculo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07fee930-e826-44af-a94f-00acaa83b8a4\', \'multiverseId\': 632827}, \'multiverseid\': 632827}, {\'name\': \'入侵警报\', \'text\': \'生物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\\n每当一个生物进战场时，重置所有生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「黑暗森林中刹那之间睁开万千只眼睛，这是裘若首次觉得至高仙可能不仅只是传说。」\\n～《圆石阵奇谭》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cac750ed-7f81-436c-af7c-fbdea9d3c038\', \'multiverseId\': 632890}, \'multiverseid\': 632890}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allwissenheit\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Zaubersprüche aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie werden angeführt von Talion dem Großzügigen, dem Ersten und Größten der Hochfeen, dem Souverän des Hofes, dem Lehnsmann des Lachens, dem Entdecker der ersten Eibe und dem einzig wahren Herrn von Eldraine."\\n—Über die Hochfeen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3c159b-1cff-4ccb-98f1-e5d6178be819\', \'multiverseId\': 632515}, \'multiverseid\': 632515}, {\'name\': \'Omnisciencia\', \'text\': \'Puedes lanzar hechizos desde tu mano sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Siguen el mandato de Talion, regente amable, origen y cabeza de las grandes hadas, monarca de la corte, sirviente de la risa, quien descubrió el primer tejo y gobernante real de Eldraine".\\n—Sobre las grandes hadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afc6b141-0551-4e80-91bf-90ad4369b429\', \'multiverseId\': 632578}, \'multiverseid\': 632578}, {\'name\': \'Omniscience\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez lancer des sorts depuis votre main sans payer leur coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Ils sont dirigés par Tarelion, seigneur bienveillant, premier et plus grand des Hauts Fæs, souverain de la cour, seigneur du rire, découvreur du premier if, et seul véritable seigneur d\'Eldraine. »\\n—À propos des Hauts Fæs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632641&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d1373a-a140-4254-bed3-d60c1318c3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 632641}, \'multiverseid\': 632641}, {\'name\': \'Onniscienza\', \'text\': \'Puoi lanciare magie dalla tua mano senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono guidati da Talion, il Signore Benevolo, Primo e Migliore delle Alte Fate, Sovrano della Corte, Signore della Risata, Scopritore del Primo Tasso e Unico Vero Lord di Eldraine."\\n—Sulle Alte Fate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eecd21a-86cf-4733-83b9-ca18e6e99f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 632704}, \'multiverseid\': 632704}, {\'name\': \'全知\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたの手札から呪文を、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らを率いるは慈愛の王タリオン、ハイフェイの筆頭にして最強なるもの、宮廷のあるじ、笑いの君公、原初のイチイの発見者、そしてエルドレインの一にして真なる君主である。」\\n――「ハイフェイについて」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b02a101-74e8-4735-aafd-357dcb7b7d30\', \'multiverseId\': 632767}, \'multiverseid\': 632767}, {\'name\': \'Onisciência\', \'text\': \'Você pode conjurar mágicas de sua mão sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Seu líder é Talion, o Lorde Gentil, Primeiro e Maior das Altas Fadinas, Soberano da Corte, Suserano do Riso, Descobridor do Primeiro Teixo e Único Senhor Verdadeiro de Eldraine."\\n— Sobre as Altas Fadinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'124a5e10-a60e-4d87-bcf2-9fc1c7d2c916\', \'multiverseId\': 632830}, \'multiverseid\': 632830}, {\'name\': \'全知全能\', \'text\': \'你可以从你手上施放咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「仙灵全都听令于塔莱恩，仁慈之主，甚伟至高始仙，仙灵廷君主，欢笑王侯，初代紫杉发现者，艾卓唯一真王。」\\n～《至高仙传》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ccaa554-33a1-4cb9-99f3-9ea57e4da111\', \'multiverseId\': 632893}, \'multiverseid\': 632893}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anhaltender Ansturm\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}{R}: Enttappe alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. Falls es eine Hauptphase ist, gibt es eine zusätzliche Kampfphase, gefolgt von einer zusätzlichen Hauptphase. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ritter von Funkenhort kämpften mit dem Feuer des Eisenfelsens in ihren Herzen. Obwohl viele fielen, zog sich kein Einziger von ihnen zurück."\\n—Das letzte Gefecht des Reiches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b29df9b-d9cb-4a28-b7fe-242bf74cd7c0\', \'multiverseId\': 632530}, \'multiverseid\': 632530}, {\'name\': \'Agresión con agravantes\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}{R}: Endereza todas las criaturas que controlas. Si es una fase principal, hay una fase de combate adicional seguida de una fase principal adicional. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Los caballeros de Monteascua lucharon con el fuego del Ferrorisco en sus corazones. Aunque muchos cayeron, ninguno se retiró".\\n—El último bastión del reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c73e4b6-ac81-44a0-8e5c-e719918ea6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 632593}, \'multiverseid\': 632593}, {\'name\': \'Escalade de violence\', \'text\': "{3}{R}{R} : Dégagez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez. Si c\'est une phase principale, il y a une phase de combat supplémentaire suivie d\'une phase principale supplémentaire. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les chevaliers de Braisereth combattirent avec le cœur brûlant des flammes du Culmefer. Nombre d\'entre eux périrent, mais pas un seul ne battit en retraite. »\\n—L\'ultime résistance du Royaume", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632656&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4600602f-02ed-4d19-8469-15731f76223f\', \'multiverseId\': 632656}, \'multiverseid\': 632656}, {\'name\': \'Assalto Aggravato\', \'text\': "{3}{R}{R}: STAPpa tutte le creature che controlli. Se è una fase principale, c\'è una fase di combattimento addizionale seguita da una fase principale addizionale. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I cavalieri di Bracerocca combatterono con il fuoco del Ferropicco nel cuore. Molti caddero, ma nessuno indietreggiò."\\n—L\\\'Ultima Resistenza del Reame\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9481d62f-21f5-4d5b-bdb1-9e870d662783\', \'multiverseId\': 632719}, \'multiverseid\': 632719}, {\'name\': \'追い討ち\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}{R}：あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。メイン・フェイズであるなら、このフェイズの後に追加の戦闘フェイズ１つと、それの後に追加のメイン・フェイズ１つを加える。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「エンバレスの騎士たちは、その胸にアイレンクラッグの炎を宿して戦った。数多の兵が斃れたが、ただの一人も退くことはなかった。」\\n――「王国の最後の抵抗」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b8faa04-c722-422c-85e8-680a9994bf3a\', \'multiverseId\': 632782}, \'multiverseid\': 632782}, {\'name\': \'Assalto Agravado\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}{R}: Desvire todas as criaturas que você controla. Se for uma fase principal, há uma fase de combate adicional seguida por uma fase principal adicional. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Os cavaleiros de Brasoreth lutaram com o fogo da Rochaferro no coração. Embora muitos tenham perecido, nenhum sequer recuou."\\n— O Confronto Final do Reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60793b7a-88ab-40f3-8ed7-1aca8bb396e4\', \'multiverseId\': 632845}, \'multiverseid\': 632845}, {\'name\': \'急躁的突袭\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}{R}：重置所有由你操控的生物。如果当前是行动阶段，则会额外多出一个战斗阶段，以及接于其后之一个额外的行动阶段。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「鞍博雷骑士心怀伊雷岩烈焰奋勇作战。虽纷纷折戟沙场，却无人后退一步。」\\n～《世境末日战》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bf84227-725d-4358-95c8-973ce3843f02\', \'multiverseId\': 632908}, \'multiverseid\': 632908}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbreitendes Meer\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nWenn das Ausbreitende Meer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDas verzauberte Land ist eine Insel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Die überstürzten Bemühungen, Schloss Vantress zu verteidigen, führten dazu, dass von der Burg hauptsächlich Burggraben übrig blieb."\\n—Das letzte Gefecht des Reiches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7f555e-83a5-4b0c-a49b-cf64799511ff\', \'multiverseId\': 632517}, \'multiverseid\': 632517}, {\'name\': \'Mares propagantes\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nCuando los Mares propagantes entren al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa tierra encantada es una Isla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Los esfuerzos apurados por defender el Castillo de Vendaleza consiguieron que, en lugar de un castillo, quedara un foso".\\n—El último bastión del reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b49bd058-a0c0-4934-ab5e-86d8261d48b9\', \'multiverseId\': 632580}, \'multiverseid\': 632580}, {\'name\': \'Mers envahissantes\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nQuand les Mers envahissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLe terrain enchanté est une île.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "« Les efforts précipités pour défendre le Château Vantress laissèrent plus de douves que de château. »\\n—L\'ultime résistance du Royaume", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632643&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02dd6659-3289-4fdd-81aa-6de4e4e6f4f6\', \'multiverseId\': 632643}, \'multiverseid\': 632643}, {\'name\': \'Mari Infiniti\', \'text\': "Incanta terra\\nQuando i Mari Infiniti entrano nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa terra incantata è un\'Isola.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"I tentativi affrettati di difendere il Castello di Vantressa lo resero più fossato che castello."\\n—L\\\'Ultima Resistenza del Reame\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3ca43f-ec70-4e02-9698-69a1aff2b4f6\', \'multiverseId\': 632706}, \'multiverseid\': 632706}, {\'name\': \'広がりゆく海\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\n広がりゆく海が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントしている土地は島である。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「大急ぎでヴァントレス城の防衛に取り組んだ結果、それは城よりもむしろ水濠となった。」\\n――「王国の最後の抵抗」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd03be8b-4da5-42a8-a22a-bbc139067ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 632769}, \'multiverseid\': 632769}, {\'name\': \'Mares em Expansão\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nQuando Mares em Expansão entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nO terreno encantado é uma Ilha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Os apressados esforços para defender o Castelo de Vantreza o deixaram com mais fosso que castelo."\\n— O Confronto Final do Reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d95ed251-8a5f-4648-a363-2a2747bf3d43\', \'multiverseId\': 632832}, \'multiverseid\': 632832}, {\'name\': \'海域蔓延\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n当海域蔓延进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的地是海岛。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「凡翠丝堡守军仓促应战，致使城堡荡然无存，空余护城河水流动。」\\n～《世境末日战》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8160ca-ee57-4452-8d7e-c2a1da1ec62e\', \'multiverseId\': 632895}, \'multiverseid\': 632895}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bitterblüte\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt und erzeugst einen 1/1 schwarzen Feenwesen-Räuber-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Stammes-Verzauberung — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Verweile nicht im Tuinwald,\\nachte nicht den Duft der Blüten.\\nNimm nichts mit, bleib auf dem Pfad,\\nSonst die Feen musst du vergüten."\\n—Durch die Wildnis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'748ada82-e045-4087-a95c-acfd7e2f65d3\', \'multiverseId\': 632518}, \'multiverseid\': 632518}, {\'name\': \'Floración amarga\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pierdes 1 vida y creas una ficha de criatura Bribón Hada negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento tribal — Hada\', \'flavor\': \'"En el Valle de Tuin no te demores,\\nignora el embriagador aroma de las flores.\\nNo te lleves nada ni te alejes del camino,\\npues las hadas no dudarán en darte tu merecido".\\n—Atravesar las tierras salvajes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c23685a7-673f-458e-8f67-1343cf9605fe\', \'multiverseId\': 632581}, \'multiverseid\': 632581}, {\'name\': \'Âpre fleur\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, vous perdez 1 point de vie et vous créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Peuple fée et Gredin avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement tribal — peuple fée\', \'flavor\': \'« À Tuinval, passe ton chemin,\\nIgnore le parfum enivrant des fleurs,\\nReste sur le sentier, ne prends rien,\\nOu les Fæs chercheront ton malheur. »\\n—Promenade dans les friches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632644&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'167e63e4-4eb6-4097-800c-cb3e08881ebd\', \'multiverseId\': 632644}, \'multiverseid\': 632644}, {\'name\': \'Fioritura Amara\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, perdi 1 punto vita e crei una pedina creatura Farabutto Spiritello 1/1 nera con volare.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo Tribale — Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Non indugiare a Tuinvalle,\\nIgnora il profumo delle calle.\\nNon cogliere i fiori, segui la strada,\\nPoiché ciò alle fate non aggrada."\\n—Attraversare le Terre Selvagge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea8b4664-34ae-4909-9f5e-18f56575b4fe\', \'multiverseId\': 632707}, \'multiverseid\': 632707}, {\'name\': \'苦花\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは１点のライフを失い、飛行を持つ黒の１/１のフェアリー・ならず者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'部族・エンチャント — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'「チューインベイルで足を留めるな、\\nかの花々の、酔いしれんばかりの香りに囚われるな。\\n何にも手を伸ばすな、踏み分け道から外れるな、\\nフェイに償いを請求されぬように。」\\n――「僻境の歩き方」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b7744f-a0b0-4a97-926f-da6d279ebaea\', \'multiverseId\': 632770}, \'multiverseid\': 632770}, {\'name\': \'Florescência Amarga\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você perde 1 ponto de vida e cria uma ficha de criatura Fada Ladino preta 1/1 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Tribal — Fada\', \'flavor\': \'"Não se demore no Vale Tuin,\\nIgnore o aroma das flores, sim,\\nNada pegue, não saia da estrada,\\nOu as fadinas quererão sua paga."\\n— Percorrer as Terras Selvagens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e93481-775e-446b-83ac-9f477964f64c\', \'multiverseId\': 632833}, \'multiverseid\': 632833}, {\'name\': \'苦涩花开\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你失去1点生命并派出一个1/1黑色，具飞行异能的仙灵／浪客衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'部族结界 — 仙灵\', \'flavor\': \'「图音谷中勿停留，\\n鲜花芬芳不要嗅。\\n路遇他物莫伸手，\\n以免仙儿来寻仇。」\\n～《幻野游记》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce65928-d346-40e4-9665-cb83e294b0a1\', \'multiverseId\': 632896}, \'multiverseid\': 632896}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Gehorsam\', \'text\': \'Abnötigen (Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du {W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.)\\nArtefakte und Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, kommen getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Eid ist nichts als leere Luft. Man muss alle notwendigen Maßnahmen ergreifen, um sich absolute Loyalität zu sichern."\\n—Der Weg der Hexe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632492&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6abf781e-e9b7-49d1-a2a3-67622b9d3e00\', \'multiverseId\': 632492}, \'multiverseid\': 632492}, {\'name\': \'Obediencia ciega\', \'text\': \'Extorsionar. (Siempre que lances un hechizo, puedes pagar {W/B}. Si lo haces, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas esa cantidad de vidas.)\\nLos artefactos y criaturas que controlan tus oponentes entran al campo de batalla girados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Los juramentos se los lleva el viento. Toma todas las medidas necesarias para garantizar la lealtad absoluta".\\n—Los métodos de la bruja\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb6d33a-7f9e-46b5-81e7-25245d8064d1\', \'multiverseId\': 632555}, \'multiverseid\': 632555}, {\'name\': \'Obéissance aveugle\', \'text\': \'Extorsion (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez payer {W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez autant de points de vie.)\\nLes artefacts et les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les serments ne sont rien que du vent. Prenez les mesures qu\'il faut pour vous assurer une loyauté sans faille. »\\n—La voie de l\'envoûteuse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632618&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b920b63-6762-42aa-ac07-d00a6542d3ec\', \'multiverseId\': 632618}, \'multiverseid\': 632618}, {\'name\': \'Cieca Obbedienza\', \'text\': \'Estorsione (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, puoi pagare {W/B}. Se lo fai, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni altrettanti punti vita.)\\nGli artefatti e le creature controllati dai tuoi avversari entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un giuramento non è fatto che d\\\'aria. Adotta ogni misura necessaria per assicurarti l\\\'assoluta lealtà."\\n—La Via della Strega\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4913ad4f-e0d2-4060-8700-2b798dcb0ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 632681}, \'multiverseid\': 632681}, {\'name\': \'盲従\', \'text\': \'強請（あなたが呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたは{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクトやクリーチャーはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「誓いの言葉など、虚ろで無価値なものにすぎない。絶対なる忠誠を確実にしようというなら、なすべき手立てを講じることだ。」\\n――「魔女の道」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b04d867-d97b-4989-a1dd-b7a14e1363f6\', \'multiverseId\': 632744}, \'multiverseid\': 632744}, {\'name\': \'Obediência Cega\', \'text\': \'Extorquir (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, você pode pagar {W/B}. Se você faz isso, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\\nOs artefatos e as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam entram no campo de batalha virados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Juramentos são fumaça no ar. Tome as medidas necessárias para garantir lealdade absoluta."\\n— Os Ensinamentos da Bruxa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375495fc-91ff-460c-ac35-e145b93944a5\', \'multiverseId\': 632807}, \'multiverseid\': 632807}, {\'name\': \'盲目服从\', \'text\': \'敲诈（每当你施放咒语时，你可以支付{W/B}。若你如此作，则每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得等量的生命。）\\n由对手操控的神器与生物须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「庄严誓言亦口说无凭，须采一切可能手段确保绝对忠诚。」\\n～《巫婆之道》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5bd635-a952-43d5-a910-f7da8af27358\', \'multiverseId\': 632870}, \'multiverseid\': 632870}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutmond\', \'text\': \'Nichtstandardländer sind Gebirge.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der gräuliche Blick des Wyrms traf das Land,\\nUnd alle Bewohner beugten das Knie — oder wurden verbrannt."\\n—„Die Nacht des Drachenfeuers"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83e2a70-31ec-4c2f-8eea-9bbbff98f62d\', \'multiverseId\': 632531}, \'multiverseid\': 632531}, {\'name\': \'Luna de sangre\', \'text\': \'Las tierras no básicas son Montañas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La sierpe posó sobre la tierra su mirada maldita\\ny toda su gente se rindió o acabó marchita".\\n—"La noche del fuegodragón"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75306270-cc80-4297-8b4e-deab907fd744\', \'multiverseId\': 632594}, \'multiverseid\': 632594}, {\'name\': \'Lune de sang\', \'text\': \'Les terrains non-base sont des montagnes.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« L\'œil effroyable de la vouivre se tourna vers la terre,\\nEt le peuple s\'agenouilla... ou fut réduit en poussière. »\\n—« La nuit du feu des dragons »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632657&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e495089-593a-4986-9343-10f1b8178cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 632657}, \'multiverseid\': 632657}, {\'name\': \'Luna Insanguinata\', \'text\': \'Le terre non base sono Montagne.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli occhi del dragone sulla terra si posarono,\\nE tutte le genti si inchinarono... o bruciarono."\\n—"La Notte del Fuoco Draconico"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9485e93f-af6f-40b5-8cbd-2bded431edb4\', \'multiverseId\': 632720}, \'multiverseid\': 632720}, {\'name\': \'血染めの月\', \'text\': \'基本でないすべての土地は山である。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「かの竜の恐るべき眼がこの地に向けられた。\\nそしてすべての人々は膝を屈するか――燃やされた。」\\n――「ドラゴンの火の夜」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0791988e-fece-411c-ab80-71b9231dd7be\', \'multiverseId\': 632783}, \'multiverseid\': 632783}, {\'name\': \'Lua Sangrenta\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos não básicos são Montanhas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Da serpe o olhar terrível para a terra se voltou,\\nE pôs-se todo o povo de joelhos... ou queimou."\\n— "A Noite do Fogo Dragônico"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba0e925-7a17-42ec-88cf-cf57ff1fbc66\', \'multiverseId\': 632846}, \'multiverseid\': 632846}, {\'name\': \'腥红之月\', \'text\': \'非基本地都是山脉。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「恶龙惧目，大地翻震，\\n人民屈膝，违者遭焚。」\\n～「龙火之夜」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc8db81-f92a-4260-8140-4d4e30dfbc93\', \'multiverseId\': 632909}, \'multiverseid\': 632909}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutroter Bund\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Hexe lächelte und genoss jedes gestohlene Jahr. Jede Liebe, der der Ritter nie den Hof machen würde, jede Mahlzeit, die er nie kosten würde, jede Ehre, die er nie gewinnen würde, war süß wie Honig auf ihrer Zunge."\\n—Die Hexen von Düstermoor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'837669cb-2657-4f9c-b0c4-19f698066f50\', \'multiverseId\': 632526}, \'multiverseid\': 632526}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo sangriento\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, el oponente objetivo pierde esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La bruja sonrió, saboreando cada año robado. Cada amor que el caballero no podría cortejar, cada comida que no podría probar y cada honor que no podría conseguir sabían dulces como la miel en su boca".\\n—Maldiciones del Túmulo Pardo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8496c6c4-e516-4153-adb8-1720bb88fe60\', \'multiverseId\': 632589}, \'multiverseid\': 632589}, {\'name\': \'Lien sanguin\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, un adversaire ciblé perd autant de points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La sorcière sourit, savourant chaque année volée. Chaque dulcinée à laquelle le chevalier ne ferait jamais la cour ; chaque repas auquel il ne goûterait jamais ; chaque honneur auquel il n\'aurait jamais droit ; tout avait pour elle un délicieux goût de miel. »\\n—Maléfices de Tertrebrun", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632652&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a0f2f6b-7489-4132-9c85-5260d3861188\', \'multiverseId\': 632652}, \'multiverseid\': 632652}, {\'name\': \'Legame Sanguigno\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, un avversario bersaglio perde altrettanti punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La strega sorrise, assaporando ogni anno rubato. Ogni amore che il cavaliere non avrebbe mai vissuto, ogni pasto che non avrebbe mai gustato, ogni onore che non avrebbe mai vinto, erano come gocce di miele sulla sua lingua."\\n—Anatemi di Tumulo Grigio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'304c3a9f-87f8-471a-85a9-b728c310d8eb\', \'multiverseId\': 632715}, \'multiverseid\': 632715}, {\'name\': \'血なまぐさい結合\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「魔女は盗んだ一年一年を味わって笑った。得られるはずだった愛の数々、味わえたはずの都度の食事、勝ち得ただろうすべての栄誉、それらがすべて彼女の舌に蜜のように甘くとろけた。」\\n――「ダンバロウの呪い」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5e346c6-67be-49d3-9fa8-fb30274d47f0\', \'multiverseId\': 632778}, \'multiverseid\': 632778}, {\'name\': \'Pacto de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, o oponente alvo perde uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A bruxa sorriu, saboreando cada ano roubado. Cada amor que o cavaleiro jamais cortejaria, cada refeição que ele jamais provaria, cada honraria que ele jamais receberia, doce como mel na língua dela."\\n— Bruxarias de Tumbagris\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38cb83ba-96cf-4aad-ba39-2dc028c2ce03\', \'multiverseId\': 632841}, \'multiverseid\': 632841}, {\'name\': \'血色羁绊\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，目标对手失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「巫婆笑容满面，细细品味她窃来的每年时光。骑士未及赢得的每份爱意，未及品尝的每顿佳肴，未及争来的每份荣耀，在巫婆舌尖都如蜜糖般甜美。」\\n～《黯沼野邪咒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ab3b76-6b44-4261-8234-7ee20cd274e8\', \'multiverseId\': 632904}, \'multiverseid\': 632904}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bodensiegel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bodensiegel ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nKarten in Friedhöfen können nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie wurde in der Wildnis zur Ruhe gebettet, an einem heiligen Ort, unerreichbar für Albträume oder Maschinen."\\n—Die namenlose Ritterin des Sommers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb5dbd8-869c-425f-8574-42c4b147d2f4\', \'multiverseId\': 632545}, \'multiverseid\': 632545}, {\'name\': \'Sello terrestre\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sello terrestre entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLas cartas de los cementerios no pueden ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La enterraron en las tierras salvajes, en un lugar sagrado lejos de pesadillas y máquinas".\\n—La caballero sin nombre del verano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4981f8-2063-4443-b888-e4bf5b67ff9f\', \'multiverseId\': 632608}, \'multiverseid\': 632608}, {\'name\': \'Sceau cthonien\', \'text\': \'Quand le Sceau cthonien arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLes cartes des cimetières ne peuvent pas être les cibles de sorts ou de capacités.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Ils l\'inhumèrent dans les friches, dans un lieu sacré hors de portée des cauchemars et des machines. »\\n—La Chevalière inconnue de l\'été", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632671&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c3736ef-cc1a-4269-aa7b-c04aa2e43376\', \'multiverseId\': 632671}, \'multiverseid\': 632671}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Terreno\', \'text\': \'Quando il Sigillo Terreno entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLe carte nei cimiteri non possono essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Fu sepolta nelle terre selvagge, in un luogo sacro oltre la portata di incubi o macchine."\\n—La Cavaliera Senza Nome dell\\\'Estate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f558ac-a2f4-434b-9f90-98b336d39bd0\', \'multiverseId\': 632734}, \'multiverseid\': 632734}, {\'name\': \'地の封印\', \'text\': \'地の封印が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\n墓地にあるカードは呪文や能力の対象にならない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らは彼女を僻境の、悪夢や機械の手の及ばぬ神聖な地へと埋葬したのでした。」\\n――「夏の無名騎士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c3077fa-6e0c-42f2-8f54-1848349dbe5b\', \'multiverseId\': 632797}, \'multiverseid\': 632797}, {\'name\': \'Selo da Terra\', \'text\': \'Quando Selo da Terra entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nOs cards nos cemitérios não podem ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Deixaram que ela descansasse nas Terras Selvagens, num lugar sagrado longe de pesadelos e máquinas."\\n— A Cavaleira Sem Nome do Verão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc384e2f-af1d-47c0-9fc2-d1f817376db5\', \'multiverseId\': 632860}, \'multiverseid\': 632860}, {\'name\': \'大地封印\', \'text\': \'当大地封印进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n坟墓场中的牌不能成为咒语或异能的目标。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「她被葬在幻野深处的圣洁地界，纵连梦魇邪械亦不能及。」\\n～《无名仲夏骑士传》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cce8160-a23f-4025-982c-d293da1c7d6a\', \'multiverseId\': 632923}, \'multiverseid\': 632923}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bombardierungsüberfall\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur mit Stärke 2 oder weniger, die du kontrollierst, angreift, fügt der Bombardierungsüberfall dem Spieler oder Planeswalker, den die Kreatur angreift, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Weil sie Dutzende von Blutkappen nur mit Früchten und Kuchen erschlugen, wurden die überlebenden Zwerge die ‚Nimmersatten\\\' genannt."\\n—Überfall auf die Auenschürfer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2520069-d976-40d7-bd97-501143f2a717\', \'multiverseId\': 632538}, \'multiverseid\': 632538}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeo de incursión\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas con fuerza de 2 o menos ataque, el Bombardeo de incursión hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker al que esa criatura esté atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Por acabar con docenas de gorros rojos con solo fruta y tartas, los enanos supervivientes se dieron a conocer como los Glotonizadores".\\n—Asalto a Tierraprofunda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'648c1c4e-d60e-406b-afa0-7ae063ff2ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 632601}, \'multiverseid\': 632601}, {\'name\': "Bombardement d\'assaut", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature de force inférieure ou égale à 2 que vous contrôlez attaque, le Bombardement d\'assaut inflige 1 blessure au joueur ou au planeswalker que cette créature attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Pour avoir pourfendu des dizaines de bonnets-rouges en n\'utilisant que des fruits et des gâteaux, les survivants nains furent surnommés les Gloutonniers. »\\n—Assaut sur Fouissehoc", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632664&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9fdeba1-e1a3-45ce-8599-de6c4f143262\', \'multiverseId\': 632664}, \'multiverseid\': 632664}, {\'name\': \'Bombardamento da Incursione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli con forza pari o inferiore a 2 attacca, il Bombardamento da Incursione infligge 1 danno al giocatore o al planeswalker che quella creatura sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per aver ucciso decine di berretti rossi con null\\\'altro che frutta e dolci, i nani sopravvissuti furono soprannominati i Buongustai."\\n—Assalto a Scavapiane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd18b83-c260-4484-8102-5031a5fc2763\', \'multiverseId\': 632727}, \'multiverseid\': 632727}, {\'name\': \'略奪の爆撃\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてパワーが２以下であるクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、略奪の爆撃はそのクリーチャーが攻撃しているプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「果物やケーキだけで何十体ものレッドキャップを殺したことから、生き残ったドワーフたちは大食漢隊と呼ばれることになった。」\\n――「デルヴァーホウへの強襲」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a20716ce-6e49-4455-a5ed-0b4cab2db5dd\', \'multiverseId\': 632790}, \'multiverseid\': 632790}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeio Surpresa\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla com poder igual ou inferior a 2 ataca, Bombardeio Surpresa causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker que aquela criatura está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Por abaterem dúzias de barretes vermelhos usando apenas frutas e bolos, os anões sobreviventes foram apelidados de Os Glutadores."\\n— Ataque a Terrafunda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be751a05-a903-430e-a5ae-0ce735c15a41\', \'multiverseId\': 632853}, \'multiverseid\': 632853}, {\'name\': \'突击轰炸\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控且力量等于或小于2的生物攻击时，突击轰炸对该生物所攻击的牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「因其单凭水果及蛋糕击杀成群红帽客之壮举，所有的矮人幸存者都被封为饕枪客。」\\n～《突袭深掘台》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0521f823-4920-41db-82c2-a273811fa50f\', \'multiverseId\': 632916}, \'multiverseid\': 632916}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutpläne\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Brutpläne aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt werden, ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Diebin floh mit ihrer unrechtmäßig erworbenen Beute, ihr Geist war erfüllt von Visionen von Reichtum und Ruhm. In ihrem Rucksack begann sich das Ei unbemerkt zu bewegen und aufzubrechen."\\n—Geschichten aus dem Feenland\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfe07f20-92d5-44e4-8779-74ccf96d91e9\', \'multiverseId\': 632511}, \'multiverseid\': 632511}, {\'name\': \'Planes incubados\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Planes incubados vayan a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La ladrona escapó con sus premios robados, pensando únicamente en gloria y riquezas. En su mochila, desapercibido, el huevo empezó a moverse y resquebrajarse".\\n—Cuentos de hadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b12ebb-796a-457c-84f3-c3bae65029c4\', \'multiverseId\': 632574}, \'multiverseid\': 632574}, {\'name\': \'Plans naissants\', \'text\': \'Quand les Plans naissants sont mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La voleuse s\'enfuit avec son bien mal acquis, l\'esprit distrait par des rêves de richesse et de gloire. Dans son sac, imperceptiblement, l\'œuf commença à remuer et à se craqueler. »\\n—Contes des fæs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632637&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d775055b-2f90-465d-9694-21c1da6cda0d\', \'multiverseId\': 632637}, \'multiverseid\': 632637}, {\'name\': \'Schemi di Riproduzione\', \'text\': \'Quando gli Schemi di Riproduzione vengono messi in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La ladra fuggì con il bottino sulle spalle e un turbinio di visioni di ricchezza e gloria nella testa. Nel suo zaino, inosservato, l\\\'uovo iniziò a schiudersi."\\n—Racconti delle Fate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf5c6c8-47f7-43ff-91ed-b56a8374b885\', \'multiverseId\': 632700}, \'multiverseid\': 632700}, {\'name\': \'孵化計画\', \'text\': \'孵化計画が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「盗人は胸中には富と栄光の光景を浮かべ、不正に手に入れた獲物を持って逃げました。その包みの中では、人知れず卵が震え、殻にひびが入り始めていたのです。」\\n――「フェイの物語」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8cb1087-e777-4b11-9292-bc90e6bb5da4\', \'multiverseId\': 632763}, \'multiverseid\': 632763}, {\'name\': \'Planos de Incubação\', \'text\': \'Quando Planos de Incubação for colocado num cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A ladra fugiu com seu prêmio ilícito, a cabeça girando com visões de riqueza e glória. Na mochila, despercebido, o ovo começou a se agitar e rachar."\\n— Contos das Fadinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf091535-8ed5-4c89-ad08-027ad4a2ae66\', \'multiverseId\': 632826}, \'multiverseid\': 632826}, {\'name\': \'策划计谋\', \'text\': \'当策划计谋从战场进入坟墓场时，抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「飞贼得手后，带着收获信步离开，脑中已满是飞黄腾达的美妙幻想。但她藏在包中的那颗蛋暗自开始扭动、破壳。」\\n～《仙儿传说》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1251ce8-85d7-42cf-8ef1-1f36df0a35c7\', \'multiverseId\': 632889}, \'multiverseid\': 632889}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenumhang\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn der Drachenumhang ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat „{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit unerschrockenem Mut hieß Cade die Flamme willkommen.\\nSie würden seinen Namen niemals vergessen."\\n—„Die Nacht des Drachenfeuers"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca7ec1d1-660c-4642-8ca4-ab02a8abee42\', \'multiverseId\': 632532}, \'multiverseid\': 632532}, {\'name\': \'Manto de dragón\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Manto de dragón entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene "{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Cade aceptó la llama con una temeraria valentía.\\nJuró que a olvidar su nombre nadie se atrevería".\\n—"La noche del fuegodragón"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba69a0f0-5c7b-43de-916b-9c17aaa82902\', \'multiverseId\': 632595}, \'multiverseid\': 632595}, {\'name\': \'Manteau de dragon\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand le Manteau de dragon arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLa créature enchantée a « {R} : Cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "« Cade embrassa la flamme, s\'armant d\'un courage malavisé.\\nIl jura que son nom, ils n\'oseraient jamais l\'oublier. »\\n—« La nuit du feu des dragons »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632658&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c1b6630-e3d8-43f5-9a02-5beaf36d69ee\', \'multiverseId\': 632658}, \'multiverseid\': 632658}, {\'name\': \'Mantello del Drago\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando il Mantello del Drago entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa creatura incantata ha "{R}: Questa creatura prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Cade abbracciò la fiamma, con coraggio avventato.\\nGiurò che il suo nome non sarebbe stato dimenticato."\\n—"La Notte del Fuoco Draconico"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96b7029-33e5-47e0-9daa-e7a1d914239a\', \'multiverseId\': 632721}, \'multiverseid\': 632721}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンのマントル\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nドラゴンのマントルが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは「{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「無謀な勇気のままに、ケイドは炎を纏った。\\n決して俺の名を忘れられないようにしてやる、彼は誓った。」\\n――「ドラゴンの火の夜」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1133ed5c-a910-44d9-9aa6-806b27ca5ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 632784}, \'multiverseid\': 632784}, {\'name\': \'Manto de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Manto de Dragão entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nA criatura encantada tem "{R}: Esta criatura recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Corajoso, temerário, Cade deixou a chama envolvê-lo.\\nJurou que ninguém jamais ousaria esquecer seu nome."\\n— "A Noite do Fogo Dragônico"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0174c69a-b4a9-4999-919d-aeaa92ce51f2\', \'multiverseId\': 632847}, \'multiverseid\': 632847}, {\'name\': \'龙披风\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当龙披风进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物具有「{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。」\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「蛮勇凯德挡烈焰，\\n誓令世人把名念。」\\n～「龙火之夜」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e11e79b9-a4ac-4181-803c-21373304c42e\', \'multiverseId\': 632910}, \'multiverseid\': 632910}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkle Bevormundung\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments deckst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf und nimmst sie auf deine Hand. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Unser Weg ist der der Ausgestoßenen, des ausgeteilten und erlittenen Schmerzes. Aber für die Starken ist es ein Weg, der zu Macht führt, die nicht an Feen-Rätsel gebunden ist."\\n—Der Weg der Hexe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09c645e2-6cf0-43df-93c7-5d95778e682f\', \'multiverseId\': 632519}, \'multiverseid\': 632519}, {\'name\': \'Tutela oscura\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca y ponla en tu mano. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestro camino es el de los parias, uno lleno de dolor infligido y recibido. Pero, para los fuertes, es un camino que lleva a un poder libre de los acertijos feéricos".\\n—Los métodos de la bruja\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab597e0a-666b-423e-bb69-e0e64554499c\', \'multiverseId\': 632582}, \'multiverseid\': 632582}, {\'name\': \'Obscure tutelle\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque et mettez-la dans votre main. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Notre voie est celle des réprouvés, de la douleur infligée et de la douleur subie. Mais pour les plus résistants, c\'est la voie qui mène à un pouvoir affranchi des énigmes des Fæs. »\\n—La voie de l\'envoûteuse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632645&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e988da39-2fb7-4534-a970-ff69d399cc73\', \'multiverseId\': 632645}, \'multiverseid\': 632645}, {\'name\': \'Tutela Oscura\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio e aggiungila alla tua mano. Perdi punti vita pari al suo valore di mana.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La nostra è una vita di emarginazione, di dolore inflitto e subito. Ma per chi ne ha la forza, è un sentiero che porta a un potere slegato dagli indovinelli delle fate."\\n—La Via della Strega\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90cbe078-62a7-41a9-ac03-14333f04b951\', \'multiverseId\': 632708}, \'multiverseid\': 632708}, {\'name\': \'闇の後見\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。あなたはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの道は流人の道だ。苦痛を与えられ、与える道だ。だが強き者にとっては、フェイの謎より解き放たれし力へと続く道なのだ。」\\n――「魔女の道」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3483de3-c4c1-4cc9-8744-ac6727e2fa16\', \'multiverseId\': 632771}, \'multiverseid\': 632771}, {\'name\': \'Tutela Sombria\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, revele o card do topo de seu grimório e coloque-o em sua mão. Você perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana dele.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Nosso caminho é o das renegadas, da dor que se causa e se sente. Mas, para as fortes, é um caminho que leva a um poder sem as amarras dos enigmas das fadinas."\\n— Os Ensinamentos da Bruxa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a6b9f38-f80e-4191-8134-4d2fc5617a9d\', \'multiverseId\': 632834}, \'multiverseid\': 632834}, {\'name\': \'黑暗教导\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，展示你的牌库顶牌，并将该牌置于你手上。你失去等同于其法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我们所选之道虽然受人唾弃：不仅予人痛苦，自身也会受尽折磨；但对强者而言，这是掌握破除仙灵谜题困扰之强大力量的必由之路。」\\n～《巫婆之道》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf662c90-a897-4d57-a06e-1a21c2203a24\', \'multiverseId\': 632897}, \'multiverseid\': 632897}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entdeckungen der Sippe\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Entdeckungen der Sippe ins Spiel kommen, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Türme waren wie ein Lied in der nächtlichen Brise, leise und lieblich, ein Ruf der Heimat."\\n—Die Reise eines Flinklings\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4f41d17-da86-41ea-bd2a-f6ed2afcf40e\', \'multiverseId\': 632513}, \'multiverseid\': 632513}, {\'name\': \'Descubrimiento de la estirpe\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Descubrimiento de la estirpe entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas del tipo elegido entre al campo de batalla o ataque, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Las torres eran como una canción en la brisa nocturna, dulces y ligeras, pidiéndole que regresara a casa".\\n—El viaje de un velozoide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb52778e-61f4-40ed-aea5-ec2bdf061ffa\', \'multiverseId\': 632576}, \'multiverseid\': 632576}, {\'name\': \'Découverte de congénères\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Découverte de congénères arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature du type choisi que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les tours paraissaient un chant dans la nuit fraîche, faible et doux, l\'invitant à rentrer chez elle. »\\n—Le voyage d\'une lesteline", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632639&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b832ef-5506-4725-a321-bc666532d7b2\', \'multiverseId\': 632639}, \'multiverseid\': 632639}, {\'name\': \'Scoperta della Stirpe\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Scoperta della Stirpe entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli del tipo scelto entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le torri erano come una melodia nella brezza notturna, delicata e meravigliosa, che la richiamava a casa."\\n—Il Viaggio di una Fulminella\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6017a3c4-91d0-49b8-bf94-c586d738be61\', \'multiverseId\': 632702}, \'multiverseid\': 632702}, {\'name\': \'同族の発見\', \'text\': \'同族の発見が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるクリーチャー１体が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「数々の塔は夜風に乗る歌声のように、かすかに、だが美しく、彼女を家路へと誘った。」\\n――「クイックリングの旅」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73aaafb2-035e-4202-8a22-dcabd62d09a0\', \'multiverseId\': 632765}, \'multiverseid\': 632765}, {\'name\': \'Descoberta da Estirpe\', \'text\': \'Conforme Descoberta da Estirpe entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla do tipo escolhido entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"As torres eram como uma canção na brisa noturna, longínquas e adoráveis, chamando-a para casa."\\n— A Jornada de um Ligeirídeo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0487893e-b121-423a-b234-f0d46b371382\', \'multiverseId\': 632828}, \'multiverseid\': 632828}, {\'name\': \'同族发现\', \'text\': \'于同族发现进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n每当一个由你操控的该类别生物进战场或攻击时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「高塔映入眼帘，就像那随夜风传来的思乡歌谣，低声轻柔地唤她回家。」\\n～《迅敏灵之旅》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa88a6ae-04fd-4b4f-bdff-7a666016fb0d\', \'multiverseId\': 632891}, \'multiverseid\': 632891}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entfesselung der Feuermacht\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einer bleibenden Karte oder einem Spieler Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie der bleibenden Karte oder dem Spieler stattdessen dreimal so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Hieb des mächtigen Torbran traf die angreifende Phalanx wie ein Blitz. Als das Licht verblasste, war um ihn herum nur noch Asche."\\n—Das letzte Gefecht des Reiches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90a2aba-966f-47c8-9fd2-9a177f81b3f6\', \'multiverseId\': 632533}, \'multiverseid\': 632533}, {\'name\': \'Emancipación ardiente\', \'text\': \'Si una fuente que controlas fuera a hacer daño a un permanente o jugador, en vez de eso, hace el triple de ese daño a ese permanente o jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El poderoso Torbran atacó a la falange invasora como un relámpago de los cielos. Cuando la luz se atenuó, a su alrededor solo quedaban cenizas".\\n—El último bastión del reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71606a9e-6c2d-43a4-8cea-f24bdd1095db\', \'multiverseId\': 632596}, \'multiverseid\': 632596}, {\'name\': \'Émancipation ardente\', \'text\': \'Si une source que vous contrôlez devait infliger des blessures à un permanent ou à un joueur, elle inflige à la place le triple de ces blessures à ce permanent ou à ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le puissant Torbran frappa les phalanges conquérantes tel un éclair s\'abattant des cieux. Lorsque la lumière fut moins aveuglante, il ne restait que des cendres autour de lui. »\\n—L\'ultime résistance du Royaume", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632659&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a51161c-d973-42aa-8874-537d9d4455f6\', \'multiverseId\': 632659}, \'multiverseid\': 632659}, {\'name\': \'Liberazione Ardente\', \'text\': \'Se una fonte che controlli sta per infliggere danno a un permanente o a un giocatore, infligge invece il triplo di quel danno a quel permanente o a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il potente Torbran colpì la falange degli invasori come un dardo dai cieli. Quando il lampo si affievolì, intorno a lui non restava che cenere."\\n—L\\\'Ultima Resistenza del Reame\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a85e5d2b-1c6b-4211-80de-62d4fcfba2d8\', \'multiverseId\': 632722}, \'multiverseid\': 632722}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の解放\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている発生源がパーマネントやプレイヤーにダメージを与えるなら、代わりに、それはそのパーマネントやプレイヤーにその点数の３倍のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「剛力トーブランは、侵略者たちを天から放たれる雷撃のように打ち砕いた。光が止んだとき、彼の周りにはただ灰が残っているだけだった。」\\n――「王国の最後の抵抗」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3cc27d4-6578-4864-8136-5e7ed2997d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 632785}, \'multiverseid\': 632785}, {\'name\': \'Emancipação Ígnea\', \'text\': \'Se uma fonte que você controla for causar dano a uma permanente ou a um jogador, em vez disso, ela causará o triplo daquele dano àquela permanente ou àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O Poderoso Torbran atingiu a falange inimiga como um raio enviado dos céus. Quando a luz diminuiu, à sua volta restavam apenas cinzas."\\n— O Confronto Final do Reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c2875c6-d7d3-467b-ab72-fed3b106cf8a\', \'multiverseId\': 632848}, \'multiverseid\': 632848}, {\'name\': \'焰浪无拘\', \'text\': \'如果某个由你操控的来源将对任一永久物或牌手造成伤害，则改为它对该永久物或牌手造成三倍的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「强大的托班从天而降，以雷霆万钧之势直扑侵攻军团。待电光落定之后，四周只余尘土。」\\n～《世境末日战》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077a1527-0a68-4e49-8a48-3c06789b9d30\', \'multiverseId\': 632911}, \'multiverseid\': 632911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdrückender Zehnt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, kann er {2} bezahlen. Falls er dies nicht tut, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie lachten vor Vergnügen, als der Kobold Gold aus Stroh spann. Sie lächelten und zuckten mit den Schultern, als ihre Vorhänge und Kleider als Nächstes auf dem Spinnrad landeten. Dann packte er sie an den Haaren."\\n—Die Gänsemutter und andere Märchen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f3a9ff-be65-447e-8b6b-785dc20ac2a9\', \'multiverseId\': 632504}, \'multiverseid\': 632504}, {\'name\': \'Diezmo asfixiante\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente robe una carta, ese jugador puede pagar {2}. Si el jugador no lo hace, creas una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Rieron con alegría mientras el duende tejía oro a partir de paja. Sonrieron y se extrañaron cuando sus cortinas y ropas fueron las siguientes en la rueca. Entonces el hada les agarró el pelo".\\n—La mamá gansa y otros cuentos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'849baf88-7975-42e4-b050-64c9f4588333\', \'multiverseId\': 632567}, \'multiverseid\': 632567}, {\'name\': \'Dîme étouffante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, ce joueur peut payer {2}. S\'il ne le fait pas, vous créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Ils rirent aux éclats lorsque le pixie tissa de l\'or avec de la paille. Ils sourirent en haussant les épaules lorsqu\'il plaça ensuite leurs rideaux et leurs vêtements sur le rouet. Puis il attrapa leurs cheveux. »\\n—La mère l\'oie et autres contes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632630&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86962cf4-ba68-4b8b-86ba-860632bd4bcf\', \'multiverseId\': 632630}, \'multiverseid\': 632630}, {\'name\': \'Tributo Asfissiante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario pesca una carta, quel giocatore può pagare {2}. Se quel giocatore non lo fa, tu crei una pedina Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ridacchiarono quando il folletto prese il fieno e ne fece oro filato. Sorrisero e se ne burlarono quando passò alle tende e ai vestiti. Poi prese i loro capelli."\\n—Mamma Oca e Altri Racconti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71478022-8925-4131-a99d-50ba4d83765e\', \'multiverseId\': 632693}, \'multiverseid\': 632693}, {\'name\': \'息詰まる徴税\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人がカード１枚を引くたび、そのプレイヤーは{2}を支払ってもよい。そのプレイヤーがそうしないなら、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ピクシーが藁から金を紡ぎ出すと、人々は大喜びで笑った。ピクシーは次に、糸車にカーテンや人々の衣服をかけた。人々は当惑しながらも笑った。ピクシーはその次に、彼らの髪の毛に手を伸ばした。」\\n――「ガチョウの母」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2281fdb9-84d8-4661-b671-43b8ed36ccce\', \'multiverseId\': 632756}, \'multiverseid\': 632756}, {\'name\': \'Dízimo Sufocante\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente compra um card, aquele jogador pode pagar {2}. Se o jogador não fizer isso, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles riram deliciados quando o sílfide fiou ouro de palha. Eles sorriram e deram de ombros quando as cortinas e roupas foram parar na roda. E então ele pegou seus cabelos."\\n— A Mamãe Ganso e Outras Histórias\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ad9336-7833-4ee3-8b4b-b177b5e0f0eb\', \'multiverseId\': 632819}, \'multiverseid\': 632819}, {\'name\': \'税赋压身\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手抓一张牌时，该牌手可以支付{2}。若该牌手未如此作，则你派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「看着碧仙从稻草中纺出黄金，他们笑逐颜开。看着碧仙接着将他们窗帘服饰放上纺车，他们笑容渐止。然后碧仙开始扯起了他们的头发。」\\n～《鹅鹅妈故事集》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3e3631-1894-4ec8-b5c7-d4be7bfc309c\', \'multiverseId\': 632882}, \'multiverseid\': 632882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erweiterte Auramagie\', \'text\': \'Andere Verzauberungen, die du kontrollierst, haben Verhülltheit. (Eine bleibende Karte mit Verhülltheit kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nVerzauberte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Verhülltheit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Jägerin zog ihren Dolch und stellte fest, dass sie eine Blume in der Hand hielt. Sie griff nach einem Pfeil, aber ihr Köcher enthielt nur Blätter."\\n—Geschichten aus dem Feenland\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632495&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef5c031-30e4-4f10-a192-4e17d4c0b42e\', \'multiverseId\': 632495}, \'multiverseid\': 632495}, {\'name\': \'Auramancia superior\', \'text\': \'Los otros encantamientos que controlas tienen la habilidad de velo. (Un permanente con la habilidad de velo no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nLas criaturas encantadas que controlas tienen la habilidad de velo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La cazadora fue a desenvainar la daga, pero en su lugar asió una flor. Luego fue a por una flecha, pero en su carcaj solo encontró hojas".\\n—Cuentos de hadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ccfcb2b-5b1e-43c3-96a1-4e0732e6fbf3\', \'multiverseId\': 632558}, \'multiverseid\': 632558}, {\'name\': \'Grande auramancie\', \'text\': \'Les autres enchantements que vous contrôlez ont le linceul. (Un permanent avec le linceul ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nLes créatures enchantées que vous contrôlez ont le linceul.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La chasseuse sortit sa dague et s\'aperçut qu\'elle tenait une fleur. Elle chercha une flèche, mais son carquois ne contenait que des feuilles. »\\n—Contes des fæs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632621&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85ee6bc7-f292-4d0e-a994-fd279c1b0d93\', \'multiverseId\': 632621}, \'multiverseid\': 632621}, {\'name\': \'Auramanzia Potenziata\', \'text\': \'Gli altri incantesimi che controlli hanno velo. (Un permanente con velo non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nLe creature incantate che controlli hanno velo.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La cacciatrice estrasse il pugnale, ma nel pugno stringeva solo un fiore. Tentò di incoccare una freccia, ma la sua faretra non conteneva che foglie."\\n—Racconti delle Fate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01ab6fc8-7061-4a13-a036-efbb06da44ca\', \'multiverseId\': 632684}, \'multiverseid\': 632684}, {\'name\': \'偉大なるオーラ術\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのエンチャントは被覆を持つ。（被覆を持つパーマネントは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてオーラがついているすべてのクリーチャーは被覆を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「狩人は短剣を抜きましたが、その手の中にあったのは一輪の花でした。矢をつがえようと矢筒に手を伸ばしても、入っているのは葉だけでした。」\\n――「フェイの物語」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'838751e0-e43b-4344-9e85-5917a1360d42\', \'multiverseId\': 632747}, \'multiverseid\': 632747}, {\'name\': \'Auromancia Superior\', \'text\': \'Os outros encantamentos que você controla têm manto. (Uma permanente com manto não pode ser alvo de mágicas ou habilidades.)\\nAs criaturas encantadas que você controla têm manto.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A caçadora sacou a adaga e descobriu que segurava uma flor. Ela buscou uma flecha, mas na aljava havia apenas folhas."\\n— Contos das Fadinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73331688-65f4-4bbe-86f0-5c47725287f1\', \'multiverseId\': 632810}, \'multiverseid\': 632810}, {\'name\': \'高等灵气术\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他结界具有帷幕异能。（具帷幕异能的永久物不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\\n由你操控且受有灵气的生物具有帷幕异能。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「猎人拔刀相迎，却见手中空握鲜花；她转身抽箭，惊觉袋内只余绿叶。」\\n～《仙儿传说》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab4e9811-9565-4829-85b5-966c5bfc9d08\', \'multiverseId\': 632873}, \'multiverseid\': 632873}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzwungene Erfüllung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt, zieht jener Spieler sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Mein Königreich für ein Festmahl!\\\' sprach der König. Eine Fee erschien vor ihm und sprach mit einem boshaften Grinsen: ‚Wie Ihr wünscht.\\\'"\\n—Geschichten aus dem Feenland\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'912741a9-784d-4cd0-89be-cf3e5a531f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 632509}, \'multiverseid\': 632509}, {\'name\': \'Complacencia forzada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, ese jugador roba siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"―¡Mi reino por un banquete! ―dijo el rey. Una hada ante él apareció y con una siniestra sonrisa habló:\\n―Sus deseos son órdenes".\\n—Cuentos de hadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e27d358-3a3e-446b-8e8a-2c1c5e206253\', \'multiverseId\': 632572}, \'multiverseid\': 632572}, {\'name\': \'Fructification forcée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, ce joueur pioche sept cartes.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« "Mon royaume pour un festin !" s\\\'exclama le roi. Une færie apparut devant lui et déclara, un grand sourire aux lèvres : "Comme vous voudrez." »\\n—Contes des fæs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632635&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d64464-8f34-4e4e-86cb-e2aabcf92257\', \'multiverseId\': 632635}, \'multiverseid\': 632635}, {\'name\': \'Risultato Forzato\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, quel giocatore pesca sette carte.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Il mio regno per un banchetto!\\\' esclamò il re. Uno spiritello comparve al suo cospetto e disse con tono beffardo: \\\'Come desideri.\\\'"\\n—Racconti delle Fate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21fe70a4-2992-4614-bb98-580b5993f60f\', \'multiverseId\': 632698}, \'multiverseid\': 632698}, {\'name\': \'無理強いた成果\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が呪文１つを唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーはカード７枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「わが王国は祝宴のためにある！」王はそう言いました。一人のフェアリーが王の前に現れ、ふざけたように笑って言いました。「仰せのままに。」\\n――「フェイの物語」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae4ba7f5-fcc4-44ff-af16-8787e66d95c8\', \'multiverseId\': 632761}, \'multiverseid\': 632761}, {\'name\': \'Fruição Forçada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente conjura uma mágica, aquele jogador compra sete cards.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Meu reino por um banquete!\\\', recitou o rei. Uma fada apareceu diante dele e disse, num sorriso malicioso: \\\'Como queira.\\\'"\\n— Contos das Fadinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046baa0f-fe67-44b6-90ea-d1c99bcf87ca\', \'multiverseId\': 632824}, \'multiverseid\': 632824}, {\'name\': \'强迫结实\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手施放咒语时，该牌手抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「『就用王国换大餐！』国王说道。突然有个仙灵在他面前出现，坏笑道：『如你所愿。』」\\n～《仙儿传说》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7d45119-553c-4eb7-9532-ec0a0a1413fb\', \'multiverseId\': 632887}, \'multiverseid\': 632887}]', '[{\'name\': \'Garruks Aufstand\', \'text\': \'Wenn Garruks Aufstand ins Spiel kommt und falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a0c9cb3-7fbb-4836-a8a9-89aba7926783\', \'multiverseId\': 632544}, \'multiverseid\': 632544}, {\'name\': \'Alzamiento de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Alzamiento de Garruk entre al campo de batalla, si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, roba una carta.\\nLas criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\\nSiempre que una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f65d4415-8443-4e62-9e92-ed6480ce4f04\', \'multiverseId\': 632607}, \'multiverseid\': 632607}, {\'name\': \'Soulèvement de Garruk\', \'text\': "Quand le Soulèvement de Garruk arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, piochez une carte.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez ont le piétinement.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature avec une force supérieure ou égale à 4 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632670&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'795f0b9d-47d7-4b45-bedf-fdd61a308e86\', \'multiverseId\': 632670}, \'multiverseid\': 632670}, {\'name\': \'Insurrezione di Garruk\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Insurrezione di Garruk entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, pesca una carta.\\nLe creature che controlli hanno travolgere.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4 entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a45285fc-afcc-4ec1-92ca-96eb684a41da\', \'multiverseId\': 632733}, \'multiverseid\': 632733}, {\'name\': \'ガラクの蜂起\', \'text\': \'ガラクの蜂起が戦場に出たとき、パワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをあなたがコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。\\nパワーが４以上であるクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cb200c-6cb9-4ae7-8627-bd59b4cffba2\', \'multiverseId\': 632796}, \'multiverseid\': 632796}, {\'name\': \'Levante de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Quando Levante de Garruk entrar no campo de batalha, se você controlar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4, compre um card.\\nAs criaturas que você controla têm atropelar.\\nToda vez que uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4 entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00dde275-9327-48b7-ab15-4554831ffe2d\', \'multiverseId\': 632859}, \'multiverseid\': 632859}, {\'name\': \'贾路的反抗\', \'text\': \'当贾路的反抗进战场时，若你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则抓一张牌。\\n由你操控的生物具有践踏异能。\\n每当一个力量等于或大于4的生物在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'966b7676-cef9-4c1f-8d12-8d403579516a\', \'multiverseId\': 632922}, \'multiverseid\': 632922}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gehärtete Schuppen\', \'text\': \'Falls eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, gelegt würden, werden stattdessen so viele plus eine +1/+1-Marken auf sie gelegt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Vor mir wand sich die Hüterin meiner Belohnungen,\\nEine Schlange mit steinerner Haut und listigen Augen!"\\n—Die Prüfungen eines Reisenden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632546&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08966a5e-b420-4e4a-8c6a-cefa89b088f4\', \'multiverseId\': 632546}, \'multiverseid\': 632546}, {\'name\': \'Escamas endurecidas\', \'text\': \'Si fueran a ponerse uno o más contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas, en vez de eso, se pone esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 más uno sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ante mí se hallaba el guardián de mi fortuna,\\nun reptil con piel pétrea y mirada importuna".\\n—Las pruebas de un viajante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada0909c-c10f-4be0-adb9-90ef844660f9\', \'multiverseId\': 632609}, \'multiverseid\': 632609}, {\'name\': \'Écailles renforcées\', \'text\': \'Si au moins un marqueur +1/+1 devait être mis sur une créature que vous contrôlez, autant de marqueurs +1/+1 plus un sont mis sur elle à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Face à moi ondulait le gardien de ma récompense,\\nUn serpent à la peau de pierre et au regard intense ! »\\n—Anicroches d\'un voyageur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f177acb-81e5-4215-b168-04d6fc876e34\', \'multiverseId\': 632672}, \'multiverseid\': 632672}, {\'name\': \'Scaglie Indurite\', \'text\': \'Se uno o più segnalini +1/+1 stanno per essere messi su una creatura che controlli, mettine invece uno in più.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"A guardia del mio premio un aspide contorto,\\nDalla pelle di pietra e dallo sguardo accorto!"\\n—I Perigli di un Viaggiatore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3403ead-3728-40d7-b436-cabc9d5a0d39\', \'multiverseId\': 632735}, \'multiverseid\': 632735}, {\'name\': \'硬化した鱗\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に１個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれるなら、代わりにその個数に１を足した個数の＋１/＋１カウンターをそれの上に置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「私の前に、身をよじって賞品の守護者が現れた。\\nそれは石の鱗と剣呑な目を持った一匹の蛇であった。」\\n――「とある旅人の試練」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0c23648-080b-44b9-8072-503f2b78d894\', \'multiverseId\': 632798}, \'multiverseid\': 632798}, {\'name\': \'Escamas Endurecidas\', \'text\': \'Se um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 seriam colocados em uma criatura que você controla, em vez disso, serão colocados naquela criatura aquele número mais um de marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A guardiã do meu prêmio coleava à minha frente,\\nDe olhos sagazes e pele pétrea, a serpente!"\\n— As Provações do Viajante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19598db1-e314-47ca-99bc-0a9e2d3f8ec7\', \'multiverseId\': 632861}, \'multiverseid\': 632861}, {\'name\': \'坚固鳞甲\', \'text\': \'如果将在某个由你操控的生物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物，则改为在其上放置该数量加一的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「眼前珍宝守卫盘卷身躯，想阻我得手；\\n巨蛇顽石附体眼神灵动，怕是难赶走！」\\n～《旅人渡劫记》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'996e307e-0a86-4cb8-b432-75fcca7a4a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 632924}, \'multiverseid\': 632924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerechtigkeit des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, eine bleibende Karte, die keine Kreatur ist und die du kontrollierst, zerstört, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die jener Gegner kontrolliert, zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe deiner Familie Unrecht getan, ich war auf einem Irrweg. Ich liefere mich dir aus, damit du an mir Rache üben kannst."\\n—Die Torheit von Syr Perrin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632498&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f395c1-7276-46de-acb3-0323c5eeb776\', \'multiverseId\': 632498}, \'multiverseid\': 632498}, {\'name\': \'Justicia kármica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un hechizo o una habilidad que controla un oponente destruya un permanente que no sea criatura que controlas, puedes destruir el permanente objetivo que controla ese oponente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Engañé a tu familia con una tarea imposible. No puedo sino ofrecerme a mí mismo para que ejecutes tu venganza".\\n—La necedad de Syr Perrin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0010ee3c-86be-4d65-a97c-c17094307900\', \'multiverseId\': 632561}, \'multiverseid\': 632561}, {\'name\': \'Justice karmique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un sort ou une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle détruit un permanent non-créature que vous contrôlez, vous pouvez détruire un permanent ciblé que cet adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai fait du tort à votre famille dans une quête futile. Je ne puis vous offrir que ma vie pour votre vengeance. »\\n—La folie de Syr Perrin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'594e3223-5d51-4da6-9eeb-b39d130ead4f\', \'multiverseId\': 632624}, \'multiverseid\': 632624}, {\'name\': \'Giustizia Karmica\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una magia o un\'abilità controllata da un avversario distrugge un permanente non creatura che controlli, puoi distruggere un permanente bersaglio controllato da quell\'avversario.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho fatto torto alla vostra famiglia con la mia stoltezza. Tutto ciò che ho da offrire è me stesso, per saziare la vostra vendetta."\\n—La Follia di Syr Perrin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40a9f740-866c-4bf7-9383-1d20ec5dff9f\', \'multiverseId\': 632687}, \'multiverseid\': 632687}, {\'name\': \'霊体の正義\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力が、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないパーマネント１つを破壊するたび、その対戦相手がコントロールしているパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「私はあなたの家族に徒労を負わせ、不当に扱ってしまった。私にできることは、この身をあなたの報復に供することのみだ。」\\n――「ペリン卿の愚行」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c01b8010-daa6-44fd-9abf-98795fd938ac\', \'multiverseId\': 632750}, \'multiverseid\': 632750}, {\'name\': \'Justiça Cármica\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla destrói uma permanente não de criatura que você controla, você pode destruir a permanente alvo que aquele oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Trouxe eu o opróbrio a vossa família numa tola demanda. Posso oferecer-vos tão somente eu, para que tenhais vossa vingança."\\n— O Erro de Syr Perrin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d13c0efd-60a4-4ee7-bab6-0052d067083a\', \'multiverseId\': 632813}, \'multiverseid\': 632813}, {\'name\': \'业报\', \'text\': \'每当由对手操控的咒语或异能消灭一个由你操控的非生物永久物时，你可以消灭目标由该对手操控的永久物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾因愚人之命而令贵府蒙冤，如今登门谢罪，任君处置。」\\n～《佩林爵士愚行录》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba651616-b35b-411a-a351-fac3ed5315c5\', \'multiverseId\': 632876}, \'multiverseid\': 632876}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geteilte Abneigung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+0 für jede andere angreifende Kreatur, mit der sie einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Fehde zwischen Zwergen und Blutkappen tobte schon seit Äonen und niemand wusste mehr so recht, wie sie begonnen hatte. Nur wenige würden glauben, dass sie durch einen Streit um einen Löffel ausgelöst wurde."\\n—Überfall auf die Auenschürfer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d019a6df-3be8-4ebc-abcb-23670dd9180b\', \'multiverseId\': 632540}, \'multiverseid\': 632540}, {\'name\': \'Animosidad compartida\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque, obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno por cada otra criatura atacante que comparta un tipo de criatura con ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La mala sangre entre los enanos y los gorros rojos duraba tanto que nadie recordaba cómo empezó. Pocos creerían que fue debido a una disputa, hace muchos años, por una cuchara".\\n—Asalto a Tierraprofunda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b928fa61-da58-42a9-9beb-a66885a6ecb4\', \'multiverseId\': 632603}, \'multiverseid\': 632603}, {\'name\': \'Animosité partagée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque, elle gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque autre créature attaquante qui partage un type de créature avec elle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La querelle entre les nains et les bonnets-rouges faisait rage depuis si longtemps que nul ne se souvenait de la façon dont elle avait commencé. Rares étaient ceux qui pouvaient croire qu\'elle avait débuté longtemps auparavant à cause d\'une cuillère. »\\n—Assaut sur Fouissehoc", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b604bd7-b0d0-4658-9cf0-68432f21e716\', \'multiverseId\': 632666}, \'multiverseid\': 632666}, {\'name\': \'Animosità Condivisa\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca, prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno per ogni altra creatura attaccante che condivide un tipo di creatura con essa.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La faida tra nani e berretti rossi aveva infuriato così a lungo che nessuno più ricordava come fosse iniziata. Alcuni ritengono che sia scaturita da una lite per un cucchiaio."\\n—Assalto a Scavapiane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363e1070-1943-417c-9907-034da2f01974\', \'multiverseId\': 632729}, \'multiverseid\': 632729}, {\'name\': \'分かち合う憎しみ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは、それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持ちそれでない攻撃クリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ドワーフとレッドキャップとの抗争はあまりに長く続いており、なぜその確執が始まったのが、誰一人として覚えていなかった。スプーンを巡る大昔の争いが、その抗争の発端だったなどとは、誰も信じはしないだろう。」\\n――「デルヴァーホウへの強襲」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5e12d56-8d83-437e-aaa8-f312d97532d9\', \'multiverseId\': 632792}, \'multiverseid\': 632792}, {\'name\': \'Animosidade Compartilhada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca, ela recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno para cada outra criatura atacante que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com ela.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A rixa entre anões e barretes vermelhos se arrasta há tanto tempo que ninguém se lembra direito de como ela começou. Poucos acreditariam que esse estopim longínquo foi uma briga por uma colher."\\n— Ataque a Terrafunda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6130c2f-f362-4cba-b052-1396c51ad7c6\', \'multiverseId\': 632855}, \'multiverseid\': 632855}, {\'name\': \'同仇敌忾\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物攻击时，战场上每有一个与它具共通生物类别的其他攻击生物，它便得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「矮人跟红帽客之间积怨已久，甚至已经没人能说清起因到底为何。有传说这梁子是因许久以前的一次争抢汤勺而结下的。」\\n～《突袭深掘台》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89922b09-e7a4-4b75-9e7e-97020dc4289a\', \'multiverseId\': 632918}, \'multiverseid\': 632918}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Bombardierung\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Die Goblin-Bombardierung fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Was den Blutkappen an strategischem Scharfsinn fehlt, machen sie mit dreister Kühnheit mehr als wett."\\n—Das Königliche Bestiarium der Kenriths\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd64f3f8-60fd-4e92-8d76-e9153e774dd5\', \'multiverseId\': 632534}, \'multiverseid\': 632534}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeo trasgo\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: El Bombardeo trasgo hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que los gorros rojos no tienen de pericia estratégica lo compensan de sobra con una audacia descarada".\\n—Bestiario real de los Kenrith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c297c43-3878-4c94-9537-e9fc043ab7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 632597}, \'multiverseid\': 632597}, {\'name\': \'Bombardement des gobelins\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une créature : Le Bombardement des gobelins inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Le manque de perspicacité stratégique des bonnets-rouges est largement compensé par leur audace insolente. »\\n—Funérailles royales des Kenrith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632660&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'716bc9ed-a637-4ac0-b74d-0bed42bfa715\', \'multiverseId\': 632660}, \'multiverseid\': 632660}, {\'name\': \'Bombardamento dei Goblin\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Il Bombardamento dei Goblin infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che ai berretti rossi manca in acume strategico compensano ampiamente con audacia sprezzante."\\n—Il Bestiario Reale dei Kenrith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8792eb51-46c8-4f19-994e-b8949b665cff\', \'multiverseId\': 632723}, \'multiverseid\': 632723}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの砲撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：１つを対象とする。ゴブリンの砲撃はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「レッドキャップたちは戦術的な正確さに劣っているが、恥知らずなまでの大胆さはそれを補ってあまりある。」\\n――「ケンリス王家の動物記」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fc7fc6-3599-4f34-8055-b560d6cff0a5\', \'multiverseId\': 632786}, \'multiverseid\': 632786}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeio Goblin\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: Bombardeio Goblin causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O que falta aos barretes vermelhos em precisão estratégica mais que sobra em audácia temerária."\\n— O Bestiário Real dos Kenriths\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2ea8af-7896-4e63-a369-53551a5b4367\', \'multiverseId\': 632849}, \'multiverseid\': 632849}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪轰炸\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：鬼怪轰炸对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「红帽客鬼怪大胆无畏，这点大大补充了他们在战术意识上的不足。」\\n～《肯理斯皇家怪物图鉴》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041ed5cd-e414-4ac0-a22b-31d741c7e4ef\', \'multiverseId\': 632912}, \'multiverseid\': 632912}]', '[{\'name\': \'Greifenhorst\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Greif-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Davins Herz schwoll an mit einer berauschenden Mischung aus Aufregung und Angst. Wenn der junge Greif ihn akzeptierte, würde er seinen Weg zum Ritter beginnen."\\n—Himmel von Ardenthal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f443bf1-279a-48ff-ba48-49c2f9d3ae5d\', \'multiverseId\': 632496}, \'multiverseid\': 632496}, {\'name\': \'Nido de grifos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Grifo blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El corazón de Davin latía con una mezcla de emoción y miedo. La aceptación del joven grifo era el primer paso en su viaje para convertirse en caballero".\\n—Cielos del Valle de Arden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeb0e8c8-ef94-4d7e-ad56-b1354ccdb285\', \'multiverseId\': 632559}, \'multiverseid\': 632559}, {\'name\': \'Aérain de griffons\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Griffon avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le cœur de Davin se gonfla d\'un mélange d\'excitation et de peur. Si le jeune griffon l\'acceptait, ce serait un premier pas pour devenir chevalier. »\\n—Les cieux d\'Ardenval", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632622&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a3cab3-38d9-4a22-b89e-c2ff5a819fc4\', \'multiverseId\': 632622}, \'multiverseid\': 632622}, {\'name\': \'Nido di Grifoni\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Grifone 2/2 bianca con volare.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il cuore di Davin si gonfiò di emozione e paura in egual modo. Se il giovane grifone l\\\'avesse accettato, avrebbe iniziato il suo cammino per il cavalierato."\\n—Cieli di Ardenvalle\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94ebf7cb-10dd-4b5d-a460-619d6ffee84c\', \'multiverseId\': 632685}, \'multiverseid\': 632685}, {\'name\': \'グリフィンの高楼\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、飛行を持つ白の２/２のグリフィン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ダヴィンの胸は入り交じる興奮と恐怖とで一杯で、めまいしそうなほどでした。この若いグリフィンが彼を受け入れたなら、彼は騎士への道を歩み出せるのです。」\\n――「アーデンベイルの蒼穹」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'308faf8a-1ce3-4ad2-9204-3c3c1e7ed8a1\', \'multiverseId\': 632748}, \'multiverseid\': 632748}, {\'name\': \'Ninho dos Grifos\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você ganhou 3 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Grifo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O coração de Davin se encheu de um misto de empolgação e medo. Se o jovem grifo o aceitasse, seria o início de sua jornada para se tornar um cavaleiro."\\n— Céus do Vale Arden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b46aa6f-0fbe-46ed-bfe1-cb1b6b84ce22\', \'multiverseId\': 632811}, \'multiverseid\': 632811}, {\'name\': \'狮鹫栖巢\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得过3点或更多生命，则派出一个2/2白色，具飞行异能的狮鹫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「戴文心潮澎湃，惊喜交加：如果这年轻狮鹫接纳了他，他便能就此踏上骑士之路。」\\n～《雅登瓦青云志》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0898795-d5fa-42ac-94bd-fb747a8f5e14\', \'multiverseId\': 632874}, \'multiverseid\': 632874}]', '[{\'name\': \'Griff des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Griff des Schicksals ins Spiel kommt, schicke für jeden Gegner bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die jener Spieler kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis der Griff des Schicksals das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Hexe umwickelte ihr Herz in Dornenranken und versteckte es in dem alten Bergfried in den Tiefen des Waldes. Wenn es niemand finden konnte, konnte die Prophezeiung niemals in Erfüllung gehen."\\n—Jenseits des Großen Steinkreises\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632494&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba677672-43d5-4d87-85c4-856924494910\', \'multiverseId\': 632494}, \'multiverseid\': 632494}, {\'name\': \'Yugo del destino\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Yugo del destino entre al campo de batalla, por cada oponente, exilia hasta un permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla ese jugador hasta que el Yugo del destino deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La bruja envolvió su corazón en zarzas y lo escondió en la antigua fortaleza en lo más profundo del bosque. Si nadie era capaz de encontrarlo, la profecía nunca llegaría a cumplirse".\\n—Más allá del Gran Crómlech\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077103a7-4093-4d9c-8d47-198118712c3b\', \'multiverseId\': 632557}, \'multiverseid\': 632557}, {\'name\': \'Emprise du destin\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Emprise du destin arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, exilez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle jusqu\'à ce que l\'Emprise du destin quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« La sorcière enveloppa son cœur de ronces, puis le dissimula dans le vieux donjon, au plus profond de la forêt. Si nul ne pouvait le trouver, la prophétie ne se réaliserait jamais. »\\n—Au-delà du Grand Cromlech\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b22ccf-c085-4617-aa33-3fb6af94199a\', \'multiverseId\': 632620}, \'multiverseid\': 632620}, {\'name\': \'Stretta del Fato\', \'text\': \'Quando la Stretta del Fato entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni avversario, esilia fino a un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore finché la Stretta del Fato non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La strega avvolse il suo cuore in viticci di rovi e lo nascose nell\\\'antica fortezza nelle profondità della foresta. Se nessuno l\\\'avesse trovato, la profezia non si sarebbe mai avverata."\\n—Oltre il Grande Monolito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4218224e-2f21-4ff0-85e3-342a6082a354\', \'multiverseId\': 632683}, \'multiverseid\': 632683}, {\'name\': \'命運の掌握\', \'text\': \'命運の掌握が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。命運の掌握が戦場を離れるまで、それらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「魔女は自分の心臓を茨のつるで包み、森の深くにある古代の砦に隠した。誰もそれを見つけられなければ、予言は決して実現しないだろう。」\\n――「グレートヘンジを超えて」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bec22f2-2501-4bc0-a999-69a43efa4949\', \'multiverseId\': 632746}, \'multiverseid\': 632746}, {\'name\': \'Garras do Destino\', \'text\': \'Quando Garras do Destino entrar no campo de batalha, para cada oponente, exile até uma permanente alvo não de terreno que aquele jogador controla, até que Garras do Destino deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A bruxa envolveu o próprio coração em sarças e o escondeu numa antiga bastilha nas profundezas da floresta. Se ninguém conseguisse encontrá-lo, a profecia jamais se realizaria."\\n— Além do Grande Círculo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'958c8ad4-2bb8-449b-877c-a01a324dabb7\', \'multiverseId\': 632809}, \'multiverseid\': 632809}, {\'name\': \'命运之攫\', \'text\': \'当命运之攫进战场时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～放逐至多一个目标由该牌手操控的非地永久物，直到命运之攫离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「巫婆用荆条将她心脏包起，藏进树林深处的古堡当中。如果无人能够找到她心在何处，预言也就不可能成真。」\\n～《圆石阵奇谭》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'464e7ff6-21f6-4175-b872-5bb249ca6bb4\', \'multiverseId\': 632872}, \'multiverseid\': 632872}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grundsteuer\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Diese Stadt versperrt mir frech die Sicht!\\\' sagte die Hexe. Der Riese verbeugte sich und lächelte."\\n—Die Gänsemutter und andere Märchen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632500&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51ab7c9-9f13-4138-ac6e-a5ca4b82c90a\', \'multiverseId\': 632500}, \'multiverseid\': 632500}, {\'name\': \'Impuesto sobre las tierras\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, mostrarlas, ponerlas en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"—¡¿Cómo se atreve ese pueblucho a tapar mis vistas?! —dijo la bruja. El gigante hizo una reverencia y sonrió".\\n—La mamá gansa y otros cuentos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69855443-6757-44ef-b581-820d586c6c38\', \'multiverseId\': 632563}, \'multiverseid\': 632563}, {\'name\': \'Contribution foncière\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, les révéler, les mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« "Cette ville me fait l\\\'affront de gâcher le paysage !" déclara la sorcière. Le géant s\\\'inclina et sourit. »\\n—La mère l\\\'oie et autres contes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632626&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a8edbf-23d6-4a2e-aaed-77d84ee6ac4f\', \'multiverseId\': 632626}, \'multiverseid\': 632626}, {\'name\': \'Tassa sulle Terre\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se un avversario controlla più terre di te, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte terra base, rivelarle e aggiungerle alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Quella città è un affronto alla mia vista!\\\' disse la strega. Il gigante si inchinò e sorrise."\\n—Mamma Oca e Altri Racconti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'995d9fc3-053c-4546-9585-e92178ac4305\', \'multiverseId\': 632689}, \'multiverseid\': 632689}, {\'name\': \'土地税\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「『無礼にもあの町はわしの眺望の邪魔をしておる！』魔女は言った。巨人は身をかがめてお辞儀をし、微笑んだ。」\\n――「ガチョウの母」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24bf23c3-26f7-41e0-a491-8a9a11b52f41\', \'multiverseId\': 632752}, \'multiverseid\': 632752}, {\'name\': \'Imposto Territorial\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se um oponente controla mais terrenos que você, você pode procurar até três cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-los, colocá-los na sua mão e embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Aquela cidadezinha mal educada está atrapalhando a minha vista!\\\', disse a bruxa. O gigante curvou-se e sorriu."\\n— A Mamãe Ganso e Outras Histórias\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db557b3c-405a-4517-a76e-f53db837fa91\', \'multiverseId\': 632815}, \'multiverseid\': 632815}, {\'name\': \'抽地税\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则你可以从你牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「『那小镇把我视野挡得干干净净！』巫婆愤怒道。巨人微笑欠身，得令退下。」\\n～《鹅鹅妈故事集》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e817487b-3d18-4715-8d1e-91ad03cbca11\', \'multiverseId\': 632878}, \'multiverseid\': 632878}]', '[{\'name\': \'Harte Auswirkungen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn einer Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, fügen die Harten Auswirkungen dem Beherrscher jener Kreatur entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Tugrunn holte zu einem Schlag nach dem anderen aus und heulte vor Schmerz, als seine Faust auf festen Fels traf. Die Kreatur starrte ihn nur fragend an, unsicher, wann der Kampf beginnen würde."\\n—Die Gänsemutter und andere Märchen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96814bc-356e-4dc1-9cbc-b97b1226ebb9\', \'multiverseId\': 632539}, \'multiverseid\': 632539}, {\'name\': \'Repercusión\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura reciba daño, la Repercusión hace esa misma cantidad de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tugrunn lanzó golpe tras golpe, aullando de dolor cuando su puño chocó contra una robusta roca. La criatura se limitó a mirarlo inquisitivamente, sin saber muy bien cuándo empezaría la pelea".\\n—La mamá gansa y otros cuentos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b97331-d4a3-428b-af52-da381cbf257c\', \'multiverseId\': 632602}, \'multiverseid\': 632602}, {\'name\': \'Répercussion\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature subit des blessures, la Répercussion inflige autant de blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Tugrunn asséna coup après coup, hurlant de douleur lorsque son poing rencontrait la roche solide. La créature se contenta de l\'observer d\'un air interrogateur, ne sachant pas quand le combat allait commencer. »\\n—La mère l\'oie et autres contes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632665&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625c1cee-ea0b-4940-85fd-eacb61579f59\', \'multiverseId\': 632665}, \'multiverseid\': 632665}, {\'name\': \'Ripercussione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno a una creatura, la Ripercussione infligge altrettanti danni al controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tugrunn tirava colpo su colpo, urlando di dolore all\\\'impatto con la roccia. La creatura lo guardava perplessa, incerta se il combattimento fosse iniziato."\\n—Mamma Oca e Altri Racconti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8f0d09-a5ef-4da0-afbb-b021b10ac256\', \'multiverseId\': 632728}, \'multiverseid\': 632728}, {\'name\': \'反動\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体がダメージを受けるたび、反動はそのクリーチャーのコントローラーにその点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ターグランは、硬い岩を殴りつける痛みに吠えながら、拳の連打を叩き込んだ。そのクリーチャーはいぶかしげに彼を見つめるだけだった。戦いが始まったとすら理解していないようだった。」\\n――「ガチョウの母」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93572cc4-f599-4a89-bad1-5f7e59b180ba\', \'multiverseId\': 632791}, \'multiverseid\': 632791}, {\'name\': \'Reverberação\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura sofre dano, Reverberação causa aquela quantidade de dano ao controlador daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tugrunn deu golpe após golpe, uivando de dor conforme seus punhos se chocavam com a rocha sólida. A criatura se limitou a observá-lo, confusa, sem saber ao certo quando a luta começaria."\\n— A Mamãe Ganso e Outras Histórias\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df68e15-e1bd-43fb-8683-ca2a068889a2\', \'multiverseId\': 632854}, \'multiverseid\': 632854}, {\'name\': \'后遗症\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物受到伤害时，后遗症对该生物的操控者造成等量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「图古伦接连出击，拳点如雨，但又因捶石吃痛而哀叫不断。对方只是不解地看着他，不知道这场架什么时候才能开始。」\\n～《鹅鹅妈故事集》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41e62bb0-8ff9-4d37-adcb-9cedad941902\', \'multiverseId\': 632917}, \'multiverseid\': 632917}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hoffnungsschimmer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{3}{W}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein mit Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie war die aufgehende Sonne, ihr Mut vertrieb die Schrecken der Nacht."\\n—Legende der Güldenen Ritter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632493&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'068bf2e1-2149-4236-ba40-e5887b377666\', \'multiverseId\': 632493}, \'multiverseid\': 632493}, {\'name\': \'Alba de esperanza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Su valentía, como el sol al amanecer, acababa con los horrores de la noche".\\n—Leyenda de los Caballeros Áureos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e4aab26-646c-4aa5-911d-0a8828b4de22\', \'multiverseId\': 632556}, \'multiverseid\': 632556}, {\'name\': "Aube de l\'espoir", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\n{3}{W} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat avec le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Elle était le soleil levant, son courage bannissant les terreurs de la nuit. »\\n—Légende des Chevaliers dorés\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632619&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3a919f-eff4-4233-9b6d-1b6251ebe9e8\', \'multiverseId\': 632619}, \'multiverseid\': 632619}, {\'name\': \'Alba di Speranza\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca con legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Era la luce dell\\\'alba, il cui coraggio bandisce gli orrori della notte."\\n—Leggenda dei Cavalieri Dorati\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'494e0358-53b9-4309-9627-1979930814cb\', \'multiverseId\': 632682}, \'multiverseid\': 632682}, {\'name\': \'希望の夜明け\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\\n{3}{W}：絆魂を持つ白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女は昇る朝日、その勇気は夜の恐怖を打ち払う。」\\n――「金色騎士の伝説」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1a45aa-8cb4-4b10-989c-be050cb8a509\', \'multiverseId\': 632745}, \'multiverseid\': 632745}, {\'name\': \'Aurora da Esperança\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\\n{3}{W}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Soldado branca 1/1 com vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ela era o sol nascente, e sua coragem expulsava os terrores da noite."\\n— Lenda dos Cavaleiros Dourados\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4780b1-b3df-4ab8-ac5a-793fe34c0041\', \'multiverseId\': 632808}, \'multiverseid\': 632808}, {\'name\': \'希望曙光\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\\n{3}{W}：派出一个1/1白色，具系命异能的士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「她乃初升之朝阳，其勇气如万丈光芒刺破长空，将黯夜恐惧全数驱散。」\\n～《金辉骑士传》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92668e7e-a6e0-4196-b3f8-eed2ce9070af\', \'multiverseId\': 632871}, \'multiverseid\': 632871}]', '[{\'name\': \'In Frieden ruhen\', \'text\': \'Wenn In Frieden ruhen ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Friedhöfe ins Exil.\\nFalls eine Karte oder ein Spielstein von irgendwoher auf einen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke sie bzw. ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der König ordnete an, die Entschlafenen in gläserne Särge zu legen, um sie zu beschützen und zu bewachen, falls sie eines Tages erwachen sollten."\\n—Der Böse Schlummer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632503&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70f0cb51-a90e-4018-8de8-ec153c3c95f8\', \'multiverseId\': 632503}, \'multiverseid\': 632503}, {\'name\': \'Descanse en paz\', \'text\': \'Cuando Descanse en paz entre al campo de batalla, exilia todos los cementerios.\\nSi una carta o ficha fuera a ir a un cementerio desde cualquier parte, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El rey dio la orden de poner a todos aquellos perdidos en el sueño en féretros de cristal, protegidos y vigilados, por si algún día despertaban".\\n—El Sueño embrujado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9976aca3-b5f2-42b8-aed6-3343326024c5\', \'multiverseId\': 632566}, \'multiverseid\': 632566}, {\'name\': \'Repose en paix\', \'text\': "Quand Repose en paix arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez tous les cimetières.\\nSi une carte ou un jeton devait être mis dans un cimetière d\'où qu\'il vienne, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le roi ordonna que les victimes du Sommeil maléfique soient placées dans des cocons de verre, protégées et surveillées au cas où elles s\'éveilleraient un jour. »\\n—Le Sommeil maléfique", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2b9e5a0-9b5f-4b69-af80-eeac406041c1\', \'multiverseId\': 632629}, \'multiverseid\': 632629}, {\'name\': \'Riposa in Pace\', \'text\': \'Quando Riposa in Pace entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutti i cimiteri.\\nSe una carta o una pedina sta per essere messa in un cimitero da qualsiasi zona, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il re ordinò che gli addormentati fossero posizionati in feretri di cristallo, protetti e osservati fino al giorno in cui si sarebbero risvegliati."\\n—Il Sonno Stregato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca2183b-ae9a-4e94-9174-8d656b3f4979\', \'multiverseId\': 632692}, \'multiverseid\': 632692}, {\'name\': \'安らかなる眠り\', \'text\': \'安らかなる眠りが戦場に出たとき、すべての墓地を追放する。\\nカードやトークンがいずこかから墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「王は眠りに落ちた者をガラスの棺に納めさせました。そしていつか目覚める日のために、保護し、見守るように命じたのです。」\\n――「忌まわしき眠り」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b29d296-8af1-4662-8b24-0aef78262142\', \'multiverseId\': 632755}, \'multiverseid\': 632755}, {\'name\': \'Descanse em Paz\', \'text\': \'Quando Descanse em Paz entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cemitérios.\\nSe um card ou uma ficha seria colocado em um cemitério vindo de qualquer lugar, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O rei ordenou que os perdidos no sono fossem colocados em esquifes de vidro, protegidos e vigiados para o caso de um dia acordarem."\\n— O Sono Maldito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a666bfd6-3289-4761-9a93-3b1bd382bcce\', \'multiverseId\': 632818}, \'multiverseid\': 632818}, {\'name\': \'得享安息\', \'text\': \'当得享安息进战场时，放逐所有坟墓场。\\n如果某牌或衍生物将从任何区域进入坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「国王下令，将迷失沉睡者置于玻璃棺中照护看管，静待他们有朝苏醒。」\\n～《恶邪倦眠咒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'386d3a31-cdfe-4bc7-bf62-87838a05cd5f\', \'multiverseId\': 632881}, \'multiverseid\': 632881}]', '[{\'name\': \'Innerer Drang\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.\\n{1}{U}, opfere den Inneren Drang: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„O meine Liebste, wenn du nur könntest verstehen!\\nDas Abenteuer ruft und ich muss gehen."\\n—„Die Gelehrte und die Ritterin"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9ea742-cb5f-49eb-bb6c-0446878ae31c\', \'multiverseId\': 632506}, \'multiverseid\': 632506}, {\'name\': \'Compulsión\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, descartar una carta: Roba una carta.\\n{1}{U}, sacrificar la Compulsión: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Oh, amor mío, espero que me puedas comprender!\\nLa aventura aguarda, el viaje debo emprender".\\n—"La erudita y la caballero"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb7e280-a191-483a-85c0-7345d845af75\', \'multiverseId\': 632569}, \'multiverseid\': 632569}, {\'name\': \'Compulsion\', \'text\': "{1}{U}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte.\\n{1}{U}, sacrifiez la Compulsion : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Ô mon amour, que j\'aimerais que tu comprennes !\\nL\'aventure m\'appelle et me dicte sa loi souveraine. »\\n—« L\'Érudit et le Chevalier »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632632&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'005be64e-7f25-47eb-8f89-90f763d33127\', \'multiverseId\': 632632}, \'multiverseid\': 632632}, {\'name\': \'Obbligo\', \'text\': "{1}{U}, Scarta una carta: Pesca una carta.\\n{1}{U}, Sacrifica l\'Obbligo: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mia cara amata, se tu potessi capire!\\nL\\\'avventura mi chiama, devo partire."\\n—"L\\\'Allieva e la Cavaliera"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7547aa04-55dc-4ad8-b683-1786b7379431\', \'multiverseId\': 632695}, \'multiverseid\': 632695}, {\'name\': \'強制\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, カード１枚を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。\\n{1}{U}, 強制を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「おお愛しい人よ、どうかわかっておくれ！\\n冒険が招いている、私はその手を取らねばならぬのだ。」\\n――「学士と騎士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb67b4de-577f-4a63-bc0d-47d21e9bfbfb\', \'multiverseId\': 632758}, \'multiverseid\': 632758}, {\'name\': \'Compulsão\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, descarte um card: Compre um card.\\n{1}{U}, sacrifique Compulsão: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ó, meu amor, quisera eu ter a sua compreensão!\\nA aventura chama, e preciso deixar que me leve pela mão."\\n— "A Erudita e o Cavaleiro"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bebf6c6-574b-424f-99ec-8211aa50e3fb\', \'multiverseId\': 632821}, \'multiverseid\': 632821}, {\'name\': \'强迫症\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}，弃一张牌：抓一张牌。\\n{1}{U}，牺牲强迫症：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「卿卿吾爱，盼你领情！\\n冒险呼唤，需我远行。」\\n～「学者与骑士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9cd9d2-51c4-4115-9b68-1a4f89d3d535\', \'multiverseId\': 632884}, \'multiverseid\': 632884}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ley-Linie der Blitze\', \'text\': \'Falls die Ley-Linie der Blitze auf deiner Starthand ist, kannst du die Partie mit ihr im Spiel beginnen.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, fügt die Ley-Linie der Blitze einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'321ca34c-5ff6-489a-8cd5-7297a10561b0\', \'multiverseId\': 632536}, \'multiverseid\': 632536}, {\'name\': \'Línea mística del relámpago\', \'text\': \'Si la Línea mística del relámpago está en tu mano inicial, puedes comenzar el juego con ella en el campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, la Línea mística del relámpago hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7563c4-9419-4e89-a9d8-e6aca4266e40\', \'multiverseId\': 632599}, \'multiverseid\': 632599}, {\'name\': "Ligne ley d\'éclairs", \'text\': "Si la Ligne ley d\'éclairs est dans votre main de départ, vous pouvez l\'avoir sur le champ de bataille au début de la partie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, la Ligne ley d\'éclairs inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632662&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86dc5a14-23a3-41cd-b5ac-d2ba2713de6d\', \'multiverseId\': 632662}, \'multiverseid\': 632662}, {\'name\': \'Leyline del Fulmine\', \'text\': \'Se la Leyline del Fulmine è nella tua mano iniziale, puoi cominciare la partita con essa sul campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, la Leyline del Fulmine infligge 1 danno a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427f764b-6862-4efc-acf2-26d4a0960b2b\', \'multiverseId\': 632725}, \'multiverseid\': 632725}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の力線\', \'text\': \'稲妻の力線があなたのゲーム開始時の手札にあるなら、あなたはこれが戦場に出ている状態でゲームを開始してもよい。\\nあなたが呪文１つを唱えるたび、プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、稲妻の力線はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c345f588-67ec-40b2-8b0c-4884187679c2\', \'multiverseId\': 632788}, \'multiverseid\': 632788}, {\'name\': \'Linha de Força do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Se Linha de Força do Relâmpago estiver em sua mão de abertura, você poderá começar o jogo com ela no campo de batalha.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, Linha de Força do Relâmpago causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a2e923e-720a-4259-824f-aa59a8925177\', \'multiverseId\': 632851}, \'multiverseid\': 632851}, {\'name\': \'雷电地脉\', \'text\': \'如果你的起手牌中包含了雷电地脉，则你可以让它在战场上来开始游戏。\\n每当你施放咒语时，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则雷电地脉对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a35276e-4263-4214-9b45-d0aa2fe3e614\', \'multiverseId\': 632914}, \'multiverseid\': 632914}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ley-Linie der Heiligkeit\', \'text\': \'Falls die Ley-Linie der Heiligkeit auf deiner Starthand ist, kannst du die Partie mit ihr im Spiel beginnen.\\nDu hast Fluchsicherheit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine verwunschene Lichtung tat sich auf und bot Sicherheit in ihrer warmen Umarmung. Dennoch ging sie weiter."\\n—Die namenlose Ritterin des Sommers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e319e14-0345-4169-81b0-b30cc4ab152c\', \'multiverseId\': 632501}, \'multiverseid\': 632501}, {\'name\': \'Línea mística de la santidad\', \'text\': \'Si la Línea mística de la santidad está en tu mano inicial, puedes comenzar el juego con ella en el campo de batalla.\\nTienes la habilidad de antimaleficio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Y entonces apareció un claro encantado, que ofrecía seguridad con un abrazo cálido. De todas formas, ella continuó andando".\\n—La caballero sin nombre del verano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89d1e91-a099-4dd0-87dd-1d80412563aa\', \'multiverseId\': 632564}, \'multiverseid\': 632564}, {\'name\': \'Ligne ley de vertu\', \'text\': "Si la Ligne ley de vertu est dans votre main de départ, vous pouvez l\'avoir sur le champ de bataille au début de la partie.\\nVous avez la défense talismanique.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Une clairière enchantée, promesse de sécurité dans sa chaude étreinte, se révéla à elle. Pourtant, elle poursuivit sa route. »\\n—La Chevalière sans nom de l\'été", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632627&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b959c8-39bf-4f2d-b204-bd78ff96a8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 632627}, \'multiverseid\': 632627}, {\'name\': \'Leyline della Sacralità\', \'text\': \'Se la Leyline della Sacralità è nella tua mano iniziale, puoi cominciare la partita con essa sul campo di battaglia.\\nHai anti-malocchio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una radura incantata si svelò alla vista, offrendo sicurezza nel suo caldo abbraccio. Ma, imperterrita, lei continuò la sua marcia."\\n—La Cavaliera Senza Nome dell\\\'Estate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fef99a2f-3750-4e05-bf81-e399ed6854ce\', \'multiverseId\': 632690}, \'multiverseid\': 632690}, {\'name\': \'神聖の力線\', \'text\': \'神聖の力線があなたのゲーム開始時の手札にあるなら、あなたはこれが戦場に出ている状態でゲームを開始してもよい。\\nあなたは呪禁を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「森の木々が招くかのようにひらけて、暖かな休憩所のような魔法の草地が現れました。彼女は構わず歩き続けます。」\\n――「夏の無名騎士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236b6cdb-8e39-4c5d-abf4-791f2e463690\', \'multiverseId\': 632753}, \'multiverseid\': 632753}, {\'name\': \'Linha de Força da Santidade\', \'text\': \'Se Linha de Força da Santidade estiver em sua mão de abertura, você poderá começar o jogo com ela no campo de batalha.\\nVocê tem resistência a magia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma clareira encantada se revelou, oferecendo segurança num abraço caloroso. E ainda assim ela continuou a caminhar."\\n— A Cavaleira Sem Nome do Verão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb1e4f5-b17d-4e28-b5d0-9db5062deb3a\', \'multiverseId\': 632816}, \'multiverseid\': 632816}, {\'name\': \'圣洁地脉\', \'text\': \'如果你的起手牌中包含了圣洁地脉，则你可以让它在战场上来开始游戏。\\n你具有辟邪异能。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「她眼前出现一片魔法林地，温暖宜人，似可长留此处安全无忧。但她未加理会，径直前行。」\\n～《无名仲夏骑士传》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'182eef67-c320-4d45-b73f-b25127154953\', \'multiverseId\': 632879}, \'multiverseid\': 632879}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ley-Linie der Leere\', \'text\': \'Falls die Ley-Linie der Leere auf deiner Starthand ist, kannst du die Partie mit ihr im Spiel beginnen.\\nFalls eine Karte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Bösartige Lichter pulsierten um sie herum und flüsterten von Reichtümern in der Dunkelheit. Dennoch ging sie weiter."\\n—Die namenlose Ritterin des Sommers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f8b29e-8e9e-406a-9f5c-5db3d0023105\', \'multiverseId\': 632521}, \'multiverseid\': 632521}, {\'name\': \'Línea mística del vacío\', \'text\': \'Si la Línea mística del vacío está en tu mano inicial, puedes comenzar el juego con ella en el campo de batalla.\\nSi una carta fuera a ir al cementerio de un oponente desde cualquier parte, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Unas luces malévolas comenzaron a brillar a su alrededor, susurrándole al oído las riquezas que podría encontrar en la oscuridad. De todas formas, ella continuó andando".\\n—La caballero sin nombre del verano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37cf696-c833-440a-a4a5-535c81100198\', \'multiverseId\': 632584}, \'multiverseid\': 632584}, {\'name\': \'Ligne ley du vide\', \'text\': "Si la Ligne ley du vide est dans votre main de départ, vous pouvez l\'avoir sur le champ de bataille au début de la partie.\\nSi une carte devait être mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Autour d\'elle palpitaient des lumières maléfiques, murmurant au sujet de richesses dans les ténèbres. Pourtant, elle poursuivit sa route. »\\n—La Chevalière sans nom de l\'été", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632647&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'681f2af0-a675-4a23-8804-d922d550f5df\', \'multiverseId\': 632647}, \'multiverseid\': 632647}, {\'name\': \'Leyline del Nulla\', \'text\': \'Se la Leyline del Nulla è nella tua mano iniziale, puoi cominciare la partita con essa sul campo di battaglia.\\nSe una carta sta per essere messa nel cimitero di un avversario da qualsiasi zona, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Luci malevole pulsavano intorno a lei, promettendo ricchezze nell\\\'oscurità. Ma, imperterrita, lei continuò la sua marcia."\\n—Il Cavaliere Senza Nome dell\\\'Estate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b186183f-86b6-4414-89e3-6fe368562703\', \'multiverseId\': 632710}, \'multiverseid\': 632710}, {\'name\': \'虚空の力線\', \'text\': \'虚空の力線があなたのゲーム開始時の手札にあるなら、あなたはこれが戦場に出ている状態でゲームを開始してもよい。\\nカードがいずこかから対戦相手の墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女の周りで邪な明かりが脈打ち、闇の中で富貴を囁きかけました。彼女は構わず歩き続けます。」\\n――「夏の無名騎士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97dc3858-6899-416d-8167-5dea5de28e87\', \'multiverseId\': 632773}, \'multiverseid\': 632773}, {\'name\': \'Linha de Força do Vácuo\', \'text\': \'Se Linha de Força do Vácuo estiver em sua mão de abertura, você poderá começar o jogo com ela no campo de batalha.\\nSe um card seria colocado no cemitério de um oponente vindo de qualquer lugar, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Luzes malévolas pulsavam em torno dela, aos sussurros de riquezas no escuro. E ainda assim ela continuou a caminhar."\\n— A Cavaleira Sem Nome do Verão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be417300-2f8d-4286-9925-21f79fa5ba07\', \'multiverseId\': 632836}, \'multiverseid\': 632836}, {\'name\': \'虚空地脉\', \'text\': \'如果你的起手牌中包含了虚空地脉，则你可以让它在战场上来开始游戏。\\n如果某牌将从任何区域进入对手的坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「她眼前出现一阵邪恶幽光，忽明忽暗，似怕人不知深处藏财富。但她未加理会，径直前行。」\\n～《无名仲夏骑士传》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee67cbe1-5762-4286-b69f-0a0aa788c40e\', \'multiverseId\': 632899}, \'multiverseid\': 632899}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ley-Linie der Vorahnung\', \'text\': \'Falls die Ley-Linie der Vorahnung auf deiner Starthand ist, kannst du die Partie mit ihr im Spiel beginnen.\\nDu kannst Zaubersprüche wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine leuchtende Quelle erschien vor ihr und versprach unermessliche Weisheit. Dennoch ging sie weiter."\\n—Die namenlose Ritterin des Sommers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6409d64b-3fa7-4173-ba86-d1c23b6cbbb1\', \'multiverseId\': 632514}, \'multiverseid\': 632514}, {\'name\': \'Línea mística de la anticipación\', \'text\': \'Si la Línea mística de la anticipación está en tu mano inicial, puedes comenzar el juego con ella en el campo de batalla.\\nPuedes lanzar hechizos como si tuvieran la habilidad de destello.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ante ella apareció un manantial brillante que le prometió sabiduría sobre lo desconocido. De todas formas, ella continuó andando".\\n—La caballero sin nombre del verano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a6295b9-8ebc-4d9d-ad20-daa3609f75aa\', \'multiverseId\': 632577}, \'multiverseid\': 632577}, {\'name\': \'Ligne ley de prescience\', \'text\': "Si la Ligne ley de prescience est dans votre main de départ, vous pouvez l\'avoir sur le champ de bataille au début de la partie.\\nVous pouvez lancer les sorts comme s\'ils avaient le flash.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Devant elle apparut une source rayonnante, promesse de connaissances encore jamais révélées. Pourtant, elle poursuivit sa route. »\\n—La Chevalière sans nom de l\'été", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632640&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faaef447-57e5-4b6e-961c-704d6b27b18a\', \'multiverseId\': 632640}, \'multiverseid\': 632640}, {\'name\': "Leyline dell\'Anticipazione", \'text\': "Se la Leyline dell\'Anticipazione è nella tua mano iniziale, puoi cominciare la partita con essa sul campo di battaglia.\\nPuoi lanciare magie come se avessero lampo.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una primavera radiosa le apparve davanti, promettendo saggezze indicibili. Ma, imperterrita, lei continuò la sua marcia."\\n—La Cavaliera Senza Nome dell\\\'Estate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06b8e883-c070-4de0-91eb-257205bfe72f\', \'multiverseId\': 632703}, \'multiverseid\': 632703}, {\'name\': \'予期の力線\', \'text\': \'予期の力線があなたのゲーム開始時の手札にあるなら、あなたはこれが戦場に出ている状態でゲームを開始してもよい。\\nあなたは呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「計り知れぬ叡智が約束された、輝く泉が彼女の前に現れました。彼女は構わず歩き続けます。」\\n――「夏の無名騎士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a53a73a-47a6-4f1e-baba-837cd64561b6\', \'multiverseId\': 632766}, \'multiverseid\': 632766}, {\'name\': \'Linha de Força da Antecipação\', \'text\': \'Se Linha de Força da Antecipação estiver em sua mão de abertura, você poderá começar o jogo com ela no campo de batalha.\\nVocê pode conjurar mágicas como se elas tivessem lampejo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma fonte luzente apareceu diante dela, prometendo sabedoria indizível. E ainda assim ela continuou a caminhar."\\n— A Cavaleira Sem Nome do Verão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e7ad4f-d4cc-4fc8-be40-b4b6154621df\', \'multiverseId\': 632829}, \'multiverseid\': 632829}, {\'name\': \'先制地脉\', \'text\': \'如果你的起手牌中包含了先制地脉，则你可以让它在战场上来开始游戏。\\n你可以将咒语视同具有闪现异能地来施放。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「她眼前出现一道亮光涌泉，水流淙淙，似在应允传授隐世奇知。但她未加理会，径直前行。」\\n～《无名仲夏骑士传》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a991df-2923-484b-919d-431126ac98ed\', \'multiverseId\': 632892}, \'multiverseid\': 632892}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ley-Linie des Überflusses\', \'text\': \'Falls die Ley-Linie des Überflusses auf deiner Starthand ist, kannst du die Partie mit ihr im Spiel beginnen.\\nImmer wenn du eine Kreatur für Mana tappst, erzeuge ein zusätzliches {G}.\\n{6}{G}{G}: Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e612e82-a6c5-4fce-aaf9-aad0b65f257c\', \'multiverseId\': 632547}, \'multiverseid\': 632547}, {\'name\': \'Línea mística de la abundancia\', \'text\': \'Si la Línea mística de la abundancia está en tu mano inicial, puedes comenzar el juego con ella en el campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que gires una criatura para obtener maná, agrega un {G} adicional.\\n{6}{G}{G}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888d51aa-1c81-4ca2-ab3f-47020d38bf7d\', \'multiverseId\': 632610}, \'multiverseid\': 632610}, {\'name\': "Ligne ley d\'abondance", \'text\': "Si la Ligne ley d\'abondance est dans votre main de départ, vous pouvez l\'avoir sur le champ de bataille au début de la partie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous engagez une créature pour du mana, ajoutez {G} supplémentaire.\\n{6}{G}{G} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632673&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'267a320b-6725-4aa2-b54a-dfaa4710fda8\', \'multiverseId\': 632673}, \'multiverseid\': 632673}, {\'name\': "Leyline dell\'Abbondanza", \'text\': "Se la Leyline dell\'Abbondanza è nella tua mano iniziale, puoi cominciare la partita con essa sul campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta TAPpi una creatura per attingere mana, aggiungi {G} addizionale.\\n{6}{G}{G}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a7ccaa-a63f-42dd-a6b6-abe8cef7ecbb\', \'multiverseId\': 632736}, \'multiverseid\': 632736}, {\'name\': \'豊穣の力線\', \'text\': \'豊穣の力線があなたのゲーム開始時の手札にあるなら、あなたはこれが戦場に出ている状態でゲームを開始してもよい。\\nあなたがマナを引き出す目的でクリーチャー１体をタップするたび、追加で{G}を加える。\\n{6}{G}{G}：あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1afb4351-582c-41d4-9ad0-71a6478e142f\', \'multiverseId\': 632799}, \'multiverseid\': 632799}, {\'name\': \'Linha de Força da Abundância\', \'text\': \'Se Linha de Força da Abundância estiver em sua mão de abertura, você poderá começar o jogo com ela no campo de batalha.\\nToda vez que você virar uma criatura para gerar mana, adicione um {G} adicional.\\n{6}{G}{G}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb940dd-a8f0-44ae-ad38-9f2a4f4dfe34\', \'multiverseId\': 632862}, \'multiverseid\': 632862}, {\'name\': \'丰足地脉\', \'text\': \'如果你的起手牌中包含了丰足地脉，则你可以让它在战场上来开始游戏。\\n每当你横置一个生物以产生法术力时，额外加{G}。\\n{6}{G}{G}：在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'241bcd3d-e79f-4c4a-904f-09e4b2bc1e4e\', \'multiverseId\': 632925}, \'multiverseid\': 632925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Manasegen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler ein Land für Mana tappt, erzeugt er ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, den das Land produziert hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich schenke mein Herz dem Berg, meine Erinnerungen dem Wind. Mein letzter Augenblick soll sich in die Geschichte einbrennen."\\n—Töchter der Flamme\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3c20fb-e62d-4aca-97c2-3a336f0900b5\', \'multiverseId\': 632537}, \'multiverseid\': 632537}, {\'name\': \'Fulgor de maná\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador gire una tierra para obtener maná, ese jugador agrega un maná de cualquier tipo que produzca esa tierra.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Entrego mi corazón a la montaña y mis recuerdos al viento. Que mi último momento quede grabado a fuego en la historia".\\n—Hijas de la llama\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a98f739-5b6a-453c-9712-1e8be57a1981\', \'multiverseId\': 632600}, \'multiverseid\': 632600}, {\'name\': \'Flamboiement de mana\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur engage un terrain pour du mana, ce joueur ajoute un mana de n\'importe quel type que ce terrain a produit.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« J\'offre mon cœur à la montagne et mes souvenirs au vent. Que mes derniers instants se consument dans l\'histoire. »\\n—Filles des flammes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632663&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82691394-b462-48da-b049-4bd4d6445263\', \'multiverseId\': 632663}, \'multiverseid\': 632663}, {\'name\': \'Eruzione di Mana\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore TAPpa una terra per attingere mana, quel giocatore aggiunge un mana di un qualsiasi tipo prodotto da quella terra.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dono il mio cuore alla montagna, i miei ricordi al vento. Per sempre nella storia arderà il mio ultimo momento."\\n—Figlie della Fiamma\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c014b1-5438-4fa3-a429-7bc4e9ca742b\', \'multiverseId\': 632726}, \'multiverseid\': 632726}, {\'name\': \'ほとばしる魔力\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがマナを引き出す目的で土地１つをタップするたび、そのプレイヤーは、その土地が生み出したマナのタイプのうち望むタイプのマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「私は心臓を山に、記憶を風に捧げた。私の最後の瞬間は、歴史へと焼き付けることにしよう。」\\n――「炎の娘たち」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99069487-3572-4b7a-9f65-826524020f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 632789}, \'multiverseid\': 632789}, {\'name\': \'Fulgor de Mana\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador vira um terreno para gerar mana, ele adiciona um mana de qualquer tipo que aquele terreno gere.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu coração dou à montanha, minhas memórias dou ao vento. Gravado seja a fogo na história meu último momento."\\n— Filhas da Chama\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33292871-e650-4057-a5e7-e84e7537f62a\', \'multiverseId\': 632852}, \'multiverseid\': 632852}, {\'name\': \'魔法力闪光\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手横置一个地以产生法术力时，该牌手加一点该地已产生的类别之法术力。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我将心胸献给山河，将记忆奉予清风。就让我焚烧自己，将生命最后时刻写入历史。」\\n～《烈焰的女儿》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19186c06-815e-404b-b8e9-7458274444ed\', \'multiverseId\': 632915}, \'multiverseid\': 632915}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nekropotenz\', \'text\': \'Übergehe dein Ziehsegment.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte abwirfst, schicke sie aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nBezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek verdeckt ins Exil. Nimm sie zu Beginn deines nächsten Endsegments auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632522&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ebadd71-7a93-41b1-88a7-d252bd2f75e8\', \'multiverseId\': 632522}, \'multiverseid\': 632522}, {\'name\': \'Necropotencia\', \'text\': \'Sáltate tu paso de robar.\\nSiempre que descartes una carta, exilia esa carta de tu cementerio.\\nPagar 1 vida: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca boca abajo. Pon esa carta en tu mano al comienzo de tu próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c32b3c7-3d10-46b7-88db-d4cc9a155b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 632585}, \'multiverseid\': 632585}, {\'name\': \'Nécropuissance\', \'text\': "Passez votre étape de pioche.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière.\\nPayez 1 point de vie : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque face cachée. Mettez cette carte dans votre main au début de votre prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632648&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146751bf-3e5a-40a8-8549-6c881ba30d99\', \'multiverseId\': 632648}, \'multiverseid\': 632648}, {\'name\': \'Necropotenza\', \'text\': "Salta la tua acquisizione.\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una carta, esilia quella carta dal tuo cimitero.\\nPaga 1 punto vita: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio a faccia in giù. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano all\'inizio della tua prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd82a65e-a093-436c-b029-647762350ae7\', \'multiverseId\': 632711}, \'multiverseid\': 632711}, {\'name\': \'ネクロポーテンス\', \'text\': \'あなたのドロー・ステップを飛ばす。\\nあなたがカード１枚を捨てるたび、あなたの墓地にあるそのカードを追放する。\\n１点のライフを支払う：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を裏向きで追放する。次のあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d322f83-2742-4e60-901e-ed2b2448b9a3\', \'multiverseId\': 632774}, \'multiverseid\': 632774}, {\'name\': \'Necropotência\', \'text\': \'Pule sua etapa de compra.\\nToda vez que você descartar um card, exile aquele card de seu cemitério.\\nPague 1 ponto de vida: Exile com a face voltada para baixo o card do topo de seu grimório. Coloque aquele card em sua mão no início de sua próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ae6918-7cf7-4345-afa0-3511ed14e8b7\', \'multiverseId\': 632837}, \'multiverseid\': 632837}, {\'name\': \'死冥权能\', \'text\': \'略过你的抓牌步骤。\\n每当你弃一张牌时，将该牌从你的坟墓场放逐。\\n支付1点生命：牌面朝下地放逐你的牌库顶牌。在你的下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8478b2a0-d574-4d29-b8cb-9b88838fb1ab\', \'multiverseId\': 632900}, \'multiverseid\': 632900}]', '[{\'name\': \'Neugier\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Valtry schnappte nach Luft. Die seltsame neue Koralle war gar keine Koralle, sondern ein gefallener Trockenläufer! Aber wie war er auf den Grund von Loch Larent gelangt?"\\n—Die wandelnde Meerfrau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddae5e42-6ea8-4c2f-9a42-83f7206cdf2b\', \'multiverseId\': 632508}, \'multiverseid\': 632508}, {\'name\': \'Curiosidad\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada haga daño a un oponente, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Valtry jadeó. ¡El nuevo y extraño coral no era tal, sino un pisatierra caído! Pero, ¿cómo llegó al fondo del lago Larent?".\\n—La tritona que caminó\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d28d8a3-cbee-4fc9-a9c1-7080603e983a\', \'multiverseId\': 632571}, \'multiverseid\': 632571}, {\'name\': \'Curiosité\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée inflige des blessures à un adversaire, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "« Valtry retint un cri de surprise. Ce nouveau corail étrange n\'était pas un corail du tout, mais un pied-sec mort ! Comment avait-il fini au fond du Loch Larent ? »\\n—L\'ondine qui marchait", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632634&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d83abd-f141-46ed-91b9-1529e782d6e0\', \'multiverseId\': 632634}, \'multiverseid\': 632634}, {\'name\': \'Curiosità\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata infligge danno a un avversario, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Valtry sussultò. Quella strana formazione non era corallo, bensì il cadavere di un piediasciutti! Ma com\\\'era finito sul fondale di Loch Larent?"\\n—La Tritona che Camminò\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1c52e3-9d22-49ea-ab2e-7fcb5bdc0591\', \'multiverseId\': 632697}, \'multiverseid\': 632697}, {\'name\': \'好奇心\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「ヴァルトリィは息を呑んだ。その奇妙で新しいサンゴは、実のところサンゴなどではなく、死んだ陸歩きだったのだ！しかしこれはどのようにしてローラン湖の底にたどり着いたのだ？」\\n――「歩み来たマーフォーク」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e0f36f6-ea89-409e-b696-242d1aaac087\', \'multiverseId\': 632760}, \'multiverseid\': 632760}, {\'name\': \'Curiosidade\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada causa dano a um oponente, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Valtry arquejou. O novo coral estranho não era coral nenhum, mas um pé-seco morto! Mas como isso chegou ao fundo do Lago Larent?"\\n— A Tritã que Caminhou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90071038-2b24-4b99-83b1-decf38f316e0\', \'multiverseId\': 632823}, \'multiverseid\': 632823}, {\'name\': \'好奇\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n每当所结附的生物向任一对手造成伤害时，你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「瓦翠惊得倒吸一口气：这株奇怪的新生珊瑚根本就不是珊瑚，而是一个落水的地上人！但它又是怎样来到拉伦特湖底的呢？」\\n～《长脚的人鱼》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79852d34-ad88-46ff-8978-e76c61945ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 632886}, \'multiverseid\': 632886}]', '[{\'name\': \'Parallel-Leben\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Effekt einen oder mehrere Spielsteine unter deiner Kontrolle erzeugen würde, erzeugt er stattdessen doppelt so viele solcher Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der tapfere Syr Armont überlegte: War die wahre Natur der Elfen die der Höflichkeit des Tages oder die der Barbarei der Nacht? Konnte solch bestialische Wut allein durch einen Fluch entstehen?"\\n—Fluch des Werfuchses\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'659cf606-0bcd-44f7-882f-4f633bd56383\', \'multiverseId\': 632549}, \'multiverseid\': 632549}, {\'name\': \'Vidas paralelas\', \'text\': \'Si un efecto fuera a crear una o más fichas bajo tu control, en vez de eso, crea el doble de esa cantidad de fichas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La valiente Syr Armont caviló: ¿cuál era la verdadera naturaleza de los elfos: la civilidad del día o la ferocidad de la noche? ¿Era posible que una fiereza tan salvaje se debiese únicamente a una maldición?".\\n—Maldición de los vulpinos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13a7aff6-a2f2-40eb-9073-f1308ed88b78\', \'multiverseId\': 632612}, \'multiverseid\': 632612}, {\'name\': \'Vies parallèles\', \'text\': \'Si un effet devait créer au moins un jeton sous votre contrôle, il crée deux fois ce nombre de jetons à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le courageux Syr Armont méditait : la véritable nature des elfes résidait-elle dans leur courtoisie diurne ou dans leur sauvagerie nocturne ? Une rage aussi bestiale pouvait-elle n\'être imputée qu\'à une malédiction ? »\\n—Malédiction du renard-garou", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2626a1b-0f5f-4257-a7a3-5199d2e76c94\', \'multiverseId\': 632675}, \'multiverseid\': 632675}, {\'name\': \'Vite Parallele\', \'text\': \'Se un effetto sta per creare una o più pedine sotto il tuo controllo, invece ne crea il doppio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La coraggiosa Syr Armont ponderò: la vera natura degli elfi era riflessa dalla civiltà diurna o dalla barbarie notturna? Poteva un simile furore primordiale essere imputato solamente alla maledizione?"\\n—Maledizione della Volpe Mannara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e16bec3f-019d-4184-80ef-e522a35be49d\', \'multiverseId\': 632738}, \'multiverseid\': 632738}, {\'name\': \'似通った生命\', \'text\': \'効果が、あなたのコントロール下で１つ以上のトークンを生成するなら、代わりにその効果はその２倍の数のそれらのトークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「勇敢なるアーモント卿は考えた。はたしてかのエルフの本性は昼の礼節さにあるのか、それとも夜の野蛮さにあるのか？斯くの如き獣の怒りは、はたしてただ呪いのみでもたらされるものなのだろうか？」\\n――「人狐の呪い」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1adc0b2a-8adf-4c62-9847-aaf8b43adba5\', \'multiverseId\': 632801}, \'multiverseid\': 632801}, {\'name\': \'Vidas Paralelas\', \'text\': \'Se um efeito criaria uma ou mais fichas sob seu controle, em vez disso, ele cria o dobro dessas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A valente Syr Armont refletiu: seria a civilidade diurna ou a selvageria noturna a verdadeira natureza dos elfos? Poderia uma mera maldição conceder uma fúria tão bestial?"\\n— Maldição da Mulher-raposa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7eb318-dd54-47a5-9419-5bfe104f5092\', \'multiverseId\': 632864}, \'multiverseid\': 632864}, {\'name\': \'平行生命\', \'text\': \'如果某效应将在你的操控下派出一个或数个衍生物，则改为它派出两倍数量的该类衍生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「勇敢的娅蒙爵士若有所思：妖精真正的本性到底为何？是白天的谦恭有礼，还是夜晚的凶蛮无道？这等狂野的兽性，难道就只因为诅咒之故？」\\n～《半狐诅咒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7590511b-5683-4074-b07f-d5da93a28d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 632927}, \'multiverseid\': 632927}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianisches Unleben\', \'text\': \'Du verlierst die Partie nicht, indem du 0 oder weniger Lebenspunkte hast.\\nSolange du 0 oder weniger Lebenspunkte hast, wird dir aller Schaden zugefügt, als ob seine Quelle Infizieren hätte. (Schaden wird dir in Form von Giftmarken zugefügt.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Während sich die großen Geister des Reiches über die seltsame Finsternis stritten, fiel Locthwain an die Eindringlinge."\\n—Das letzte Gefecht des Reiches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbd7c185-97ea-4c6d-b5ea-bba4f799e403\', \'multiverseId\': 632502}, \'multiverseid\': 632502}, {\'name\': \'No-vida pirexiana\', \'text\': \'No pierdes el juego por tener 0 o menos vidas.\\nMientras tengas 0 o menos vidas, todo el daño que se te haga se trata como si su fuente tuviera la habilidad de infectar. (El daño se te hace en forma de contadores de veneno.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras las mayores mentes del reino discutían sobre el extraño eclipse, Nimboscuro cayó a manos de sus invasores".\\n—El último bastión del reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e422db53-f473-423f-8478-5449eff066bd\', \'multiverseId\': 632565}, \'multiverseid\': 632565}, {\'name\': \'Non-vie phyrexiane\', \'text\': "Vous ne perdez pas la partie parce que vous avez 0 point de vie ou moins.\\nTant que vous avez 0 point de vie ou moins, toutes les blessures vous sont infligées comme si leur source avait l\'infection. (Les blessures vous sont infligées sous la forme de marqueurs « poison ».)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Tandis que les grands esprits du royaume se querellaient à propos de l\'étrange éclipse, Locthwain succomba aux envahisseurs. »\\n—L\'ultime résistance du Royaume", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632628&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690818de-d0ac-4d24-b0c2-8dec6f6e68b8\', \'multiverseId\': 632628}, \'multiverseid\': 632628}, {\'name\': \'Non Vita di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Non perdi la partita se hai 0 o meno punti vita.\\nFintanto che hai 0 o meno punti vita, tutto il danno ti viene inflitto come se la sua fonte avesse infettare. (Ti viene inflitto danno sotto forma di segnalini veleno.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mentre le grandi menti del reame discutevano della strana eclissi, Loctevenna cadde nelle mani degli invasori."\\n—L\\\'Ultima Resistenza del Reame\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3da8d1e-c410-49c4-9133-bd5422e75d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 632691}, \'multiverseid\': 632691}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの非生\', \'text\': \'あなたはライフが０点以下であることによってはゲームに敗北しない。\\nあなたのライフが０点以下であるかぎり、あなたが受けるすべてのダメージは、それの発生源が感染を持つかのように与えられる。（あなたはダメージを毒カウンターの形で受ける。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「王国の偉大なる賢人たちがこの奇妙な日蝕について論争している間に、ロークスワインは侵略者の前に陥落した。」\\n――「王国の最後の抵抗」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739d0e93-2d5c-4dfc-9f99-806d6bcd3830\', \'multiverseId\': 632754}, \'multiverseid\': 632754}, {\'name\': \'Morte-vida Phyrexiana\', \'text\': \'Você não perde o jogo por ter 0 ou menos pontos de vida.\\nEnquanto você tiver 0 ou menos pontos de vida, todo dano será causado a você como se sua fonte tivesse infectar. (O dano é causado a você na forma de marcadores de veneno.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Enquanto as maiores mentes do reino discutiam o estranho eclipse, Locthwain caiu perante os invasores."\\n— O Confronto Final do Reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8bcd31d-b6b7-4743-b5c9-adc1408c6fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 632817}, \'multiverseid\': 632817}, {\'name\': \'非瑞克西亚体质\', \'text\': \'你不因总生命为0或更少而输掉这盘游戏。\\n只要你的总生命为0或更少，则所有对你造成的伤害均视为其来源具有侵染地造成。（伤害会以中毒指示物的方式对你造成。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「就在世境权威还在为天蚀异象争论不休时，洛司温早已屈从侵攻者。」\\n～《世境末日战》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af6aa254-54c3-45bb-a9b9-8ea6339703aa\', \'multiverseId\': 632880}, \'multiverseid\': 632880}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prismatisches Omen\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen alle Standardlandtypen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Später würden sie Zeit finden, die Verlorenen zu betrauern und um ihre gefallenen Häuser und verlorenen Schätze zu weinen. Aber für den Moment atmeten sie die unverdorbene Luft ein und gestatteten sich, wieder zu hoffen."\\n—Das letzte Gefecht des Reiches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0cb0088-8947-4a8b-b392-bffe781f152b\', \'multiverseId\': 632551}, \'multiverseid\': 632551}, {\'name\': \'Presagio prismático\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas son de todos los tipos de tierra básica además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya habría tiempo de lamentar las pérdidas, de llorar por sus hogares caídos y tesoros perdidos. Por ahora, respiraron el aire puro y se permitieron tener esperanzas de nuevo".\\n—El último bastión del reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'151c552e-bf48-445c-9040-ca485817fda0\', \'multiverseId\': 632614}, \'multiverseid\': 632614}, {\'name\': \'Augure prismatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont chaque type de terrain de base en plus de leurs autres types.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Ils auraient plus tard tout le temps de pleurer les disparus, de se lamenter pour leurs maisons écroulées et leurs trésors perdus. Pour l\'heure, ils respiraient l\'air pur et s\'autorisaient à espérer de nouveau. »\\n—L\'ultime résistance du Royaume", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632677&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813011d0-81cb-4eea-b860-6fed0f0e9e77\', \'multiverseId\': 632677}, \'multiverseid\': 632677}, {\'name\': \'Presagio Prismatico\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno tutti i tipi di terra base in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sarebbe stato tempo in seguito per piangere i caduti, le case vuote e i tesori perduti. Ma per ora, riempirono i polmoni di aria incontaminata e si concessero di sperare ancora."\\n—L\\\'Ultima Resistenza del Reame\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45aa84a-dc91-4020-aa83-60518178ec54\', \'multiverseId\': 632740}, \'multiverseid\': 632740}, {\'name\': \'虹色の前兆\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は、他のタイプに加えてすべての基本土地タイプである。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「死んだ者を悼み、倒れた家や失った財宝に涙流す時間はいずれ来る。だが今この時は、彼らは再び希望を抱くため、穢れなき空気を吸いこんだ。」\\n――「王国の最後の抵抗」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d14ce9-ada6-488b-8263-a0dc1064b2c7\', \'multiverseId\': 632803}, \'multiverseid\': 632803}, {\'name\': \'Agouro Prismático\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm todos os tipos de terreno básico além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Depois haveria tempo para o luto pelos que pereceram, para chorar pelos lares em ruínas e tesouros perdidos. Mas, por enquanto, eles respiravam o ar imaculado e se davam novamente o direito de ter esperança."\\n— O Confronto Final do Reino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eec3d695-7d14-4ed8-9aa8-cf5ae9b193f0\', \'multiverseId\': 632866}, \'multiverseid\': 632866}, {\'name\': \'五彩预兆\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地均额外具有所有基本地类别。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「日后有的是时间来为死难同胞发丧，为失落家园和损失财富落泪。如今是要让生者存于未受污染的空气之下，让他们重燃光复家园的希望。」\\n～《世境末日战》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c37477d6-e5c1-4a81-b4e2-d159ee8e7830\', \'multiverseId\': 632929}, \'multiverseid\': 632929}]', '[{\'name\': \'Resteverwertung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Kreaturenkarte abwirft, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine Länderkarte abwirft, erzeuge {B}{B}.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte abwirft, die weder eine Kreatur noch ein Land ist, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff6362a-107f-4cb0-9f90-f95108bf2836\', \'multiverseId\': 632529}, \'multiverseid\': 632529}, {\'name\': \'Nada se desperdicia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente descarte una carta de criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\\nSiempre que un oponente descarte una carta de tierra, agrega {B}{B}.\\nSiempre que un oponente descarte una carta que no sea criatura o tierra, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7edddc-9d7d-4141-96fd-672b0df119a3\', \'multiverseId\': 632592}, \'multiverseid\': 632592}, {\'name\': "Rien n\'est jamais gâché", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire se défausse d\'une carte de créature, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire se défausse d\'une carte de terrain, ajoutez {B}{B}.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire se défausse d\'une carte non-créature non-terrain, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632655&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'538e88ad-b066-424b-a12c-67b816cf5737\', \'multiverseId\': 632655}, \'multiverseid\': 632655}, {\'name\': \'Nulla Va Sprecato\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario scarta una carta creatura, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario scarta una carta terra, aggiungi {B}{B}.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario scarta una carta non creatura, non terra, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80389cdc-da2f-4895-b8d3-0f965b116cc7\', \'multiverseId\': 632718}, \'multiverseid\': 632718}, {\'name\': \'無駄省き\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がクリーチャー・カード１枚を捨てるたび、あなたは黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n対戦相手が土地・カード１枚を捨てるたび、あなたは{B}{B}を加える。\\n対戦相手がクリーチャーでも土地でもないカード１枚を捨てるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85687efa-c973-410c-8cd5-8fb13c50cb60\', \'multiverseId\': 632781}, \'multiverseid\': 632781}, {\'name\': \'Não Desperdiçar\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente descartar um card de criatura, crie uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2.\\nToda vez que um oponente descartar um card de terreno, adicione {B}{B}.\\nToda vez que um oponente descartar um card não de terreno nem criatura, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f097d84-95e2-4454-9f91-44d9b47feca1\', \'multiverseId\': 632844}, \'multiverseid\': 632844}, {\'name\': \'物尽其用\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手弃一张生物牌时，你派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\\n每当任一对手弃一张地牌时，你加{B}{B}。\\n每当任一对手弃一张非生物且非地的牌时，你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b418c2-1feb-4c5a-afa8-db2d4d3e07b4\', \'multiverseId\': 632907}, \'multiverseid\': 632907}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rhystisches Studium\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {1}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Trotz der Warnungen ihres Vaters wurde Valtrys Faszination für die Oberfläche immer größer. Sie sammelte Dinge, die auf den Grund sanken, und träumte vom Leben an Land."\\n—Die wandelnde Meerfrau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb6143b0-df29-434e-aba4-e93996e01962\', \'multiverseId\': 632516}, \'multiverseid\': 632516}, {\'name\': \'Estudio rístico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, puedes robar una carta a menos que ese jugador pague {1}.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"A pesar de los avisos de su padre, la fascinación de Valtry por la superficie no dejó de aumentar. Coleccionaba los objetos que caían al fondo, soñando con vivir en tierra firme".\\n—La tritona que caminó\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8aff6f7-d56c-4d1e-a768-11ddc3b13d49\', \'multiverseId\': 632579}, \'multiverseid\': 632579}, {\'name\': \'Étude rhystique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, vous pouvez piocher une carte à moins que ce joueur ne paie {1}.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Malgré les mises en garde de son père, Valtry éprouvait une fascination de plus en plus importante pour le monde de la surface. Elle collectionnait les objets qui avaient sombré au fond de l\'eau, rêvant d\'une vie sur terre. »\\n—L\'ondine qui marchait", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632642&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d02e4ae-d4b5-486f-b389-5788aca58108\', \'multiverseId\': 632642}, \'multiverseid\': 632642}, {\'name\': \'Studio Ristico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, puoi pescare una carta a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {1}.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nonostante gli avvertimenti del padre, l\\\'attrazione di Valtry per la superficie non faceva che crescere. Collezionava ciò che cadeva sul fondale, sognando la vita sulla terra."\\n—La Tritona che Camminò\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07241fda-0c65-414b-8670-47fe698aa255\', \'multiverseId\': 632705}, \'multiverseid\': 632705}, {\'name\': \'リスティックの研究\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が呪文１つを唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「父親の警告にもかかわらず、ヴァルトリィの地上への飽くなき興味は強くなるばかりだった。彼女は水底に沈んできた物を集め、地上での生活を夢見た。」\\n――「歩み来たマーフォーク」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89bc701f-8c6e-4f74-8588-47c3077ebd6e\', \'multiverseId\': 632768}, \'multiverseid\': 632768}, {\'name\': \'Estudo Rístico\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente conjura uma mágica, você pode comprar um card, a menos que aquele jogador pague {1}.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A despeito dos avisos do pai, a fascinação de Valtry com a superfície só crescia. Ela colecionava coisas que caíam até as profundezas, sonhando acordada com a vida na terra."\\n— A Tritã que Caminhou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c91ed98-4685-4278-9242-c1e33b0cba10\', \'multiverseId\': 632831}, \'multiverseid\': 632831}, {\'name\': \'琉晶研究\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手施放咒语时，除非该牌手支付{1}，否则你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「虽屡遭父亲劝止，但瓦翠对陆地却越发向往。她不停收集落入湖底的东西，不断想象水面上的生活风貌。」\\n～《长脚的人鱼》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938ce793-53e8-45e1-a0b8-a5c2043edbaf\', \'multiverseId\': 632894}, \'multiverseid\': 632894}]', "[{'name': 'Ritterehre', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Ritterehre ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Wachsamkeit.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632499&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e470da59-c418-4cf0-9543-05926dad83a9', 'multiverseId': 632499}, 'multiverseid': 632499}, {'name': 'Valor de caballero', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Valor de caballero entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632562&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2251290a-0523-429f-a1fe-83ab78bd91ec', 'multiverseId': 632562}, 'multiverseid': 632562}, {'name': 'Valeur chevaleresque', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la Valeur chevaleresque arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a la vigilance.', 'type': 'Enchantement — aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632625&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdf7bfb5-9415-416b-868f-96b2ef17883b', 'multiverseId': 632625}, 'multiverseid': 632625}, {'name': 'Valore Cavalleresco', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nQuando il Valore Cavalleresco entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha cautela.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632688&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dadb186c-dc16-4c82-a9bf-36e33c50c001', 'multiverseId': 632688}, 'multiverseid': 632688}, {'name': '騎士の勇気', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n騎士の勇気が戦場に出たとき、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け警戒を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632751&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '440ea932-d00e-4c16-8934-911601431e88', 'multiverseId': 632751}, 'multiverseid': 632751}, {'name': 'Heroísmo Cavaleiroso', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Heroísmo Cavaleiroso entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Cavaleiro branca 2/2 com vigilância.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem vigilância.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632814&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16df6a33-7d65-4350-a5f3-a9568594fc79', 'multiverseId': 632814}, 'multiverseid': 632814}, {'name': '骑士骁勇', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当骑士骁勇进战场时，派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有警戒异能。', 'type': '结界 — 灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632877&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '616d68af-dcd0-43cd-b72b-144b12c7b7fc', 'multiverseId': 632877}, 'multiverseid': 632877}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schleichangriff\', \'text\': \'{R}: Du kannst eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen. Die Kreatur erhält Eile. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Korlag bereitete sich sorgfältig darauf vor, die neue ‚Hinter halt\\\'-Strategie auszuprobieren, von der er gehört hatte."\\n—Die Rache des Ogers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd2d2a2e-661a-4aa6-8c30-d4884023e572\', \'multiverseId\': 632541}, \'multiverseid\': 632541}, {\'name\': \'Ataque a hurtadillas\', \'text\': \'{R}: Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de criatura de tu mano. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifica la criatura al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Korlag se preparó cuidadosamente para probar la nueva estrategia de \\\'en-boscada\\\' de la que tanto oyó hablar".\\n—La revancha del ogro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbca125-cce2-4749-88d2-9c4913eb5ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 632604}, \'multiverseid\': 632604}, {\'name\': \'Attaque furtive\', \'text\': \'{R} : Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature de votre main. Cette créature acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez la créature au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Korlag s\\\'était méticuleusement préparé à tester la nouvelle stratégie de coup "fourré" dont il avait entendu parler. »\\n—La revanche de l\\\'ogre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632667&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de700161-c0e5-4184-9c88-3a6b26590e73\', \'multiverseId\': 632667}, \'multiverseid\': 632667}, {\'name\': \'Attacco a Sorpresa\', \'text\': "{R}: Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura dalla tua mano. Quella creatura ha rapidità. Sacrifica la creatura all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Korlag si era preparato con cura per provare questa nuova strategia chiamata \\\'in boscaglia\\\' di cui aveva sentito parlare."\\n—La Vendetta dell\\\'Ogre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56604ee3-14e0-479f-8bc7-6d876252babc\', \'multiverseId\': 632730}, \'multiverseid\': 632730}, {\'name\': \'騙し討ち\', \'text\': \'{R}：あなたの手札にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。そのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「コルラグは話に聞いた、新たな戦略『木襲』を試みるべく、細心に準備を進めていた。」\\n――「オーガの仕返し」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adda15aa-5b57-4930-8e1f-33fb6df3fbff\', \'multiverseId\': 632793}, \'multiverseid\': 632793}, {\'name\': \'Ataque Surpresa\', \'text\': \'{R}: Você pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de criatura de sua mão. Aquela criatura ganha ímpeto. Sacrifique a criatura no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Korlag preparou-se cuidadosamente para experimentar aquela estratégia nova de \\\'ficar na moita\\\', da qual tinha ouvido falar."\\n— A vingança do Ogro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f68cfb0-244a-4c7a-a3d5-0c52a0f268c0\', \'multiverseId\': 632856}, \'multiverseid\': 632856}, {\'name\': \'偷袭\', \'text\': \'{R}：你可以将一张生物牌从你手上放进战场。该生物获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，牺牲该生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「寇葛精心准备，迫不及待地想要尝试他新听到的『伏棘』妙计。」\\n～《食人魔复仇记》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc0f11d-e4fd-42b8-a75a-1768f23fc660\', \'multiverseId\': 632919}, \'multiverseid\': 632919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stichwunde\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -2/-2.\\nZu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des Beherrschers der verzauberten Kreatur verliert jener Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Was zunächst wie eine lächerliche und vage erniedrigende Aufgabe aussah, verwandelte sich schnell in einen erbitterten Kampf ums Überleben."\\n—Willkommen in Süßholzen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa10be70-96bb-466f-aab1-cac134a105b2\', \'multiverseId\': 632527}, \'multiverseid\': 632527}, {\'name\': \'Puñalada\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene -2/-2.\\nAl comienzo del mantenimiento del controlador de la criatura encantada, ese jugador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que al principio parecía una tarea ridícula y algo humillante se convirtió rápidamente en una lucha acalorada por la supervivencia".\\n—Bienvenidos a Villadulces\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a04ead-c999-43b9-b3b9-489d42f7e08b\', \'multiverseId\': 632590}, \'multiverseid\': 632590}, {\'name\': "Blessure d\'arme blanche", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne -2/-2.\\nAu début de l\'entretien du contrôleur de la créature enchantée, ce joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': "« Ce qui lui avait d\'abord semblé n\'être qu\'une tâche ridicule un tantinet dévalorisante dégénéra bientôt en une lutte acharnée pour la survie. »\\n—Bienvenue à Dentcariée", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632653&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbf7910-5802-4727-a2bb-3d036fc847d1\', \'multiverseId\': 632653}, \'multiverseid\': 632653}, {\'name\': \'Ferita da Pugnale\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende -2/-2.\\nAll\'inizio del mantenimento del controllore della creatura incantata, quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che inizialmente era sembrato un compito ridicolo e vagamente degradante divenne presto una feroce lotta per la sopravvivenza."\\n—Benvenuti a Saccarosia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4bf260c-bcf3-474e-8176-c52d8f991952\', \'multiverseId\': 632716}, \'multiverseid\': 632716}, {\'name\': \'刺し傷\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーのコントローラーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「初めは滑稽で、あたかも己を卑しめる作業のように思えた任務が、生き残るための酷薄な闘争だとすぐに判明した。」\\n――「甘歯村へようこそ」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'527ec248-a5ed-409a-bb0b-143a2ff4b74c\', \'multiverseId\': 632779}, \'multiverseid\': 632779}, {\'name\': \'Ferimento de Estocada\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe -2/-2.\\nNo início da manutenção do controlador da criatura encantada, aquele jogador perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"O que a princípio parecera uma tarefa ridícula e vagamente aviltante se transformou rapidamente numa feroz batalha pela sobrevivência."\\n— Boas-vindas à Docelândia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcc410f9-f645-4c6f-99cc-cf5a97dacb0d\', \'multiverseId\': 632842}, \'multiverseid\': 632842}, {\'name\': \'刺创伤\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得-2/-2。\\n在所结附的生物之操控者的维持开始时，该牌手失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「起初看似荒唐丢脸的无谓任务，很快就变成了尔虞我诈的求生之争。」\\n～《甘饴村迎客》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88cd0960-13c3-4409-b054-886c18acd9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 632905}, \'multiverseid\': 632905}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todespakt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, opfert jeder andere Spieler eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Ihr Narren\\\', spottete die Hexe. ‚Ich hatte nie die Absicht, hier lebend davonzukommen. Und dank eurer Beharrlichkeit, mir zu folgen, werdet ihr es auch nicht.\\\'"\\n—Die Hexen von Düstermoor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65609800-169b-43b5-aa85-dfabdf12e849\', \'multiverseId\': 632520}, \'multiverseid\': 632520}, {\'name\': \'Pacto de las sepulturas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas muera, cada otro jugador sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"—¡Insensatos! —profirió la bruja—. Nunca fue mi intención irme de aquí con vida. Y gracias a su testaruda insistencia en seguirme, ustedes tampoco lo harán".\\n—Maldiciones del Túmulo Pardo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6088609-00ae-4276-af0a-583799e92b67\', \'multiverseId\': 632583}, \'multiverseid\': 632583}, {\'name\': \'Pacte de la tombe\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque autre joueur sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« "Imbéciles, ricana la sorcière. Je n\\\'ai jamais eu l\\\'intention de repartir d\\\'ici vivante. Et grâce à votre insistance à me suivre, vous ne repartirez pas non plus." »\\n—Maléfices de Tertrebrun\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632646&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116a3c44-6716-4d68-a1f5-4736c17f2f85\', \'multiverseId\': 632646}, \'multiverseid\': 632646}, {\'name\': \'Patto Sepolcrale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, ogni altro giocatore sacrifica una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Stolti\\\', esclamò la strega. \\\'Non avevo intenzione di salvarmi. E grazie alla vostra caparbia insistenza nel seguirmi, condividerete il mio stesso fato.\\\'"\\n—Anatemi di Tumulo Grigio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61187d44-b25c-4068-bf9a-307f5009f47f\', \'multiverseId\': 632709}, \'multiverseid\': 632709}, {\'name\': \'墓穴までの契約\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなた以外の各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「『愚か者めが。』魔女は嘲笑った。『わしは、ここを生きて出ようとは思うとらなんだわい。そして執念深くつけ狙ってきたがゆえに、おぬしもまた生きては戻れぬと言うわけじゃ。』」\\n――「ダンバロウの呪い」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f62e67e2-22bb-49e6-9de8-cf318c4396c3\', \'multiverseId\': 632772}, \'multiverseid\': 632772}, {\'name\': \'Pacto da Sepultura\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla morre, cada um dos outros jogadores sacrifica uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Idiotas\\\', zombou a bruxa. Minha intenção nunca foi sair daqui viva. E, graças a essa insistência turrona em me seguir, nem vocês sairão.\\\'"\\n— Bruxarias de Tumbagris\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee19b10-f19d-4ee4-abaa-578d7024589a\', \'multiverseId\': 632835}, \'multiverseid\': 632835}, {\'name\': \'墓约\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，每位其他牌手各牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「『蠢货，』巫婆冷笑道。『我从没想过要活着离开这里。既然你们都已死死跟了过来，那就都别走。』」\\n～《黯沼野邪咒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e5fa544-888a-4842-9462-830baa82b296\', \'multiverseId\': 632898}, \'multiverseid\': 632898}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unangreifbare Tugend\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und haben Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Finde Ruhm weder durch getötete Drachen noch Blut,\\nsondern durch Freundlichkeit und Mut."\\n—„Die Gelehrte und die Ritterin"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632497&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'876f7944-cb98-4683-8d2d-647fb5b25dec\', \'multiverseId\': 632497}, \'multiverseid\': 632497}, {\'name\': \'Virtud intangible\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Encuentra la gloria, pero no en sangre ni dragones caídos,\\nsino en amabilidad compartida y juramentos cumplidos".\\n—"La erudita y la caballero"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76ec21d-cc11-4d3a-a382-b1a1f5737a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 632560}, \'multiverseid\': 632560}, {\'name\': \'Vertu intangible\', \'text\': \'Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Trouvez la gloire ni dans la chute des dragons ni dans le sang,\\nMais par des actes de bonté et le respect des serments. »\\n—« L\'Érudit et le Chevalier »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632623&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c13255-2968-4612-89eb-bec7cc8d5344\', \'multiverseId\': 632623}, \'multiverseid\': 632623}, {\'name\': \'Virtù Intoccabile\', \'text\': \'Le pedine creatura che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno cautela.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Trova la gloria non nel sangue versato o nel drago caduto,\\nMa nella gentilezza donata e nel giuramento onorato."\\n—"L\\\'Allieva e la Cavaliera"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5627922-b282-459d-b94f-4924f045ba9a\', \'multiverseId\': 632686}, \'multiverseid\': 632686}, {\'name\': \'無形の美徳\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「栄光を見いだすは流血にあらず、竜どもを屠りしことにもあらず。\\n仁愛を惜しまず、誓いを守ることにこそ栄光はある。」\\n――「学士と騎士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356dff6a-4859-49ec-aab3-7f9df8611c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 632749}, \'multiverseid\': 632749}, {\'name\': \'Virtude Intangível\', \'text\': \'As fichas de criatura que você controla recebem +1/+1 e têm vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Encontre a glória não no sangue, nem em dragões abatidos,\\nmas nos atos de bondade e nos juramentos cumpridos."\\n— "A Erudita e o Cavaleiro"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b70a46-4e67-4f59-9c4c-b580f91c4cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 632812}, \'multiverseid\': 632812}, {\'name\': \'无形美善\', \'text\': \'由你操控的衍生生物得+1/+1且具有警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「勿以杀伐屠龙争虚名，\\n试凭守誓行善见品行。」\\n～「学者与骑士」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61f19715-4d22-4b91-bf55-62ca93758433\', \'multiverseId\': 632875}, \'multiverseid\': 632875}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unnatürliches Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Kampfes verdoppelst du bis zum Ende des Zuges Stärke und Widerstandskraft jeder Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Hörst du die Hexenjäger heulen,\\nVerstecke dich oder suche das Weite.\\nSie jagen Hexen und keine Eulen.\\nFürchte das Raubtier und seine Beute."\\n—Durch die Wildnis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'382df8f6-5654-4c6c-a4a6-f6de395b3755\', \'multiverseId\': 632553}, \'multiverseid\': 632553}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento antinatural\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada combate, duplica la fuerza y la resistencia de cada criatura que controlas hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Si escuchas a los acechabrujas aullar,\\ndebes esconderte o escapar.\\nBuscan brujas, viles y malvadas.\\nPero cazador y presa son amenazas fundadas".\\n—Atravesar las tierras salvajes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df0aab8-edb1-4f69-9ae7-5c650da528c8\', \'multiverseId\': 632616}, \'multiverseid\': 632616}, {\'name\': \'Croissance surnaturelle\', \'text\': "Au début de chaque combat, doublez la force et l\'endurance de chaque créature que vous contrôlez jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Si tu entends hurler les pisteurs de sorcières,\\nLe temps presse : fuis ou cache-toi.\\nIls les traquent jusque dans leurs chaumières.\\nCrains aussi bien les prédateurs que leur proie. »\\n—Promenade dans les friches\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc1caf82-5886-48e2-9e19-10d2e488c9e5\', \'multiverseId\': 632679}, \'multiverseid\': 632679}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Innaturale\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni combattimento, raddoppia la forza e la costituzione di ogni creatura che controlli fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se senti i braccastreghe ululare,\\nNasconditi o corri via.\\nPredatore e preda devi temere,\\nCacciano le streghe e la loro magia.\\n—Attraversare le Terre Selvagge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43a0345-10a3-4e18-ae18-a84ef88e95d6\', \'multiverseId\': 632742}, \'multiverseid\': 632742}, {\'name\': \'不自然な成長\', \'text\': \'各戦闘の開始時に、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーのパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ２倍になる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「魔女跡追いの咆哮が聞こえたならば、\\n隠れるか逃げるが一番だ。\\nやつらは邪悪でおぞましい魔女を狩る。\\n狩る者と狩られる者、その両者を怖れることだ。」\\n――「僻境の歩き方」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe00928b-5e04-4070-85c4-e3e750ca2f88\', \'multiverseId\': 632805}, \'multiverseid\': 632805}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Antinatural\', \'text\': \'No início de cada combate, dobre o poder e a resistência de cada criatura que você controla até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Se farejadores de bruxa uivarem,\\nÉ melhor correr e se esconder.\\nApesar de bruxas vis caçarem,\\nPredador e presa é bom temer."\\n— Percorrer as Terras Selvagens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70899aca-8a27-4962-b606-4f1e5e52b2c1\', \'multiverseId\': 632868}, \'multiverseid\': 632868}, {\'name\': \'超凡成长\', \'text\': \'在每次战斗开始时，将每个由你操控之生物的力量和防御力均加倍直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「猎巫狼群一声吼，\\n赶忙躲起快逃走。\\n猎杀巫婆下狠手，\\n猎人猎物见了愁。」\\n～《幻野游记》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a34fb7-a80e-4298-a67a-237362fa37d7\', \'multiverseId\': 632931}, \'multiverseid\': 632931}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterdrückung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch wirkt, wirft jener Spieler eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Die Welt der Menschen wird untergehen\\\', flüsterte die monströse Ratte. ‚Du hast nur eine Entscheidung zu treffen: Willst du mit ihr untergehen?\\\'"\\n—Lied des Ungeziefers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632523&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad87124-a8d4-466b-8e3b-66fb810364a4\', \'multiverseId\': 632523}, \'multiverseid\': 632523}, {\'name\': \'Opresión\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo, ese jugador descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"—El mundo de los humanos caerá —susurró la monstruosa rata—. Solo tienes una decisión que tomar: ¿caerás con él?".\\n—Canción de la alimaña\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2346e314-5886-4cdc-a4fc-26d36a51fb4c\', \'multiverseId\': 632586}, \'multiverseid\': 632586}, {\'name\': \'Oppression\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort, ce joueur se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« "Le monde des humains tombera, murmura le rat monstrueux. Vous n\\\'avez qu\\\'un seul choix devant vous : tomberez-vous avec lui ?" »\\n—Chant de la vermine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632649&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb9707f5-7890-4a80-be43-302ac072fb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 632649}, \'multiverseid\': 632649}, {\'name\': \'Oppressione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia, quel giocatore scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Il mondo degli umani cadrà\\\', sussurrò il ratto mostruoso. \\\'Non ti resta che compiere una scelta: Cadrai con esso?\\\'"\\n—Canto dei Parassiti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ded3bffc-6a85-4426-9ed1-f8e1ec575f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 632712}, \'multiverseid\': 632712}, {\'name\': \'抑圧\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人が呪文１つを唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「『人の世は滅びる。』化け物ネズミは囁いた。『お主にできる選択はただ一つ。お主も共に滅びるか否か。』」\\n――「害獣の歌」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c00ba42f-8df8-46aa-b251-858501b37467\', \'multiverseId\': 632775}, \'multiverseid\': 632775}, {\'name\': \'Opressão\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica, aquele jogador descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'O mundo humano cairá\\\', sussurrou o rato monstruoso. Você tem uma única escolha a fazer: você cairá com ele?\\\'"\\n— Canção da Praga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cccd4e58-06e8-4239-96fb-a8b4fe0a7b80\', \'multiverseId\': 632838}, \'multiverseid\': 632838}, {\'name\': \'压制\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手施放咒语时，该牌手弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「『人界将亡，』硕鼠低语。『你只需作一个选择：是否要随之一同毁灭？』」\\n～《病媒魔曲》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0081970a-b873-421e-bfca-27241ac042c6\', \'multiverseId\': 632901}, \'multiverseid\': 632901}]', "[{'name': 'Urkraft des Lebens', 'text': 'Falls ein oder mehrere Spielsteine erzeugt würden, werden stattdessen doppelt so viele solcher Spielsteine erzeugt.\\nFalls eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur gelegt würden, werden stattdessen doppelt so viele +1/+1-Marken auf sie gelegt.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632550&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '611ac383-3684-485c-b91c-8e4483e07a71', 'multiverseId': 632550}, 'multiverseid': 632550}, {'name': 'Vigor primitivo', 'text': 'Si se fueran a crear una o más fichas, en vez de eso, se crea el doble de esa cantidad de fichas.\\nSi fueran a ponerse uno o más contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura, en vez de eso, se pone el doble de esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre esa criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632613&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c62d229a-5ac0-49f6-abc2-7e2c5fef9ae8', 'multiverseId': 632613}, 'multiverseid': 632613}, {'name': 'Vigueur primordiale', 'text': 'Si au moins un jeton devait être créé, deux fois ce nombre de jetons sont créés à la place.\\nSi au moins un marqueur +1/+1 devait être mis sur une créature, mettez deux fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur cette créature à la place.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632676&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51f2c4a0-91cb-4217-85dc-2fd9252575f9', 'multiverseId': 632676}, 'multiverseid': 632676}, {'name': 'Vigore Primordiale', 'text': 'Se una o più pedine stanno per essere create, invece ne vengono create il doppio.\\nSe uno o più segnalini +1/+1 stanno per essere messi su una creatura, invece ne vengono messi il doppio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632739&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34f2e10b-e39b-4975-8973-993a2c2b32fd', 'multiverseId': 632739}, 'multiverseid': 632739}, {'name': '野生の活力', 'text': '１つ以上のトークンが生成されるなら、代わりにその２倍の数のそのトークンを生成する。\\nクリーチャー１体の上に１個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれるなら、代わりにそのクリーチャーの上に、その個数の２倍の個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632802&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c671c6b2-acbc-402b-8981-771b13cb22a4', 'multiverseId': 632802}, 'multiverseid': 632802}, {'name': 'Vigor Primordial', 'text': 'Se uma ou mais fichas seriam criadas, em vez disso, é criado o dobro daquela quantidade de fichas.\\nSe um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 seriam colocados em uma criatura, em vez disso, será colocado naquela criatura o dobro daquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632865&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82c1b655-0036-4266-a6d2-c372324f8937', 'multiverseId': 632865}, 'multiverseid': 632865}, {'name': '原初活力', 'text': '如果将派出一个或数个衍生物，则改为派出两倍数量的该类衍生物。\\n如果将在某生物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物，则改为在该生物上放置该数量两倍的+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632928&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d044d2f-9cfa-495c-94ef-b1a81e354c68', 'multiverseId': 632928}, 'multiverseid': 632928}]", '[{\'name\': \'Utopia-Ausbreitung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Wald\\nSowie die Utopia-Ausbreitung ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Wald für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher ein zusätzliches Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e4008d9-7496-42ea-96c8-aadbcfb7316b\', \'multiverseId\': 632554}, \'multiverseid\': 632554}, {\'name\': \'Expansión utópica\', \'text\': \'Encantar Bosque.\\nEn cuanto la Expansión utópica entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nSiempre que se gire el Bosque encantado para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un maná adicional del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b2883ea-52b5-4db7-b9a0-d9a6af80143f\', \'multiverseId\': 632617}, \'multiverseid\': 632617}, {\'name\': "Étendue de l\'utopie", \'text\': "Enchanter : forêt\\nAu moment où l\'Étendue de l\'utopie arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nÀ chaque fois que la forêt enchantée est engagée pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute un mana supplémentaire de la couleur choisie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632680&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e9b4bf-f3d8-4748-ba46-f56993bf3768\', \'multiverseId\': 632680}, \'multiverseid\': 632680}, {\'name\': "Propagazione dell\'Utopia", \'text\': "Incanta Foresta\\nMentre la Propagazione dell\'Utopia entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nOgniqualvolta la Foresta incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge un mana addizionale del colore scelto.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31a3d5d-6a50-4b9f-b252-4f4b49488b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 632743}, \'multiverseid\': 632743}, {\'name\': \'楽園の拡散\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（森）\\n楽園の拡散が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\nエンチャントしている森がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加でその選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3079808-c5bd-418d-a84a-e27504dbc26b\', \'multiverseId\': 632806}, \'multiverseid\': 632806}, {\'name\': \'Propagação da Utopia\', \'text\': \'Encantar Floresta\\nConforme Propagação da Utopia entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor.\\nToda vez que a Floresta encantada é virada para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona um mana extra da cor escolhida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'503da37c-867f-4b76-a6c7-428dd73362e8\', \'multiverseId\': 632869}, \'multiverseid\': 632869}, {\'name\': \'理想境蔓生\', \'text\': \'结附于树林\\n于理想境蔓生进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n每当横置所结附的树林以产生法术力时，其操控者额外加一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23109da-e389-423d-808c-5bae82f1fdb3\', \'multiverseId\': 632932}, \'multiverseid\': 632932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vampirische Riten\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, opfere eine Kreatur: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sollte jemand ohne Einladung das Ritual beobachten, ergreift sie für den Kessel und tränkt den Altar mit ihrem Blut."\\n—Der Weg der Hexe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3485f70a-2cda-4387-9546-4c089c2b9bb7\', \'multiverseId\': 632528}, \'multiverseid\': 632528}, {\'name\': \'Ritos vampíricos\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrificar una criatura: Ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"En caso de que ojos fisgones presencien el ritual, échalos al caldero e impregna el altar con la sangre de los testigos".\\n—Los métodos de la bruja\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0947b21-32cf-4a3a-999d-cffa97f5d567\', \'multiverseId\': 632591}, \'multiverseid\': 632591}, {\'name\': \'Sacres vampiriques\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrifiez une créature : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Si des yeux fouineurs observent le rituel, jetez-les dans le chaudron, et répandez le sang du témoin sur l\'autel. »\\n—La voie de l\'envoûteuse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632654&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3327930-4e4b-4280-989e-b5709a0c1374\', \'multiverseId\': 632654}, \'multiverseid\': 632654}, {\'name\': \'Riti Vampirici\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Sacrifica una creatura: Guadagni 1 punto vita e peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se occhi indiscreti si posano sul rituale, afferrateli per il calderone e imbibite l\\\'altare col sangue del testimone."\\n—La Via della Strega\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b88af7-c94d-4be4-93a1-922dd2e6cf08\', \'multiverseId\': 632717}, \'multiverseid\': 632717}, {\'name\': \'吸血の儀式\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは１点のライフを得、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「儀式を見た者の両目を抉り、大釜に放り込め。そしてその目撃者の血で祭壇を染めるのだ。」\\n――「魔女の道」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c57588f-3bfe-4fa9-a35a-30c52dd50bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 632780}, \'multiverseid\': 632780}, {\'name\': \'Ritos Vampíricos\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrifique uma criatura: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida e compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Se porventura olhos bisbilhoteiros observarem o ritual, arranque-os e jogue no caldeirão, e encharque o altar com o sangue das testemunhas."\\n— Os Ensinamentos da Bruxa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c158f02-d23f-4610-987c-04d052ba46d1\', \'multiverseId\': 632843}, \'multiverseid\': 632843}, {\'name\': \'吸血鬼仪式\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，牺牲一个生物：你获得1点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「若有人胆敢偷看仪式，就将他们丢入锅中，用他们的鲜血来浸洗祭坛。」\\n～《巫婆之道》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813c96d1-a4c3-40e6-8ec2-a57e4bfc40f4\', \'multiverseId\': 632906}, \'multiverseid\': 632906}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verschmutzte Verbindungen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Land unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt, verliert jener Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es war die grausamste aller Ironien: Das Reich, das dringend der Ruhe bedurfte, wurde von endlosem Schlaf ergriffen, der keine Erholung bot."\\n—Der Böse Schlummer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72b8d7b6-7b73-4582-b5c4-427a682252d2\', \'multiverseId\': 632525}, \'multiverseid\': 632525}, {\'name\': \'Vínculos polucionados\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, ese jugador pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue la más cruel de todas las ironías: el reino, que necesitaba desesperadamente un descanso, se sumió en un sueño interminable que no ofrecía reposo alguno".\\n—El Sueño embrujado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdf44019-666f-4082-a540-3e33d9e85b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 632588}, \'multiverseid\': 632588}, {\'name\': \'Liens pollués\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, ce joueur perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était la plus cruelle des ironies : le royaume, qui avait désespérément besoin de repos, était en proie à un sommeil éternel qui n\'offrait aucun réconfort. »\\n—Le Sommeil maléfique", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632651&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38d9326b-0927-4453-bf61-ec2e91903144\', \'multiverseId\': 632651}, \'multiverseid\': 632651}, {\'name\': \'Legami Inquinati\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario, quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Era la più crudele delle ironie: il reame, in disperato bisogno di riposo, avvolto in un sonno senza fine che non offriva alcun conforto."\\n—Il Sonno Stregato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebc04861-7269-40d6-ada1-5ba49e762f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 632714}, \'multiverseid\': 632714}, {\'name\': \'穢れた結合\', \'text\': \'土地１つが対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「それは残酷すぎる皮肉でした。死にものぐるいで休息を求めていた王国が、なんの安らぎももたらさない永遠の眠りに囚われたのです。」\\n――「忌まわしき眠り」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dedeb673-212e-4a52-b0c3-e32f6958a1ca\', \'multiverseId\': 632777}, \'multiverseid\': 632777}, {\'name\': \'Elos Poluídos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente, aquele jogador sofre 2 pontos de dano e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Era a mais cruel das ironias: o reino, desesperadamente necessitado de descanso, nas garras de um sono interminável que não oferecia nenhum conforto."\\n— O Sono Maldito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f99567-4186-4660-ab26-b7b2190ad790\', \'multiverseId\': 632840}, \'multiverseid\': 632840}, {\'name\': \'污物羁绊\', \'text\': \'每当一个地在对手操控下进战场时，该牌手失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「这真是一个莫大的讽刺：世境虽亟需休养生息，但却困于无尽沉眠中不得安宁。」\\n～《恶邪倦眠咒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4556b45-632e-467d-9e07-01b346b90c49\', \'multiverseId\': 632903}, \'multiverseid\': 632903}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verteidigung des Herzens\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner drei oder mehr Kreaturen kontrolliert, opfere die Verteidigung des Herzens, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Und als die Rose zu blühen begann, begann der Fluch von Burg Rotzahn endlich zu verwelken."\\n—Fluch des Werfuchses\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe74bbd5-c98c-451e-a7fa-928c093926dd\', \'multiverseId\': 632542}, \'multiverseid\': 632542}, {\'name\': \'Defensa del corazón\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si un oponente controla tres o más criaturas, sacrifica la Defensa del corazón, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de criatura, pon esas cartas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Y cuando la rosa comenzó a florecer, la maldición de la fortaleza de Dienterrojo empezó, al fin, a desvanecerse".\\n—Maldición de los vulpinos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e53f17-81fc-4a59-94dd-242ef806b368\', \'multiverseId\': 632605}, \'multiverseid\': 632605}, {\'name\': \'Défense du cœur de la forêt\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si un adversaire contrôle au moins trois créatures, sacrifiez la Défense du cœur de la forêt, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Et lorsque la rose commença à éclore, la malédiction de Croc-rouge commença, enfin, à se flétrir. »\\n—Malédiction du renard-garou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632668&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a46dd277-738c-4458-9d8b-efd99ee16258\', \'multiverseId\': 632668}, \'multiverseid\': 632668}, {\'name\': \'Difesa del Cuore\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se un avversario controlla tre o più creature, sacrifica la Difesa del Cuore, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte creatura, metti quelle carte sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mentre la rosa sbocciava, la maledizione di Fortezza Zannarossa iniziò, finalmente, ad appassire."\\n—Maledizione della Volpe Mannara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be5b151a-a7a9-4dc3-ae8d-0566e6d3e273\', \'multiverseId\': 632731}, \'multiverseid\': 632731}, {\'name\': \'中心部の防衛\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人が３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたは中心部の防衛を生け贄に捧げ、あなたのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「そして、薔薇のつぼみが膨らみ始めるにつれ、赤歯砦の呪いも、ついには衰え始めたのである。」\\n――「人狐の呪い」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c35745-db7f-488c-a878-3e764cd59e13\', \'multiverseId\': 632794}, \'multiverseid\': 632794}, {\'name\': \'Defesa do Coração\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se um oponente controlar três ou mais criaturas, sacrifique Defesa do Coração, procure até dois cards de criatura em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"E, quando a rosa começou a desabrochar, a maldição da Bastilha de Rubrodente começou, por fim, a definhar."\\n— Maldição da Mulher-raposa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'990e39c0-0c06-4824-82b2-39fa3208a327\', \'multiverseId\': 632857}, \'multiverseid\': 632857}, {\'name\': \'心防\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若某对手操控三个或更多生物，则牺牲心防，从你牌库中搜寻至多两张生物牌，将这些牌放进在战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「随着玫瑰逐渐绽放，赤牙砦下的诅咒方才慢慢褪去。」\\n～《半狐诅咒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d096bf7d-a82a-4c92-9d06-1bb0fda0184c\', \'multiverseId\': 632920}, \'multiverseid\': 632920}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verzauberungskopie\', \'text\': \'Du kannst die Verzauberungskopie als Kopie einer beliebigen Verzauberung im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Ich brauche niemand anderen\\\', murmelte Hylda. ‚Du brauchst niemand anderen\\\', stimmte ihr Spiegelbild zu."\\n—Die Hexe des Winters\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f6aa34-fac0-4529-a224-25945f42c3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 632507}, \'multiverseid\': 632507}, {\'name\': \'Encantamiento copia\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Encantamiento copia entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier encantamiento en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"―No necesito a nadie más ―murmuró Hylda.\\n―No necesitas a nadie más ―corroboró su reflejo".\\n—La bruja del invierno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'512846f4-8a23-4d06-85fe-507345576488\', \'multiverseId\': 632570}, \'multiverseid\': 632570}, {\'name\': "Copie d\'enchantement", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que la Copie d\'enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quel enchantement sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« "Je n\\\'ai besoin de personne d\\\'autre", murmura Hylda. "Tu n\\\'as besoin de personne d\\\'autre", acquiesça son reflet. »\\n—La sorcière de l\\\'hiver\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632633&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3642f19f-84b7-4c6e-88c0-001c2e0e0534\', \'multiverseId\': 632633}, \'multiverseid\': 632633}, {\'name\': \'Copia Incantesimo\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare Copia Incantesimo nel campo di battaglia come una copia di un qualsiasi incantesimo sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Non ho bisogno di nessun altro\\\', disse Hylda. \\\'Non hai bisogno di nessun altro\\\', affermò il suo riflesso."\\n—La Strega dell\\\'Inverno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4fe8e4f-ec04-467a-b33a-9728802e77bd\', \'multiverseId\': 632696}, \'multiverseid\': 632696}, {\'name\': \'エンチャント複製\', \'text\': \'あなたはエンチャント複製を、戦場にあるエンチャント１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「『私は、もう誰も必要としない。』ヒルダは呟きました。『あなたは、もう誰も必要としない。』彼女の鏡像は応えました。」\\n――「冬の魔女」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a11b2c15-682e-43ed-8814-e8f73e462dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 632759}, \'multiverseid\': 632759}, {\'name\': \'Cópia de Encantamento\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Cópia de Encantamento entre no campo de batalha como uma cópia de qualquer encantamento no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Eu não preciso de mais ninguém\\\', murmurou Hylda. Você não precisa de mais ninguém\\\', concordou o reflexo."\\n— Bruxa do Inverno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4eb0a6-2c07-4682-9697-1cfa5cfcd87f\', \'multiverseId\': 632822}, \'multiverseid\': 632822}, {\'name\': \'复制结界\', \'text\': \'你可以使复制结界当成战场上任一结界的复制品来进入战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「『我不需要其他人，』希尔妲低声自语。『你不需要其他人，』镜中影像随声附和。」\\n～《凛冬女巫传》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63af48b0-9e9c-48d8-b63b-cd0590d0960c\', \'multiverseId\': 632885}, \'multiverseid\': 632885}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wie vorhergesagt\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du eine Zeitmarke auf Wie vorhergesagt.\\nEinmal pro Zug kannst du {0} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten eines Zauberspruchs mit Manabetrag X oder weniger, den du wirkst, zu bezahlen, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Zeitmarken auf Wie vorhergesagt ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632505&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887a531e-b5ad-46fd-bd81-6794c6d838b0\', \'multiverseId\': 632505}, \'multiverseid\': 632505}, {\'name\': \'Según la profecía\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador de tiempo sobre Según la profecía.\\nUna vez por turno, puedes pagar {0} en vez de pagar el coste de maná de un hechizo que lances con valor de maná de X o menos, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de tiempo sobre Según la profecía.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752440c5-baa2-42ab-ad0c-69980077d48a\', \'multiverseId\': 632568}, \'multiverseid\': 632568}, {\'name\': \'Conforme à la prédiction\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur « temps » sur Conforme à la prédiction.\\nUne fois par tour, vous pouvez payer {0} à la place du coût de mana d\'un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X que vous lancez, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « temps » sur Conforme à la prédiction.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632631&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a310daa-4bbc-4ef5-af02-a518efa5f43e\', \'multiverseId\': 632631}, \'multiverseid\': 632631}, {\'name\': \'Come Predetto\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino tempo su Come Predetto.\\nUna volta per turno, puoi pagare {0} invece di pagare il costo di mana di una magia che lanci con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X, dove X è il numero di segnalini tempo su Come Predetto.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b986f8-b3fb-4b62-a4a6-400c698cfcb0\', \'multiverseId\': 632694}, \'multiverseid\': 632694}, {\'name\': \'予言により\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、予言によりの上に時間カウンター１個を置く。\\n毎ターン１回、あなたはマナ総量がＸ以下である呪文１つを、それのマナ・コストではなく{0}を支払って唱えてもよい。Ｘは予言によりの上にある時間カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1344ba23-b554-4d7f-8124-654949c18015\', \'multiverseId\': 632757}, \'multiverseid\': 632757}, {\'name\': \'Como Predito\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador temporal em Como Predito.\\nUma vez a cada turno, você pode pagar {0} em vez de pagar o custo de mana de uma mágica que você conjurar com valor de mana igual ou inferior a X, sendo X o número de marcadores temporais em Como Predito.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0599bc6e-48e7-4e7c-9729-ca93cce6cbf5\', \'multiverseId\': 632820}, \'multiverseid\': 632820}, {\'name\': \'预示成真\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，在预示成真上放置一个计时指示物。\\n限每回合一次，你施放法术力值等于或小于X的咒语时，可以支付{0}，而不支付其法术力费用，X为预示成真上的计时指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471b83a3-d8b8-4dee-8436-4df8952f2233\', \'multiverseId\': 632883}, \'multiverseid\': 632883}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wille der Natur\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, tappe alle Länder, die jener Spieler kontrolliert und enttappe alle Länder, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Troll hielt das Zögern der Faune für Angst und brüllte triumphierend. In Wahrheit hatten sie gesehen, dass der Fels unter seinem Gewicht zu bröckeln begann."\\n—Die Gänsemutter und andere Märchen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99af852d-cfa1-46f3-a2e4-a268f45b92c0\', \'multiverseId\': 632548}, \'multiverseid\': 632548}, {\'name\': \'Voluntad de la naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, gira todas las tierras que controla ese jugador y endereza todas las tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El trol interpretó el titubeo de los faunos como miedo y rugió a modo de celebración. En realidad, estaban viendo cómo la cornisa se resquebraja bajo el peso de su oponente".\\n—La mamá gansa y otros cuentos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37256128-3757-440b-8adb-2f59c04f9ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 632611}, \'multiverseid\': 632611}, {\'name\': \'Volonté de la nature\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une des créatures que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, engagez tous les terrains que ce joueur contrôle et dégagez tous les terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le troll prit l\'hésitation des faunes pour de la peur et rugit triomphalement. En fait, ils avaient remarqué que la corniche était sur le point de céder sous son poids. »\\n—La mère l\'oie et autres contes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632674&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c332849-39f8-48d5-9a2e-df10214cf2d3\', \'multiverseId\': 632674}, \'multiverseid\': 632674}, {\'name\': \'Volontà della Natura\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, TAPpa tutte le terre controllate da quel giocatore e STAPpa tutte le terre che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il troll interpretò l\\\'esitazione dei fauni come paura e ruggì trionfante. In realtà avevano notato la rupe cedere sotto il suo peso."\\n—Mamma Oca e Altri Racconti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2330e51a-eddd-4f75-aa07-a51f4d455fea\', \'multiverseId\': 632737}, \'multiverseid\': 632737}, {\'name\': \'自然の意志\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているすべての土地をタップし、あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「トロールは、ためらうフォーンたちを怯えていると見て、勝利の雄叫びをあげた。そのフォーンたちは、岩棚がトロールの重さでひび割れつつあるのを見ていた。」\\n――「ガチョウの母」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcc1ca50-7f70-485e-9b2e-2e3b1f7bd2a8\', \'multiverseId\': 632800}, \'multiverseid\': 632800}, {\'name\': \'Vontade da Natureza\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que você controla causarem dano de combate a um jogador, vire todos os terrenos que aquele jogador controla e desvire todos os terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O trol achou que a hesitação dos faunos era medo, e rugiu triunfante. Na verdade, eles haviam visto que a beirada começara a rachar com o peso dele."\\n— A Mamãe Ganso e Outras Histórias\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbc37293-11e5-4523-8041-1e9a297a804e\', \'multiverseId\': 632863}, \'multiverseid\': 632863}, {\'name\': \'大自然之愿\', \'text\': \'每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，横置所有由该牌手操控的地并重置所有由你操控的地。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「巨魔见羊怪行动迟缓，觉得自己已经威服对方，不禁发出胜利怒号。然而，羊怪是看到巨魔脚下岩石不堪重压开始崩裂，才没有轻举妄动。」\\n～《鹅鹅妈故事集》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93163f05-6415-413e-9ee9-e69f296323d3\', \'multiverseId\': 632926}, \'multiverseid\': 632926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wucht des Aufpralls\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt die Wucht des Aufpralls jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit Tränen in den rauchverschmierten Augen sah er zu, wie die lebenden Flammen das einzige Zuhause verzehrten, das er je gekannt hatte."\\n—Die Torheit des Lehrlings\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632535&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7bcf3ab-6448-4050-a5e3-13bdc4ef29f6\', \'multiverseId\': 632535}, \'multiverseid\': 632535}, {\'name\': \'Temblores del impacto\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, los Temblores del impacto hacen 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Con lágrimas en los ojos debido al ardiente humo, presenció cómo las llamas vivientes consumían el único lugar al que llamaba hogar".\\n—La necedad del aprendiz\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20878dfe-6ac4-4201-ba7f-10ad6f5ecda3\', \'multiverseId\': 632598}, \'multiverseid\': 632598}, {\'name\': "Secousses d\'impact", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les Secousses d\'impact infligent 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les yeux brûlés par la fumée et embués de larmes, il regarda les flammes consumer le seul foyer qu\'il avait jamais connu. »\\n—La folie de l\'apprenti", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632661&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236907f2-6631-44f3-a3c1-acb94e3a51f0\', \'multiverseId\': 632661}, \'multiverseid\': 632661}, {\'name\': "Sussulti dell\'Impatto", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, i Sussulti dell\'Impatto infliggono 1 danno a ogni avversario.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Con lacrime che solcavano il suo viso ricoperto di cenere, guardò le fiamme viventi consumare l\\\'unica casa che avesse mai conosciuto."\\n—La Follia dell\\\'Apprendista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9103827-9efa-451d-aa80-71186e3b5642\', \'multiverseId\': 632724}, \'multiverseid\': 632724}, {\'name\': \'衝撃の震え\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、衝撃の震えは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「彼は目を灼く煙で涙を流しつつ、生ける炎が彼の知る唯一つの故郷を焼き尽くすのを見ていた。」\\n――「見習いの愚行」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3aaf09f-2dc5-4b6b-b63d-7932c5f9eb5b\', \'multiverseId\': 632787}, \'multiverseid\': 632787}, {\'name\': \'Tremores de Impacto\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Tremores de Impacto causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Com lágrimas nos olhos calcinados pela fumaça, ele viu as chamas vivas consumirem o único lar que tivera."\\n— A Tolice do Aprendiz\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce98297-9a04-454a-83b0-0cda8d502503\', \'multiverseId\': 632850}, \'multiverseid\': 632850}, {\'name\': \'冲击震颤\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，冲击震颤向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「他被浓烟熏得泪水直流，只能眼睁睁地看着活体火焰将他所知的唯一家园烧个精光。」\\n～《学徒闯大祸》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befad0dc-a0f2-458e-ab3f-5c6c84f30508\', \'multiverseId\': 632913}, \'multiverseid\': 632913}]', "[{'name': 'Zeit der Verdopplung', 'text': 'Falls ein Effekt einen oder mehrere Spielsteine unter deiner Kontrolle erzeugen würde, erzeugt er stattdessen doppelt so viele solcher Spielsteine.\\nFalls ein Effekt eine oder mehrere Marken auf eine bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, legen würde, legt er stattdessen doppelt so viele solcher Marken auf die bleibende Karte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632543&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c513e947-c8ed-414a-b6ff-826d015f6b5b', 'multiverseId': 632543}, 'multiverseid': 632543}, {'name': 'Temporada duplicadora', 'text': 'Si un efecto fuera a crear una o más fichas bajo tu control, en vez de eso, crea el doble de esa cantidad de fichas.\\nSi un efecto fuera a poner uno o más contadores sobre un permanente que controlas, en vez de eso, pone el doble de esa cantidad de contadores sobre ese permanente.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632606&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5c498b8-18ab-4c57-8a26-7bae30419f29', 'multiverseId': 632606}, 'multiverseid': 632606}, {'name': 'Saison de dédoublement', 'text': 'Si un effet devait créer au moins un jeton sous votre contrôle, il crée deux fois ce nombre de jetons à la place.\\nSi un effet devait mettre au moins un marqueur sur un permanent que vous contrôlez, il met deux fois ce nombre de marqueurs sur ce permanent à la place.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632669&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9ec5b48-892c-4e73-9f31-d3dabe150d43', 'multiverseId': 632669}, 'multiverseid': 632669}, {'name': 'Stagione del Raddoppio', 'text': 'Se un effetto sta per creare una o più pedine sotto il tuo controllo, invece ne crea il doppio.\\nSe un effetto sta per mettere su un permanente che controlli uno o più segnalini, invece ne mette il doppio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632732&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee28fdf7-ece7-44c1-804e-8471a465a240', 'multiverseId': 632732}, 'multiverseid': 632732}, {'name': '倍増の季節', 'text': '効果が、あなたのコントロール下で１つ以上のトークンを生成するなら、代わりにその効果はその２倍の個数のそれらのトークンを生成する。\\n効果が、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの上に１個以上のカウンターを置くなら、代わりにその効果はそのパーマネントの上にその２倍の数のそれらのカウンターを置く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632795&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43817ea1-db77-4cb7-bc16-090ab590bd9a', 'multiverseId': 632795}, 'multiverseid': 632795}, {'name': 'Temporada da Multiplicação', 'text': 'Se um efeito criaria uma ou mais fichas sob seu controle, em vez disso, ele cria o dobro dessas fichas.\\nSe um efeito colocaria um ou mais marcadores em uma permanente que você controla, em vez disso, ele coloca o dobro desses marcadores naquela permanente.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632858&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '579a72c2-fe39-4e86-8835-67b7804de445', 'multiverseId': 632858}, 'multiverseid': 632858}, {'name': '倍产旺季', 'text': '如果某效应将在你的操控下派出一个或数个衍生物，则改为它派出两倍数量的该类衍生物。\\n如果某效应将在由你操控的永久物上放置一个或数个指示物，则改为在该永久物上放置两倍数量的该类指示物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632921&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e350aeb-5996-491b-8fcb-0263d1d9d642', 'multiverseId': 632921}, 'multiverseid': 632921}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zeit des Wachstums\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, als Ziel hat, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1176489e-ce3c-4845-9b7b-83bd2918fb25\', \'multiverseId\': 632552}, \'multiverseid\': 632552}, {\'name\': \'Estación de crecimiento\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, adivina 1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo a una criatura que controlas, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6184858-709b-4882-a945-9e9337fcce9d\', \'multiverseId\': 632615}, \'multiverseid\': 632615}, {\'name\': \'Saison de croissance\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, regard 1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible une créature que vous contrôlez, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'368e63f4-85f5-419e-a0ad-7d3e4feb392b\', \'multiverseId\': 632678}, \'multiverseid\': 632678}, {\'name\': \'Stagione della Crescita\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, profetizza 1.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia una creatura che controlli, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7e22d7-390b-4588-b16f-70f6cc78bd78\', \'multiverseId\': 632741}, \'multiverseid\': 632741}, {\'name\': \'成長の季節\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、占術１を行う。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーを対象とする呪文１つをあなたが唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54f1e7df-0d90-4ce7-9195-09f227a11a62\', \'multiverseId\': 632804}, \'multiverseid\': 632804}, {\'name\': \'Temporada de Crescimento\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, use vidência 1.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica que tenha uma criatura que você controla como alvo, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'848dedbf-ae24-485c-806d-68073b7e27e8\', \'multiverseId\': 632867}, \'multiverseid\': 632867}, {\'name\': \'成长季节\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，占卜1。\\n每当你施放以由你操控之生物为目标的咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc4523dd-2425-4be0-9f79-b8b56d89f5b1\', \'multiverseId\': 632930}, \'multiverseid\': 632930}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zersetzung des Verstandes\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nZu Beginn jedes Endsegments millt der verzauberte Spieler X Karten, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten ist, die in diesem Zug von irgendwoher auf seinen Friedhof gelegt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sah, wie sich mein Geist wie Stoff auf einem Webstuhl streckte,\\nSich verzerrte, einem todlosen Untergang entgegenreckte."\\n—Die Prüfungen eines Reisenden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632510&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a6178c-c05f-4c9e-8e85-fe5c1160fc5d\', \'multiverseId\': 632510}, \'multiverseid\': 632510}, {\'name\': \'Cordura desvanecida\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nAl comienzo de cada paso final, el jugador encantado muele X cartas, donde X es la cantidad de cartas que fueron a su cementerio desde cualquier parte este turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'"Vi cómo mi mente se estiraba cual tela en un telar,\\ntensándose y revolviéndose hacia una perdición singular".\\n—Las pruebas de un viajante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8d555ec-bf38-4398-bf8e-7160be4ddfaf\', \'multiverseId\': 632573}, \'multiverseid\': 632573}, {\'name\': \'Lucidité effilochée\', \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nAu début de chaque étape de fin, le joueur enchanté meule X cartes, X étant le nombre de cartes mises dans son cimetière d\'où qu\'elles viennent ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai vu mon esprit s\'étirer comme du fil sur un métier à tisser,\\nVers un destin immortel, il se déformait et s\'entortillait. »\\n—Les anicroches d\'un voyageur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632636&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'028ac302-73c8-4c69-a980-9e67f2978e89\', \'multiverseId\': 632636}, \'multiverseid\': 632636}, {\'name\': \'Strappare il Senno\', \'text\': "Incanta giocatore\\nAll\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, il giocatore incantato macina X carte, dove X è il numero di carte messe nel suo cimitero da qualsiasi zona in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'"Come stoffa sul telaio vidi la mia mente allungarsi,\\nVerso una fine senza morte contorcersi e deformarsi."\\n—I Perigli di un Viaggiatore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea59697-e1ad-41a4-ad34-279cac59dfdd\', \'multiverseId\': 632699}, \'multiverseid\': 632699}, {\'name\': \'正気減らし\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\n各終了ステップの開始時に、エンチャントしているプレイヤーはカードＸ枚を切削する。Ｘは、このターンにいずこかからそのプレイヤーの墓地に置かれたカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'「私は自分の心が手織り機に掛かる布のように引き延ばされるのを見た。\\n死すらも終わりとならぬ破滅へと、歪み、よじれてゆくのを見た。」\\n――「とある旅人の試練」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e6bbf9-f4e2-499f-8631-4de7dfbe41b2\', \'multiverseId\': 632762}, \'multiverseid\': 632762}, {\'name\': \'Sanidade Corroída\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nNo início de cada etapa final, o jogador encantado tritura X cards, sendo X o número de cards colocados no cemitério dele vindos de qualquer lugar neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vi minha mente esticada como tecido no tear,\\ntorcendo e distorcendo, mas sem morte, a me arruinar."\\n— As Provações do Viajante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8137de4c-1c12-43af-bc53-034bb40b4c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 632825}, \'multiverseid\': 632825}, {\'name\': \'崩碎心智\', \'text\': \'结附于牌手\\n在每个结束步骤开始时，所结附的牌手磨X张牌，X为本回合中从任何区域进入其坟墓场之牌的数量。\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'「在我眼前，自身思绪如织机上的滚动缕线，\\n拉伸扭曲，缓缓扯向死气沉沉的无尽黯涧。」\\n～《旅人渡劫记》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdf43a91-609b-4f07-b167-3726c22070b6\', \'multiverseId\': 632888}, \'multiverseid\': 632888}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überbelegter Friedhof\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls sich vier oder mehr Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof befinden, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Raus! Raus!\\\', schrien die Toten. ‚Wir haben keinen Platz mehr, für niemanden! Raus!\\\'"\\n—Die Hexen von Düstermoor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'007f22d4-dc56-4239-b102-d2cee1c81d87\', \'multiverseId\': 632524}, \'multiverseid\': 632524}, {\'name\': \'Cementerio sobrevendido\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si tienes cuatro o más cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, puedes regresar la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"—¡Fuera! ¡Fuera! —gritaron los muertos—. ¡No hay sitio para nadie más! ¡Fuera!".\\n—Maldiciones del Túmulo Pardo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5b5ea66-c713-4dda-bdf5-997032281d05\', \'multiverseId\': 632587}, \'multiverseid\': 632587}, {\'name\': \'Cimetière surpeuplé\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si vous avez au moins quatre cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, vous pouvez renvoyer dans votre main une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« "Partez ! Partez !" vociférèrent les morts. "Nous n\\\'avons plus de place pour personne ! Partez !" »\\n—Maléfices de Tertrebrun\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632650&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ec3eb9-9173-4973-898e-08e9c7d3223e\', \'multiverseId\': 632650}, \'multiverseid\': 632650}, {\'name\': \'Cimitero Sovrappopolato\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se hai quattro o più carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, puoi riprendere in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Vattene! Vattene!\\\' urlarono i morti. \\\'Non abbiamo spazio per nessun altro! Vattene!\\\'"\\n—Anatemi di Tumulo Grigio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df84ac0f-42c4-4c86-bde5-ffa56fbb4699\', \'multiverseId\': 632713}, \'multiverseid\': 632713}, {\'name\': \'定員過剰の墓地\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地に４枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがある場合、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「『出て行け！出て行け！』死者は叫んだ。『ここはもう満員だ！出て行ってしまえ！』」\\n――「ダンバロウの呪い」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db9e0f8-37bb-43e4-9455-87c2e3d30644\', \'multiverseId\': 632776}, \'multiverseid\': 632776}, {\'name\': \'Cemitério Lotado\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você tiver quatro ou mais cards de criatura em seu cemitério, você pode devolver o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Sai! Sai!\\\', gritaram os mortos. Aqui não cabe mais ninguém, não! Sai!\\\'"\\n— Bruxarias de Tumbagris\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6353bc36-27dc-480d-8652-18f9e5f33161\', \'multiverseId\': 632839}, \'multiverseid\': 632839}, {\'name\': \'超卖墓园\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若你坟墓场中有四张或更多生物牌，则你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「『滚出去！滚出去！』亡者嚷道。『已经没位了！滚出去！』」\\n～《黯沼野邪咒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d654e1ee-0b4c-419f-9523-52b279b9b531\', \'multiverseId\': 632902}, \'multiverseid\': 632902}]', "[{'name': 'ネクロポーテンス', 'text': 'あなたのドロー・ステップを飛ばす。\\nあなたがカード１枚を捨てるたび、あなたの墓地にあるそのカードを追放する。\\n１点のライフを支払う：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を裏向きに追放する。次のあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632419&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce4718e4-2a8a-4897-aa96-24e9261d2d68', 'multiverseId': 632419}, 'multiverseid': 632419}]", "[{'name': 'リスティックの研究', 'text': '対戦相手１人が呪文１つを唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632416&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c5192a8-5b40-4c90-a91c-b10468e30383', 'multiverseId': 632416}, 'multiverseid': 632416}]", "[{'name': '中心部の防衛', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人が３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、中心部の防衛を生け贄に捧げ、あなたのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632425&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '375751fc-9dba-4636-b1b6-07964f14f967', 'multiverseId': 632425}, 'multiverseid': 632425}]", "[{'name': '予言により', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、予言によりの上に時間カウンター１個を置く。\\n毎ターン１回、あなたはマナ総量がＸ以下である呪文１つを、それのマナ・コストではなく{0}を支払って唱えてもよい。Ｘは予言によりの上にある時間カウンターの個数に等しい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632413&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e14d0148-a5cd-4fec-9280-18185d48bf1e', 'multiverseId': 632413}, 'multiverseid': 632413}]", "[{'name': '似通った生命', 'text': '効果が、あなたのコントロール下で１つ以上のトークンを生成するなら、代わりにその効果はその２倍の数のそれらのトークンを生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632428&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c352fab3-ee31-4dc5-b021-a29f91251681', 'multiverseId': 632428}, 'multiverseid': 632428}]", "[{'name': '倍増の季節', 'text': '効果が、あなたのコントロール下で１つ以上のトークンを生成するなら、代わりにその効果はその２倍の数のそれらのトークンを生成する。\\n効果が、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの上に１個以上のカウンターを置くなら、代わりにその効果はそのパーマネントの上にその２倍の数のそれらのカウンターを置く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632426&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96beb278-831d-4fb7-a32d-5f8830dda44e', 'multiverseId': 632426}, 'multiverseid': 632426}]", "[{'name': '偉大なるオーラ術', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのエンチャントは被覆を持つ。（被覆を持つパーマネントは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてオーラがついているすべてのクリーチャーは被覆を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632409&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e458a715-a309-4bf9-ac3a-1087366df6ec', 'multiverseId': 632409}, 'multiverseid': 632409}]", "[{'name': '全知', 'text': 'あなたは、あなたの手札から呪文を、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632415&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b159a91d-f159-4001-af02-cf2d48538695', 'multiverseId': 632415}, 'multiverseid': 632415}]", "[{'name': '反動', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体がダメージを受けるたび、反動はそのクリーチャーのコントローラーにその点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632423&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e77fa155-c4c4-4898-bdb6-caa3937edb05', 'multiverseId': 632423}, 'multiverseid': 632423}]", "[{'name': '同族の発見', 'text': '同族の発見が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるクリーチャー１体が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632414&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d734f1f-9a6b-4047-82c8-f1adf4ba31bc', 'multiverseId': 632414}, 'multiverseid': 632414}]", "[{'name': '土地税', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632411&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a20f5c67-6667-45e3-a4b1-6b36921b707f', 'multiverseId': 632411}, 'multiverseid': 632411}]", "[{'name': '墓穴までの契約', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなた以外の各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632418&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '176b659c-444a-4a7b-b70a-29530ece2e83', 'multiverseId': 632418}, 'multiverseid': 632418}]", "[{'name': '息詰まる徴税', 'text': '対戦相手１人がカード１枚を引くたび、そのプレイヤーは{2}を支払ってもよい。そのプレイヤーがそうしないなら、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632412&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a67449cf-dea4-450e-ab06-da956d2c402a', 'multiverseId': 632412}, 'multiverseid': 632412}]", "[{'name': '穢れた結合', 'text': '土地１つが対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632420&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de45641b-09d4-4d7d-99db-687a57f2477d', 'multiverseId': 632420}, 'multiverseid': 632420}]", "[{'name': '自然の意志', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているすべての土地をタップし、あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地をアンタップする。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632427&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acd4f940-f067-4985-9982-14ddeaf59ad2', 'multiverseId': 632427}, 'multiverseid': 632427}]", "[{'name': '苦花', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは１点のライフを失い、飛行を持つ黒の１/１のフェアリー・ならず者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '部族・エンチャント — フェアリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632417&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a096dc6b-43f3-408c-a368-d9e45235fc4a', 'multiverseId': 632417}, 'multiverseid': 632417}]", "[{'name': '血染めの月', 'text': '基本でないすべての土地は山である。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632422&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00f1eed4-e903-48ae-8ef1-24eba08dd804', 'multiverseId': 632422}, 'multiverseid': 632422}]", "[{'name': '追い討ち', 'text': '{3}{R}{R}：あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。このメイン・フェイズの後に、追加の戦闘フェイズ１つと、それの後に追加のメイン・フェイズ１つを加える。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632421&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '531cdb20-b19e-46fd-bd56-1f228b940291', 'multiverseId': 632421}, 'multiverseid': 632421}]", "[{'name': '霊体の正義', 'text': '対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力が、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないパーマネント１つを破壊するたび、その対戦相手がコントロールしているパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたは、それを破壊してもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632410&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f7a5166-35f8-4754-8279-9da9e3e3b3dd', 'multiverseId': 632410}, 'multiverseid': 632410}]", "[{'name': '騙し討ち', 'text': '{R}：あなたの手札にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。そのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=632424&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4df4902f-e3f1-4784-ba6e-fea4d721b4e0', 'multiverseId': 632424}, 'multiverseid': 632424}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ANB', 'BBD', 'BCHR', 'BFZ', 'BIG', 'BRB', 'C13', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CHR', 'CLB', 'CM1', 'CM2', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CNS', 'DBL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DIS', 'DKM', 'DMR', 'DRK', 'DTK', 'E02', 'EMA', 'EXO', 'F03', 'FBB', 'G10', 'G11', 'GK2', 'GPT', 'GRN', 'GTC', 'HA2', 'HA5', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IMA', 'ISD', 'J12', 'J16', 'J18', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LEG', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'M10', 'M11', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MD1', 'ME1', 'ME2', 'ME3', 'MH2', 'MID', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMA', 'MOC', 'MOR', 'MP2', 'NCC', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONC', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'P22', 'PAKH', 'PCLB', 'PCY', 'PGRN', 'PHOU', 'PIP', 'PKTK', 'PLST', 'PM19', 'PM20', 'PM21', 'PMID', 'PRM', 'PRNA', 'PTC', 'PUMA', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REN', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'SCD', 'SHM', 'SLC', 'SLD', 'SS2', 'STH', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSR', 'UDS', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'USG', 'V09', 'VMA', 'WC03', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOT', 'ZEN']
original_text: ['As Kindred Discovery enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nWhenever a creature you control of the chosen type enters the battlefield or attacks, draw a card.', 'At the beginning of each combat, double the power and toughness of each creature you control until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you gained 3 or more life this turn, create a 2/2 white Griffin creature token with flying.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for up to three basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls three or more creatures, sacrifice Defense of the Heart, search your library for up to two creature cards, put those cards onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have four or more creature cards in your graveyard, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a time counter on As Foretold.\\nOnce each turn, you may pay {0} rather than pay the mana cost for a spell you cast with mana value X or less, where X is the number of time counters on As Foretold.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You lose life equal to its mana value.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life and create a 1/1 black Faerie Rogue creature token with flying.', 'Creature tokens you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.', "Creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.\\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield, untap all creatures.", 'Enchant Forest\\nAs Utopia Sprawl enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nWhenever enchanted Forest is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of the chosen color.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-2.\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player loses 2 life.", 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Dragon Mantle enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted creature has "{R}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Knightly Valor enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance.\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has vigilance.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', 'Enchant land\\nWhen Spreading Seas enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted land is an Island.', 'Enchant player\\nAt the beginning of each end step, enchanted player mills X cards, where X is the number of cards put into their graveyard from anywhere this turn.', 'Extort (Whenever you cast a spell, you may pay {WB}. If you do, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain that much life.)\\nArtifacts and creatures your opponents control enter the battlefield tapped.', 'If Leyline of Abundance is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield.\\nWhenever you tap a creature for mana, add an additional {G}.\\n{6}{G}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', 'If Leyline of Anticipation is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield.\\nYou may cast spells as though they had flash.', 'If Leyline of Lightning is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield.\\nWhenever you cast a spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, Leyline of Lightning deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'If Leyline of Sanctity is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield.\\nYou have hexproof.', "If Leyline of the Void is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield.\\nIf a card would be put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead.", 'If a source you control would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals triple that damage to that permanent or player instead.', 'If an effect would create one or more tokens under your control, it creates twice that many of those tokens instead.', 'If an effect would create one or more tokens under your control, it creates twice that many of those tokens instead.\\nIf an effect would put one or more counters on a permanent you control, it puts twice that many of those counters on that permanent instead.', 'If one or more +1/+1 counters would be put on a creature you control, that many plus one +1/+1 counters are put on it instead.', 'If one or more tokens would be created, twice that many of those tokens are created instead.\\nIf one or more +1/+1 counters would be put on a creature, twice that many +1/+1 counters are put on that creature instead.', 'Lands you control are every basic land type in addition to their other types.', 'Nonbasic lands are Mountains.', "Other enchantments you control have shroud. (A permanent with shroud can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nEnchanted creatures you control have shroud.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Goblin Bombardment deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Skip your draw step.\\nWhenever you discard a card, exile that card from your graveyard.\\nPay 1 life: Exile the top card of your library face down. Put that card into your hand at the beginning of your next end step.', "When Garruk's Uprising enters the battlefield, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, draw a card.\\nCreatures you control have trample.\\nWhenever a creature with power 4 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.", 'When Grasp of Fate enters the battlefield, for each opponent, exile up to one target nonland permanent that player controls until Grasp of Fate leaves the battlefield.', "When Ground Seal enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nCards in graveyards can't be the targets of spells or abilities.", 'When Hatching Plans is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw three cards.', 'When Rest in Peace enters the battlefield, exile all graveyards.\\nIf a card or token would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, Impact Tremors deals 1 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, scry 1.\\nWhenever you cast a spell that targets a creature you control, draw a card.', "Whenever a creature is dealt damage, Repercussion deals that much damage to that creature's controller.", 'Whenever a creature you control attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each other attacking creature that shares a creature type with it.', 'Whenever a creature you control dies, each other player sacrifices a creature.', 'Whenever a creature you control with power 2 or less attacks, Raid Bombardment deals 1 damage to the player or planeswalker that creature is attacking.', "Whenever a land enters the battlefield under an opponent's control, that player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.", 'Whenever a player casts a spell, that player discards a card.', 'Whenever a player taps a land for mana, that player adds one mana of any type that land produced.', 'Whenever a spell or ability an opponent controls destroys a noncreature permanent you control, you may destroy target permanent that opponent controls.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, that player draws seven cards.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, you may draw a card unless that player pays {1}.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a creature card, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\\nWhenever an opponent discards a land card, add {B}{B}.\\nWhenever an opponent discards a noncreature, nonland card, draw a card.', "Whenever an opponent draws a card, that player may pay {2}. If the player doesn't, you create a Treasure token.", 'Whenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, tap all lands that player controls and untap all lands you control.', 'Whenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.\\n{3}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', "You don't lose the game for having 0 or less life.\\nAs long as you have 0 or less life, all damage is dealt to you as though its source had infect. (Damage is dealt to you in the form of poison counters.)", 'You may cast spells from your hand without paying their mana costs.', 'You may have Copy Enchantment enter the battlefield as a copy of any enchantment on the battlefield.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{1}{U}, Discard a card: Draw a card.\\n{1}{U}, Sacrifice Compulsion: Draw a card.', '{3}{R}{R}: Untap all creatures you control. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{3}{R}{R}: Untap all creatures you control. If it's a main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{R}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. That creature gains haste. Sacrifice the creature at the beginning of the next end step.']
original_type: ['Enchantment', 'Enchantment — Aura', 'Enchantment — Aura Curse', 'Tribal Enchantment — Faerie']
